msgid ":ref:`Payment <ecommerce/checkout/payment>`"
msgstr ":ref:`Pago <ecommerce/checkout/payment>`"

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/checkout.rst:159
msgid ":ref:`Order confirmation <ecommerce/checkout/order_confirmation>`"
msgstr ""
":ref:`Confirmación de la orden <ecommerce/checkout/order_confirmation>`"

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/checkout.rst:163
msgid ""
"Each step can be customized using the website editor by "
"adding :doc:`building blocks <../website/web_design/building_blocks>` or "
"opening the :guilabel:`Style` tab to enable various checkout options."
msgstr ""
"Puedes personalizar cada paso con el editor de sitios web si "
"agregas :doc:`bloques de creación <../website/web_design/building_blocks>` o "
"si abres la pestaña :guilabel:`Estilo` para habilitar varias opciones del "
"proceso de pago."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/checkout.rst:168
msgid "Content added through building blocks is **specific** to each step."
msgstr ""
"El contenido que se agregue con bloques de creación es **específico** de "
"cada paso."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/checkout.rst:171
msgid ""
"Restrict access to the :ref:`shop <ecommerce/customer_accounts/shop-access>` "
"and :ref:`checkout <ecommerce/customer_accounts/checkout-access>` for "
"specific customers, e.g., in a :doc:`B2B <../ecommerce/configuration/"
"b2b_b2c>` business setup."
msgstr ""
"Restringe el acceso a la :ref:`tienda <ecommerce/customer_accounts/shop-"
"access>` y al :ref:`proceso de pago <ecommerce/customer_accounts/checkout-"
"access>` a clientes específicos, por ejemplo, en una configuración para un "
"negocio :doc:`B2B <../ecommerce/configuration/b2b_b2c>`."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/checkout.rst:178
msgid "Order summary"
msgstr "Resumen de la orden"

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/checkout.rst:180
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`Order summary` step allows customers to see the items they "
"added to their cart, adjust quantities, :guilabel:`Remove` products, "
"and :ref:`reorder products from a previous order <ecommerce/checkout/"
"reorder>`. Information on product prices and the taxes applied is also "
"displayed. Customers can then click the :guilabel:`Checkout` :icon:`fa-"
"chevron-right` button to continue to the :ref:`Address <ecommerce/checkout/"
"delivery>` step."
msgstr ""
"El paso de :guilabel:`resumen de la orden` permite que los clientes vean los "
"artículos que agregaron a su carrito, ajusten las "
"cantidades, :guilabel:`eliminen` productos y :ref:`vuelvan a pedir productos "
"de una orden anterior <ecommerce/checkout/reorder>`. También muestra la "
"información relacionada con los precios de los productos y los impuestos "
"aplicados. Luego, los clientes pueden hacer clic en el "
"botón :guilabel:`Pagar`:icon:`fa-chevron-right` para continuar al "
"paso :ref:`Dirección <ecommerce/checkout/delivery>`."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/checkout.rst:186
msgid ""
"Open the website editor to :ref:`enable <ecommerce/checkout/"
"customize_steps>` checkout options such as:"
msgstr ""
"Abra el editor de sitio web para :ref:`activar <ecommerce/checkout/"
"customize_steps>` las opciones de pago como:"

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/checkout.rst:189
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Suggested Accessories`: to showcase :ref:`accessory products "
"<ecommerce/products/cross_upselling>`;"
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Accesorios sugeridos`: Para mostrar :ref:`productos accesorios "
"<ecommerce/products/cross_upselling>`."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/checkout.rst:191
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Promo Code`: to allow customers to redeem :ref:`gift cards "
"<ewallet_gift/gift-cards>` and apply :doc:`discount codes <../../sales/sales/"
"products_prices/loyalty_discount>` or :ref:`promotional codes <ecommerce/"
"prices/promotional-code>`;"
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Código promocional`: Para permitir que los clientes "
"canjeen :ref:`tarjetas de regalo <ewallet_gift/gift-cards>` y "
"apliquen :doc:`códigos de descuento <../../sales/sales/products_prices/"
"loyalty_discount>` o :ref:`códigos promocionales <ecommerce/prices/"
"promotional-code>`."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/checkout.rst:194
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Add to Wishlist`: :ref:`Enable wishlists <ecommerce/products/"
"additional_features/wishlists>` to allow signed-in users to remove a product "
"from their cart and add it to their wishlist using the :guilabel:`Save for "
"Later` option."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Agregar a la lista de deseos`: :ref:`Habilita las listas de "
"deseos <ecommerce/products/additional_features/wishlists>` para permitir que "
"los usuarios que hayan iniciado sesión eliminen un producto de su carrito y "
"lo agreguen a su lista de deseos con la opción :guilabel:`Guardar para "
"después`."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/checkout.rst:199
msgid ""
"If a :doc:`fiscal position <../../finance/accounting/taxes/"
"fiscal_positions>` is detected automatically, the product tax is determined "
"based on the customer's IP address."
msgstr ""
"Si el sistema detecta una :doc:`posición fiscal <../../finance/accounting/"
"taxes/fiscal_positions>` de forma automática, la dirección IP del cliente "
"determinará el impuesto del producto."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/checkout.rst:201
msgid ""
"If the installed :doc:`payment provider <../../finance/payment_providers>` "
"supports :ref:`express checkout <payment_providers/express_checkout>`, a "
"dedicated button is displayed, allowing customers to go straight from the "
"cart to the confirmation page without filling out the contact form."
msgstr ""
"Si el :doc:`proveedor de pago <../../finance/payment_providers>` instalado "
"es compatible con el :ref:`pago exprés <payment_providers/express_checkout>` "
"aparecerá un botón específico que permitirá que los clientes pasen del "
"carrito a la página de confirmación sin completar el formulario de contacto."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/checkout.rst:209
msgid "Address"
msgstr "Dirección"

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/checkout.rst:211
msgid "Once they have reviewed their order:"
msgstr "Una vez que hayan revisado su orden:"

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/checkout.rst:213
msgid ""
"Unsigned-in customers are prompted to :guilabel:`Sign in` or enter "
"their :guilabel:`Name` and :guilabel:`Email` address, along with their "
"delivery address and phone details;"
msgstr ""
"Los clientes que no hayan iniciado sesión deben :guilabel:`iniciar sesión` o "
"ingresar su :guilabel:`nombre` y :guilabel:`dirección de correo`, junto con "
"los detalles de dirección de entrega y número de teléfono."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/checkout.rst:215
msgid ""
"Signed-in customers can select the appropriate :guilabel:`Delivery address`."
msgstr ""
"Los clientes que hayan iniciado sesión pueden seleccionar "
"una :guilabel:`Dirección de entrega` apropiada."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/checkout.rst:217
msgid ""
"They can then :doc:`choose a delivery method <shipping>`, select or enter "
"their :guilabel:`Billing Address` (or toggle the :guilabel:`Same as delivery "
"address` switch if the billing and delivery addresses are identical), and "
"click :guilabel:`Confirm` to proceed to the next step."
msgstr ""
"Después pueden :doc:`seleccionar un método de entrega <shipping>`, "
"seleccionar o ingresar la :guilabel:`Dirección de facturación` (o activar la "
"opción :guilabel:`Igual que la dirección de entrega` si las direcciones de "
"facturación y entrega son idénticas) y haga clic en :guilabel:`Confirmar` "
"para seguir al siguiente paso."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/checkout.rst:222
msgid ""
"For B2B customers, you can also :ref:`enable <ecommerce/checkout/"
"customize_steps>` optional :ref:`B2B fields <ecommerce/b2b_b2c/b2b-fields>` "
"in the website editor."
msgstr ""
"Para clientes B2B, también puedes :ref:`habilitar <ecommerce/checkout/"
"customize_steps>` :ref:`campos B2B <ecommerce/b2b_b2c/b2b-fields>` "
"opcionales en el editor del sitio web."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/checkout.rst:224
msgid ""
"You can add a checkbox for users without an account to sign up for a "
"newsletter. To do so, go to :menuselection:`Website --> Configuration --> "
"Settings`, scroll down to the :guilabel:`eCommerce` section, enable "
"the :guilabel:`Newsletter` feature, and select a :guilabel:`Newsletter List`."
msgstr ""
"Puedes agregar una casilla para que los usuarios que no tienen una cuenta se "
"suscriban a un boletín. Para ello, ve a :menuselection:`Sitio web --> "
"Configuración --> Ajustes`, dirígete a la sección :guilabel:`Comercio "
"electrónico`, activa la función :guilabel:`Boletín` y selecciona "
"una :guilabel:`lista de boletín`."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/checkout.rst:228
msgid ""
"When the :ref:`Pick up in store <ecommerce/shipping/instore-pickup>` "
"delivery method is selected, the customer can :guilabel:`Choose a pick-up "
"point` and, if applicable, filter them by country, provided several pick-up "
"points are available."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/checkout.rst:231
msgid ""
"When the :ref:`Expected Delivery <ecommerce/shipping/custom-method>` option "
"is configured, the customer views the expected delivery date or can select a "
"desired delivery date."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/checkout.rst:237
msgid "Automatic address validation"
msgstr "Validación automática de direcciones"

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/checkout.rst:239
msgid ""
"Use the :doc:`Google Places API </applications/general/integrations/"
"address_autocomplete>` to ensure that partner delivery addresses are valid. "
"Addresses are automatically validated as the user types during checkout."
msgstr ""
"Usa la :doc:`API de Google Places </applications/general/integrations/"
"address_autocomplete>` para garantizar que las direcciones de entrega de los "
"contactos sean válidas. El sistema valida las direcciones de forma "
"automática mientras el usuario la escribe durante el proceso de pago."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/checkout.rst:243
msgid ""
"To enable this feature, the :ref:`Google Places API <address_autocomplete/"
"places-api-configuration>` needs to be configured first. Then, go "
"to :menuselection:`Website --> Configuration --> Settings`. In "
"the :guilabel:`General` section, enable :guilabel:`Google Address "
"Validation`, then paste the :ref:`Google Places API key "
"<address_autocomplete/generate_api_key>` in the :guilabel:`API Key` field."
msgstr ""
"Para activar esta función, primero es necesario que configures la :ref:`API "
"de Google Places <address_autocomplete/places-api-configuration>`. Después, "
"ve a :menuselection:`Sitio web --> Configuración --> Ajustes`. En la "
"sección :guilabel:`General`, selecciona :guilabel:`Address Validation de "
"Google` y pega la :ref:`clave API de Google Places <address_autocomplete/"
"generate_api_key>` en el campo :guilabel:`Clave API`."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/checkout.rst:252
msgid "Extra info"
msgstr "Información adicional"

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/checkout.rst:254
msgid ""
"You can add an :guilabel:`Extra Info` step in the checkout process to "
"collect additional customer information through an online form, which is "
"then included in the :ref:`sales order <ecommerce/handling/sales>`. To do "
"so, :ref:`enable <ecommerce/checkout/customize_steps>` the :guilabel:`Extra "
"Step` option in the website editor. The form can be :doc:`customized <../"
"website/web_design/building_blocks/forms>` as needed."
msgstr ""
"Puedes agregar un paso de :guilabel:`Información adicional` en el proceso de "
"pago para recopilar información adicional del cliente a través de un "
"formulario en línea, la cual se incluye en la :ref:`orden de venta "
"<ecommerce/handling/sales>`. Para hacerlo, :ref:`habilita <ecommerce/"
"checkout/customize_steps>` la opción :guilabel:`Paso adicional` en el editor "
"del sitio web. El formulario se puede :doc:`personalizar <../website/"
"web_design/building_blocks/forms>` según sea necesario."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/checkout.rst:263
msgid "Payment"
msgstr "Pago"

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/checkout.rst:265
msgid ""
"At the :guilabel:`Payment` step, customers can choose a :guilabel:`Payment "
"method`, enter their payment details, and click :guilabel:`Pay now`."
msgstr ""
"En el paso :guilabel:`Pago`, los clientes pueden seleccionar "
"un :guilabel:`Método de pago`, ingresar los detalles de pago y hacer clic "
"en :guilabel:`Pagar ahora`."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/checkout.rst:269
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`Pay now` button label can be customized using "
"the :doc:`website editor <../website/web_design>`."
msgstr ""

