#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/checkout.rst:277
#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/configuration/domain_names.rst:41
msgid "Terms and conditions"
msgstr "Términos y condiciones"

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/checkout.rst:279
msgid ""
"To require customers to agree to the :doc:`terms and conditions <../../"
"finance/accounting/customer_invoices/terms_conditions>` before payment, open "
"the website editor and toggle the :guilabel:`Accept Terms` switch in "
"the :guilabel:`Style` tab."
msgstr ""
"Para que los clientes deban aceptar los :doc:`términos y condiciones <../../"
"finance/accounting/customer_invoices/terms_conditions>` antes de pagar, abre "
"el editor del sitio web y presiona el botón :guilabel:`Aceptar términos` en "
"la pestaña :guilabel:`Estilo`."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/checkout.rst:284
msgid "eWallets and gift cards"
msgstr "Monederos electrónicos y tarjetas de regalo"

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/checkout.rst:286
msgid ""
"Customers can pay with an eWallet or gift card during checkout. To offer "
"these options, go to :menuselection:`Website --> Configuration --> Settings` "
"and enable :menuselection:`Discounts, Loyalty & Gift Card` in "
"the :guilabel:`eCommerce` section. Then, go to :menuselection:`Website --> "
"eCommerce --> Gift cards & eWallet` and :doc:`create a gift card and/or "
"eWallet program </applications/sales/sales/products_prices/"
"ewallets_giftcards>`."
msgstr ""
"Los clientes pueden pagar con un monedero electrónico o tarjeta de regalo "
"durante el proceso de pago. Para ofrecer estas opciones, ve "
"a :menuselection:`Sitio web --> Configuración --> Ajustes` y "
"activa :menuselection:`Descuentos, programas de lealtad y tarjetas de "
"regalo` en la sección :guilabel:`Comercio electrónico`. Luego, ve "
"a :menuselection:`Sitio web --> Comercio electrónico --> Tarjetas de regalo "
"y monedero electrónico` y :doc:`crea un programa de tarjeta de regalo o "
"monedero electrónico </applications/sales/sales/products_prices/"
"ewallets_giftcards>`."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/checkout.rst:None
msgid "Gift card and eWallet options at checkout"
msgstr "Opciones de tarjeta de regalo y monedero electrónico al pagar"

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/checkout.rst:298
msgid "Order confirmation"
msgstr "Confirmación de la orden"

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/checkout.rst:300
msgid ""
"The final step of the checkout process is the order confirmation page, which "
"provides a summary of the customer's purchase details. A sales order is "
"automatically created in the backend."
msgstr ""
"El paso final del proceso de pago es la página de confirmación de la orden, "
"que muestra un resumen de los detalles de la compra del cliente. El sistema "
"crea una orden de venta de forma automática en el backend."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/checkout.rst:303
msgid ""
"To automatically send notification emails and documents, navigate "
"to :menuselection:`Website --> Configuration --> Settings` and scroll down "
"to the :guilabel:`eCommerce` section. Then configure the following settings:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/checkout.rst:307
msgid ""
"To send an order confirmation email: Under :guilabel:`Order Confirmation`, "
"select an :guilabel:`Email` :doc:`template </applications/general/companies/"
"email_template>`, or, if the :doc:`WhatsApp app </applications/productivity/"
"whatsapp>` is installed, a :guilabel:`WhatsApp` :ref:`template <productivity/"
"whatsapp/templates>` from the dropdown list. To edit the selected template, "
"click the :icon:`fa-arrow-right` (:guilabel:`Internal link`) arrow."
msgstr ""
"Para enviar un correo electrónico de confirmación de pedido: en "
":guilabel:`Confirmación del pedido`, selecciona en :guilabel:`Correo "
"electrónico` una :doc:`plantilla </applications/general/companies/"
"email_template>` o, si la :doc:`aplicación de WhatsApp </applications/"
"productivity/whatsapp>` está instalada, en :guilabel:`WhatsApp` una "
":ref:`plantilla <productivity/whatsapp/templates>` de la lista desplegable. "
"Para editar la plantilla seleccionada, haz clic en la flecha :icon:`fa-arrow-"
"right` (:guilabel:`Enlace interno`)."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/checkout.rst:312
msgid ""
"To send a product review request to the customer: Enable the :ref:`Request "
"ratings <ecommerce/handling/rating-request>` setting."
msgstr ""
"Para enviar una solicitud de reseña de producto al cliente: habilita el "
"ajuste :ref:`Solicitar calificaciones <ecommerce/handling/rating-request>`."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/checkout.rst:314
msgid ""
"To send an invoice to the customer: Enable the :ref:`Automatic Invoice "
"<ecommerce/handling/invoices>` setting."
msgstr ""
"Para enviar una factura al cliente: habilita el ajuste :ref:`Factura "
"automática <ecommerce/handling/invoices>`."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/checkout.rst:318
msgid ":doc:`Order handling <order_handling>`"
msgstr ":doc:`Gestión de las órdenes <order_handling>`"

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration.rst:9
msgid ""
"Odoo eCommerce enables the configuration of products, categories, variants, "
"and pricing. It also manages customer accounts and access, supporting both "
"B2B and B2C business models."
msgstr ""
"Comercio electrónico de Odoo habilita la configuración de productos, "
"categorías, variantes y precios. También gestiona las cuentas de los "
"clientes y los accesos, lo que lo hace compatible con modelos de negocios "
"B2B y B2C."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration.rst:14
#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/products.rst:3
msgid "Products"
msgstr "Productos"

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration.rst:14
msgid ""
"Configure products, manage their visibility, add images and videos, create "
"product combos, and attach digital files. Define selling strategies, "
"translate product information, and manage stock and packaging."
msgstr ""
"Configura productos, gestiona su visibilidad, agrega imágenes y videos, crea "
"combos de productos y adjunta archivos digitales. Define estrategias de "
"venta, traduce la información del producto y gestione el inventario y el "
"embalaje."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration.rst:22
#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/categories_variants.rst:3
msgid "Categories and variants"
msgstr "Categorías y variantes"

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration.rst:22
msgid ""
"Use product variants and attributes to offer multiple product options. "
"Create attribute and e-commerce categories to better organize the shop and "
"product pages."
msgstr ""
"Usa las variantes de producto y los atributos para ofrecer varias opciones "
"de producto. Crea atributos y categorías de comercio electrónico para "
"organizar mejor las páginas de tienda y producto."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration.rst:29
#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/b2b_b2c.rst:13
#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/prices.rst:3
msgid "Prices"
msgstr "Precios"

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration.rst:29
msgid ""
"Configure different prices and taxes using prices per unit, pricelists, and "
"discounts. Prices can also be hidden, and sales can be restricted when "
"necessary."
msgstr ""
"Configura diferentes precios e impuestos usando precios unitarios, listas de "
"precios y descuentos. Los precios también se pueden ocultar y las ventas se "
"pueden restringir cuando sea necesario."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration.rst:36
#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/customer_accounts.rst:3
#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/configuration/multi_website.rst:67
msgid "Customer accounts"
msgstr "Cuentas de cliente"

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration.rst:36
msgid ""
"Control access to the shop, the checkout, and the customer portal, and use "
"customer accounts to support B2B and B2C operations."
msgstr ""
"Controla el acceso a la tienda, el proceso de pago y al portal del cliente y "
"usa cuentas de clientes para realizar operaciones B2B y B2C."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration.rst:42
#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/b2b_b2c.rst:3
msgid "B2B and B2C"
msgstr "B2B y B2C"

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration.rst:42
msgid ""
"Configure separate websites and shops for B2B and B2C businesses and "
"customize them to meet the specific needs of each business model."
msgstr ""
"Configura sitios web separados y tiendas para negocios B2B y B2C. "
"Personalízalos para cumplir con las necesidades específicas de cada modelo "
"empresarial."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/b2b_b2c.rst:5
msgid ""
"Odoo eCommerce is designed to fulfill the needs of both B2B and B2C "
"companies. It allows you to configure :doc:`prices <prices>`, "
"manage :doc:`access <customer_accounts>` for specific customers, "
"and :ref:`customize the website <ecommerce/b2b_b2c/multiple-websites>` to "
"support B2B, B2C, or both business models."
msgstr ""
"La aplicación Comercio electrónico de Odoo está diseñada para cumplir con "
"las necesidades de empresas B2B y B2C. Permite configurar :doc:`precios "
"<prices>`, gestionar los permisos de :doc:`acceso <customer_accounts>` de "
"clientes específicos y :ref:`personalizar el sitio web <ecommerce/b2b_b2c/"
"multiple-websites>` para modelos de negocio B2B, B2C o ambos."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/b2b_b2c.rst:15
msgid ""
"While B2C businesses sell directly to the end consumer with a :ref:`tax-"
"included <ecommerce-price-management-tax-display>` price, B2B businesses "
"usually :ref:`exclude taxes <ecommerce-price-management-tax-display>` and "
"may even prefer to hide prices altogether, showcasing only their products "
"instead. To configure a B2B-specific online shop, make sure the :ref:`Tax-"
"Excluded <ecommerce/prices/taxes>` option is enabled, and complete the "
"configuration to :ref:`hide the pricing <ecommerce/prices/hide-prices>`."
msgstr ""
"Las empresas B2C venden directo al consumidor final con un precio :ref:`con "
"impuestos incluidos <ecommerce-price-management-tax-display>`, mientras que "
"las empresas B2B suelen :ref:`excluir los impuestos <ecommerce-price-"
"management-tax-display>` e incluso prefieren ocultar los precios y mostrar "
"solo los productos. Para configurar una tienda en línea para operaciones "
"B2B, activa la función :ref:`Impuestos excluidos <ecommerce/prices/taxes>` y "
"completa la configuración para :ref:`ocultar los precios <ecommerce/prices/"
"hide-prices>`."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/b2b_b2c.rst:24
msgid ""
"To make sure that only customers with an :ref:`account and granted access "
"<ecommerce/customer_accounts/account-creation>` can see the prices, go "
"to :menuselection:`Website --> eCommerce --> Customers`, click the :icon:`fa-"
"caret-down` :guilabel:`(dropdown)` icon from the search bar, and select "
"the :guilabel:`Archived` filter. Then click the :guilabel:`Public user` "
"card, go to the :guilabel:`Sales & Purchase` tab, and add the zero-priced "
"pricelist configured to :ref:`cover all countries <ecommerce/prices/country-"
"groups>`. Keep the :guilabel:`Public User` contact :guilabel:`Archived` at "
"all times. Website visitors now see the products without prices, while only "
"customers with an :ref:`account invitation <ecommerce/customer_accounts/"
"account-creation>` and an assigned :ref:`pricelist <ecommerce/prices/"
"pricelists>` can view the pricing in the customer portal."
msgstr ""
"Para que solo los clientes que tengan :ref:`una cuenta con acceso <ecommerce/"
"customer_accounts/account-creation>` puedan ver los precios, ve "
"a :menuselection:`Sitio web --> Comercio electrónico --> Clientes`, haz clic "
"en el icono :icon:`fa-caret-down`:guilabel:`(desplegar)` en la barra de "
"búsqueda y selecciona el filtro :guilabel:`Archivado`. Después, haz clic en "
"la tarjeta :guilabel:`Usuario público`, ve a la pestaña :guilabel:`Ventas y "
"compras` y agrega una lista de precios con precio en cero :ref:`para todos "
"los países <ecommerce/prices/country-groups>`. Mantén el contacto "
"del :guilabel:`usuario público` :guilabel:`Archivado` en todo momento. Los "
"visitantes del sitio ahora verán los productos sin precios y solo los "
"clientes con :ref:`una cuenta con invitación <ecommerce/customer_accounts/"
"account-creation>` y una :ref:`lista de precios <ecommerce/prices/"
"pricelists>` asignada podrán ver los precios en el portal del cliente."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/b2b_b2c.rst:36
msgid ":doc:`/applications/finance/accounting/taxes/B2B_B2C`"
msgstr ":doc:`/applications/finance/accounting/taxes/B2B_B2C`"

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/b2b_b2c.rst:37
msgid ":ref:`Discounts <ecommerce/prices/discounts>`"
msgstr ":ref:`Descuentos <ecommerce/prices/discounts>`"

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/b2b_b2c.rst:42
msgid "Access request"
msgstr "Solicitud de acceso"

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/b2b_b2c.rst:44
msgid ""
"When running a B2B business, you usually :ref:`hide the pricing <ecommerce/"
"b2b_b2c/prices>` on the web shop and make it available for :ref:`logged-in "
"users <ecommerce/customer_accounts/shop-access>` only. To prevent anyone "
"from signing up freely, set the :ref:`Customer Account <ecommerce/"
"customer_accounts/account-creation>` setting option to :guilabel:`On "
"invitation`. To create a page where customers request access, open "
"the :doc:`website editor </applications/websites/website/"
"web_design>`, :doc:`create a form <../../website/web_design/building_blocks/"
"forms>`, customize it, and in the :guilabel:`Action` field, "
"select :guilabel:`Create a customer`."
msgstr ""
"Al gestionar un negocio B2B, por lo general :ref:`ocultas los precios "
"<ecommerce/b2b_b2c/prices>` en la tienda en línea y solo los pones a "
"disposición de los :ref:`usuarios que hayan iniciado sesión <ecommerce/"
"customer_accounts/shop-access>`. Para evitar que cualquiera se registre "
"libremente, establece la opción de ajuste :ref:`Cuenta de cliente <ecommerce/"
"customer_accounts/account-creation>` en :guilabel:`Por invitación`. Para "
"crear una página donde los clientes soliciten acceso, abre el :doc:`editor "
"del sitio web </applications/websites/website/web_design>`, :doc:`crea un "
"formulario <../../website/web_design/building_blocks/forms>`, personalízalo "
"y, en el campo :guilabel:`Acción`, selecciona :guilabel:`Crear un cliente`."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/b2b_b2c.rst:54
msgid ""
"You can assign tags created on a contact form under :menuselection:`Website "
"--> Configuration --> Customers` to identify what kind of customers have "
"submitted the form. To do so, open the :doc:`website editor </applications/"
"websites/website/web_design>` and select a field in the form. Then, in "
"the :guilabel:`Style` tab, click the :guilabel:`+ Field` button in "
"the :guilabel:`Field` section heading and set the field's :guilabel:`Type` "
"to :guilabel:`Tags`. Toggle the tags that should be automatically assigned "
"when a customer fills in the form and set the field's :guilabel:`Visibility "
"Rule` to :guilabel:`Hidden`."
msgstr ""
"Puedes asignar etiquetas creadas en un formulario de contacto en "
":menuselection:`Sitio web --> Configuración --> Clientes` para identificar "
"qué tipo de clientes han enviado el formulario. Para hacerlo, abre el "
":doc:`editor del sitio web </applications/websites/website/web_design>` y "
"selecciona un campo en el formulario. Luego, en la pestaña "
":guilabel:`Estilo`, haz clic en el botón :guilabel:`+ Campo` en el "
"encabezado de la sección :guilabel:`Campo` y establece el :guilabel:`Tipo` "
"del campo como :guilabel:`Etiquetas`. Activa las etiquetas que se deben "
"asignar automáticamente cuando un cliente complete el formulario y establece "
"la :guilabel:`Regla de visibilidad` del campo como :guilabel:`Oculto`."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/b2b_b2c.rst:62
msgid ""
"When a customer submits the form, a new contact is automatically created in "
"the database. The contact is assigned the first pricelist from the list of "
"available pricelists, and, if applicable, the specified tags."
msgstr ""
"Cuando un cliente envíe el formulario, el sistema creará un nuevo contacto "
"en la base de datos de forma automática y le asignará la primera lista de "
"precios disponible y, si aplica, las etiquetas especificadas."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/b2b_b2c.rst:66
msgid ""
"Submitted requests can be found under the :menuselection:`Website --> "
"eCommerce --> Customers`. Select the customer you want to :ref:`grant portal "
"access <ecommerce/customer_accounts/grant-access>` to. Once done, the "
"selected customer is able to view the B2B prices and products. Make sure the "
"correct pricelist is assigned to their contact form."
msgstr ""
"Las solicitudes enviadas aparecerán en :menuselection:`Sitio web --> "
"Comercio electrónico --> Clientes`. Selecciona al cliente al que le "
"quieres :ref:`otorgar acceso al portal <ecommerce/customer_accounts/grant-"
"access>`. Una vez que lo hagas, ese cliente podrá ver los precios y "
"productos B2B. Asegúrate de asignarle la lista de precios correcta a su "
"formulario de contacto."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/b2b_b2c.rst:73
msgid ""
"It is also possible to hide the entire shop from the public using "
"the :ref:`Ecommerce Access <ecommerce/customer_accounts/shop-access>` "
"setting and only make it available for logged-in customers."
msgstr ""
"También puedes ocultar toda la tienda al público con la función :ref:`Acceso "
"a Comercio electrónico <ecommerce/customer_accounts/shop-access>` y volverla "
"visible solo para los clientes que hayan iniciado sesión."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/b2b_b2c.rst:76
msgid ""
"Configure the :ref:`checkout policy <ecommerce/customer_accounts/checkout-"
"access>` to allow/disallow guest checkout for B2C businesses."
msgstr ""
"Configura la :ref:`política de pago <ecommerce/customer_accounts/checkout-"
"access>` para permitir o no que los clientes paguen como invitados en las "
"empresas B2C."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/b2b_b2c.rst:78
msgid ""
"Enable the :ref:`Shared Customer Accounts <ecommerce/customer_accounts/"
"multiple-websites>` feature to allow customers to use the same account "
"on :ref:`all <ecommerce/b2b_b2c/multiple-websites>` your websites."
msgstr ""
"Activa la función :ref:`Cuentas de cliente compartidas <ecommerce/"
"customer_accounts/multiple-websites>` para permitir que los clientes usen la "
"misma cuenta en :ref:`todos <ecommerce/b2b_b2c/multiple-websites>` tus "
"sitios web."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/b2b_b2c.rst:83
#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/prices.rst:351
msgid ":doc:`customer_accounts`"
msgstr ":doc:`customer_accounts`"

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/b2b_b2c.rst:88
#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/configuration/multi_website.rst:3
msgid "Multiple websites"
msgstr "Varios sitios web"

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/b2b_b2c.rst:90
msgid ""
"Settings are website-specific, which means it is possible to configure "
"different behaviors for each website. For example, you can set up a B2C "
"website that allows :ref:`guest checkout <ecommerce/customer_accounts/"
"checkout-access>` and displays :ref:`tax-included prices <ecommerce-price-"
"management-tax-display>`, and a B2B website that requires :ref:`sign-in "
"<ecommerce/customer_accounts/checkout-access>` and shows :ref:`tax-excluded "
"prices <ecommerce-price-management-tax-display>`. However, "
"each :ref:`pricelist <ecommerce/prices/pricelists>` can only be assigned to "
"one website at a time. If you want to use the same pricelist on several "
"websites, duplicate the pricelist and assign each copy to its corresponding "
"website."
msgstr ""
"Los ajustes son específicos para cada sitio web, lo que permite configurar "
"comportamientos distintos para cada uno. Por ejemplo, puedes configurar un "
"sitio web B2C que permita :ref:`pagar como invitado <ecommerce/"
"customer_accounts/checkout-access>` y muestre los :ref:`precios con "
"impuestos incluidos <ecommerce-price-management-tax-display>`, así como un "
"sitio B2B que requiera :ref:`iniciar sesión <ecommerce/customer_accounts/"
"checkout-access>` y muestre los :ref:`precios sin impuestos <ecommerce-price-"
"management-tax-display>`. Sin embargo, cada :ref:`lista de precios "
"<ecommerce/prices/pricelists>` solo puede asignarse a un sitio web a la vez. "
"Si quieres usar la misma lista de precios en varios sitios web, duplícala y "
"asigna cada copia a su respectivo sitio."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/b2b_b2c.rst:101
msgid ""
"If you are running a B2B and B2C business, we *strongly* recommend to create "
"two :doc:`separate websites </applications/websites/website/configuration/"
"multi_website>` and assign a :ref:`zero-priced pricelist <ecommerce/b2b_b2c/"
"prices>` to the B2B website and a regular pricelist to the B2C website. In "
"case, you prefer using a single website, configure it using :ref:`country "
"groups <ecommerce/prices/country-groups>` and assigning :ref:`pricelists "
"<ecommerce/prices/pricelists>` to customers, and deactivate "
"the :ref:`Selectable <ecommerce/prices/selectable-pricelists>` option."
msgstr ""
"Si tu empresa trabaja con modelos B2B y B2C, te recomendamos *ampliamente* "
"que crees dos :doc:`sitios web separados </applications/websites/website/"
"configuration/multi_website>` y que asignes una :ref:`lista de precios "
"configurados con cero <ecommerce/b2b_b2c/prices>` al sitio web de tu empresa "
"B2B y una lista de precios regular al de la empresa B2C. Si prefieres usar "
"un solo sitio web, configúralo con :ref:`grupos de países <ecommerce/prices/"
"country-groups>`, asigna :ref:`listas de precios <ecommerce/prices/"
"pricelists>` a los clientes y desactiva la opción :ref:`Se puede seleccionar "
"<ecommerce/prices/selectable-pricelists>`."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/b2b_b2c.rst:113
#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/ecommerce_design.rst:30
#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/ecommerce_design/additional_features.rst:3
msgid "Additional features"
msgstr "Funciones adicionales "

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/b2b_b2c.rst:118
msgid "Invoice"
msgstr "Factura"

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/b2b_b2c.rst:120
msgid ""
"Depending on the type of business (B2B or B2C), you might want to issue an "
"invoice. An invoice can either be generated automatically (for B2B) or on "
"demand of the customer (for B2C). This process can be automated if (and "
"when) the online payment is :ref:`confirmed <ecommerce/handling/sales>`. To "
"automate invoicing, enable the :ref:`Automatic Invoice <ecommerce/handling/"
"invoices>` setting. If this feature has not been enabled, the customer only "
"receives an order confirmation."
msgstr ""
"Según tu tipo de negocio (B2B o B2C), quizá quieras emitir una factura. "
"Puedes generar una factura de forma automática (para B2B) o bajo solicitud "
"del cliente (para B2C). Este proceso se automatiza si el pago en línea "
"queda :ref:`confirmado <ecommerce/handling/sales>`. Para automatizar la "
"facturación, activa la función :ref:`Factura automática <ecommerce/handling/"
"invoices>`; de lo contrario, el cliente solo recibirá la confirmación de su "
"orden."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/b2b_b2c.rst:127
msgid ""
"The :ref:`Pay on Invoice <ecommerce/payments/pay-on-invoice>` payment method "
"allows customers to place an order without upfront payment and pay after "
"they receive the invoice."
msgstr ""
"El método de pago :ref:`Pago contra factura <ecommerce/payments/pay-on-"
"invoice>` permite a los clientes realizar un pedido sin un pago por "
"adelantado y pagar después de recibir la factura."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/b2b_b2c.rst:133
msgid "B2B fields at checkout"
msgstr "Campos B2B durante el proceso de pago"

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/b2b_b2c.rst:135
msgid ""
"On the :guilabel:`Order summary` page, open the :doc:`website editor </"
"applications/websites/website/web_design>`, go to the :guilabel:`Style` tab, "
"and toggle the :guilabel:`Show B2B Fields` switch to display B2B-specific "
"additional fields like :guilabel:`VAT` or :guilabel:`Company Name` during "
"the :ref:`delivery <ecommerce/checkout/delivery>` step."
msgstr ""
"En la página :guilabel:`Resumen de la orden`, abre el :doc:`editor de sitios "
"web </applications/websites/website/web_design>`, ve a la "
"pestaña :guilabel:`Estilo` y cambia la opción :guilabel:`Mostrar campos B2B` "
"para mostrar campos adicionales específicos para empresas B2B, "
"como :guilabel:`Número de identificación fiscal` o :guilabel:`Nombre de la "
"empresa`, durante el paso :ref:`entrega <ecommerce/checkout/delivery>`."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/categories_variants.rst:5
msgid ""
"Odoo eCommerce provides multiple ways to configure, :doc:`present <../../"
"ecommerce/ecommerce_design/catalog>`, and sell different product options to "
"customers while organizing products by category for a better overview and "
"smoother navigation."
msgstr ""
"Comercio electrónico de Odoo ofrece varias formas de "
"configurar, :doc:`presentar <../../ecommerce/ecommerce_design/catalog>` y "
"vender diferentes opciones de productos a clientes. Además, organiza los "
"productos por categoría para tener un mejor resumen y una navegación más "
"sencilla."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/categories_variants.rst:12
msgid "Product variants"
msgstr "Variantes de producto"

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/categories_variants.rst:14
msgid ""
":doc:`Product variants </applications/sales/sales/products_prices/products/"
"variants>` are different versions of the same product, created by "
"combining :ref:`attributes <products/variants/attributes>` like color, size, "
"material, etc., which can lead to differences in price and/or availability."
msgstr ""
"Las :doc:`variantes de producto </applications/sales/sales/products_prices/"
"products/variants>` son distintas versiones de un mismo producto, se crean "
"al combinar :ref:`atributos <products/variants/attributes>` como color, "
"tamaño o material, lo que puede ocasionar que haya diferencias en el precio "
"o la disponibilidad."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/categories_variants.rst:18
msgid "To configure product variants for a product:"
msgstr "Para configurar las variantes de un producto:"

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/categories_variants.rst:20
#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/prices.rst:54
#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/order_handling.rst:100
#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/order_handling.rst:129
#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/order_handling.rst:252
#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/shipping.rst:33
#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/shipping.rst:112
#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/configuration/multi_website.rst:80
#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/configuration/translate.rst:16
msgid "Go to :menuselection:`Website --> Configuration --> Settings`."
msgstr "Ve a :menuselection:`Sitio web --> Configuración --> Ajustes`."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/categories_variants.rst:21
msgid ""
"Scroll down to the :guilabel:`eCommerce` section and enable "
"the :guilabel:`Product Variants` feature."
msgstr ""
"Dirígete a la sección :guilabel:`Comercio electrónico` y activa la "
"función :guilabel:`Variantes de producto`."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/categories_variants.rst:23
msgid ""
"Access the :ref:`product form <ecommerce/products/product-form>` and go to "
"the :guilabel:`Attributes & Variants` tab."
msgstr ""
"Accede al :ref:`formulario de producto <ecommerce/products/product-form>` y "
"ve a la pestaña :guilabel:`Atributos y variantes`."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/categories_variants.rst:25
msgid ""
"Click :guilabel:`Add a line` and select the relevant attribute and its "
"values. Repeat this step for each additional attribute."
msgstr ""
"Haz clic en :guilabel:`Agregar una línea` y selecciona el atributo "
"correspondiente y sus valores. Repite este paso para cada atributo adicional."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/categories_variants.rst:28
msgid ""
"The product variants are created automatically (or not) based on "
"the :ref:`attribute's configuration <products/variants/attributes>`."
msgstr ""
"Las variantes de producto se crean de forma automática (o no) según "
"la :ref:`configuración del atributo <products/variants/attributes>`."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/categories_variants.rst:32
msgid ":doc:`/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/products/variants`"
msgstr ":doc:`/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/products/variants`"

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/categories_variants.rst:37
#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/ecommerce_design/catalog.rst:98
#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/ecommerce_design/product_page.rst:100
msgid "Attributes"
msgstr "Atributos"

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/categories_variants.rst:39
msgid ""
"Attributes refer to the characteristics of a product, such as its color or "
"material. Each attribute includes a set of values."
msgstr ""
"Los atributos se refieren a las características de un producto, como su "
"color o material. Cada atributo incluye un conjunto de valores."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/categories_variants.rst:None
msgid "Attributes and variants of your product"
msgstr "Atributos y variantes de su producto"

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/categories_variants.rst:45
msgid ""
"Once your attributes are :ref:`created <products/variants/attributes>`, "
"navigate to the :guilabel:`eCommerce` tab of the attribute form and "
"configure the following options to control where and/or how they appear on "
"the website:"
msgstr ""
"Una vez que tus atributos estén :ref:`creados <products/variants/attributes>"
"`, ve a la pestaña :guilabel:`Comercio electrónico` del formulario de "
"atributos y configura las siguientes opciones para controlar dónde o cómo "
"aparecen en el sitio web:"

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/categories_variants.rst:49
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Filter`: Set the field to :guilabel:`Visible` to make the "
"attribute available in the shop's filter section."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Filtro`: establece el campo como :guilabel:`Visible` para que el "
"atributo esté disponible en la sección de filtros de la tienda."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/categories_variants.rst:51
msgid ""
":guilabel:`On Product Cards`: Set the field to :guilabel:`Visible` "
"or :guilabel:`Hover` to display attributes on the product card on the shop "
"page. These options are only available when :ref:`variants are created "
"instantly for the attribute <products/variants/attributes>`. "
"When :guilabel:`On Product Cards` is enabled, the :guilabel:`Show "
"Thumbnails` option can be toggled to show a product variant image instead of "
"the attribute values."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`En tarjetas de producto`: establece el campo como "
":guilabel:`Visible` o :guilabel:`Al pasar el cursor` para mostrar los "
"atributos en la tarjeta de producto en la página de la tienda. Estas "
"opciones solo están disponibles cuando :ref:`las variantes se crean al "
"instante para el atributo <products/variants/attributes>`. Cuando "
":guilabel:`En tarjetas de producto` está habilitado, puedes activar la "
"opción :guilabel:`Mostrar miniaturas` para mostrar una imagen de la variante "
"del producto en lugar de los valores del atributo."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/categories_variants.rst:58
msgid ""
"Access all attributes by going to :menuselection:`Website --> eCommerce --> "
"Attributes`."
msgstr ""
"Accede a todos los atributos desde :menuselection:`Sitio web --> Comercio "
"electrónico --> Atributos`."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/categories_variants.rst:60
msgid ""
"It is also possible to add a variant picture on the product card on the shop "
"page. To do so, go to the product form, click the :icon:`fa-"
"sitemap` :guilabel:`Variants` :ref:`smart button <products/variants/variants-"
"smart-button>`, select a variant, and click the :icon:`fa-"
"pencil` :guilabel:`(Edit)` icon to add a picture for each variant. Make sure "
"that the :ref:`Show Thumbnails <ecommerce/categories_variants/attributes>` "
"option is enabled on the attribute form."
msgstr ""
"También puedes agregar una imagen de variante en la tarjeta del producto en "
"la página de la tienda. Para hacerlo, ve al formulario del producto, haz "
"clic en el :ref:`botón inteligente <products/variants/variants-smart-"
"button>` :icon:`fa-sitemap` :guilabel:`Variantes`, selecciona una variante y "
"haz clic en el icono :icon:`fa-pencil` :guilabel:`(Editar)` para agregar una "
"imagen a cada variante. Asegúrate de que la opción :ref:`Mostrar miniaturas "
"<ecommerce/categories_variants/attributes>` esté seleccionada en el "
"formulario del atributo."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/categories_variants.rst:None
msgid "Variant thumbnails on product card."
msgstr "Miniaturas de variantes en la tarjeta del producto."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/categories_variants.rst:72
msgid "Attribute categories"
msgstr "Categorías de atributos"

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/categories_variants.rst:74
msgid ""
"To group similar attributes under the same section when :ref:`comparing "
"products <ecommerce/products/additional_features/product-comparison>`, "
"select the relevant :guilabel:`Category` in the :guilabel:`eCommerce` tab of "
"the attribute form or create a new one. Click the :icon:`fa-arrow-"
"right` :guilabel:`(internal link)` icon next to the category name to:"
msgstr ""
"Para agrupar atributos similares en la misma sección al :ref:`comparar "
"productos <ecommerce/products/additional_features/product-comparison>`, "
"selecciona la :guilabel:`Categoría` correspondiente en la pestaña "
":guilabel:`Comercio electrónico` del formulario de atributos o crea una "
"nueva. Haz clic en el icono :icon:`fa-arrow-right` :guilabel:`(enlace "
"interno)` junto al nombre de la categoría para:"

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/categories_variants.rst:79
msgid "Rename the category."
msgstr "Cambiar el nombre de la categoría."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/categories_variants.rst:80
msgid "Change its :guilabel:`Sequence`."
msgstr "Cambiar su :guilabel:`secuencia`."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/categories_variants.rst:81
msgid ""
"Reorder the :guilabel:`Related Attributes` to define the order in which they "
