msgstr "Agregar atributos a la categoría con :guilabel:`Agregar una línea`."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/categories_variants.rst:None
msgid "Comparison summary page with attribute categories."
msgstr "Página de resumen de comparación con categorías de atributos."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/categories_variants.rst:91
msgid "Shop categories"
msgstr "Categorías de la tienda"

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/categories_variants.rst:93
msgid ""
"E-commerce-specific categories are used to organize products into groups, "
"making it easier for customers to browse the online store."
msgstr ""
"Las categorías específicas de comercio electrónico se utilizan para "
"organizar los productos en grupos, lo que facilita que los clientes naveguen "
"por la tienda en línea."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/categories_variants.rst:None
#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/ecommerce_design/catalog.rst:None
msgid "Category quick access in the toolbar."
msgstr "Acceso rápido a las categorías en la barra de herramientas."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/categories_variants.rst:99
msgid ""
"To create categories, go to :menuselection:`Website --> eCommerce --> "
"Categories`, and click :guilabel:`New`. On the category form, you can:"
msgstr ""
"Para crear categorías, ve a :menuselection:`Sitio web --> Comercio "
"electrónico --> Categorías` y haz clic en :guilabel:`Nuevo`. En el "
"formulario de la categoría, puedes:"

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/categories_variants.rst:102
msgid "Add a :guilabel:`Category` name (required)."
msgstr "Agregar un nombre de :guilabel:`Categoría` (obligatorio)."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/categories_variants.rst:103
msgid "Enter a :guilabel:`Parent` category."
msgstr "Ingresar una categoría :guilabel:`Padre`."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/categories_variants.rst:104
msgid "Restrict it to a specific :guilabel:`Website`."
msgstr "Restringirla a un :guilabel:`Sitio web` específico."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/categories_variants.rst:105
msgid ""
"Enable the :guilabel:`Not in Shop` option to hide the category from the main "
"shop page, e.g., when creating a dedicated category for promotional product "
"selections."
msgstr ""
"Habilitar la opción :guilabel:`No en la tienda` para ocultar la categoría de "
"la página principal de la tienda, por ejemplo, al crear una categoría "
"dedicada a selecciones de productos promocionales."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/categories_variants.rst:107
msgid "Add products to the category in the :guilabel:`Products` tab."
msgstr "Agregar productos a la categoría en la pestaña :guilabel:`Productos`."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/categories_variants.rst:108
msgid "In the :guilabel:`Description` tab:"
msgstr "En la pestaña :guilabel:`Descripción`:"

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/categories_variants.rst:110
msgid ""
"Write a category :guilabel:`Description`. It is displayed on "
"the :ref:`category page <ecommerce/catalog/customize-layout>` of "
"the :doc:`catalog <../ecommerce_design/catalog>`, below the breadcrumbs."
msgstr ""
"Escribe una :guilabel:`Descripción` de la categoría. Se muestra en la "
":ref:`página de categoría <ecommerce/catalog/customize-layout>` del "
":doc:`catálogo <../ecommerce_design/catalog>`, debajo de las migas de pan."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/categories_variants.rst:113
msgid ""
"Add a :guilabel:`Cover Image` for the category. This image is only displayed "
"in the :guilabel:`Category List` snippet of the :ref:`catalog blocks "
"<ecommerce/catalog/catalog-blocks>`."
msgstr ""
"Agrega una :guilabel:`Imagen de portada` para la categoría. Esta imagen solo "
"se muestra en el snippet :guilabel:`Lista de categorías` de los "
":ref:`bloques del catálogo <ecommerce/catalog/catalog-blocks>`."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/categories_variants.rst:118
msgid ""
"You can also assign categories to products directly from the :ref:`product "
"form <ecommerce/products/product-form>` by navigating to "
"the :guilabel:`Shop` section of the :guilabel:`eCommerce` tab and selecting "
"the relevant :guilabel:`Categories`."
msgstr ""
"También puedes asignar categorías a los productos directamente desde el "
":ref:`formulario del producto <ecommerce/products/product-form>`. Para ello, "
"ve a la sección :guilabel:`Tienda` de la pestaña :guilabel:`Comercio "
"electrónico` y selecciona las :guilabel:`Categorías` correspondientes."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/categories_variants.rst:121
msgid ""
"It is also possible to :ref:`prevent direct sales for specific categories "
"<ecommerce/prices/hide-prices>`."
msgstr ""
"También es posible :ref:`evitar las ventas directas para categorías "
"específicas <ecommerce/prices/hide-prices>`."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/categories_variants.rst:125
msgid "A single product can belong to multiple e-commerce categories."
msgstr ""
"Un solo producto puede pertenecer a varias categorías de comercio "
"electrónico."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/categories_variants.rst:126
msgid ""
"Define how to :ref:`display categories <ecommerce/catalog/categories>` on "
"the shop page."
msgstr ""
"Define cómo :ref:`mostrar las categorías <ecommerce/catalog/categories>` en "
"la página de la tienda."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/categories_variants.rst:127
msgid ""
"Categories that do not contain any products are not visible on the shop page."
msgstr "Las categorías sin productos no aparecen en la página de la tienda."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/categories_variants.rst:130
msgid ":doc:`products`"
msgstr ":doc:`products`"

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/customer_accounts.rst:5
msgid ""
"Using customer accounts for an e-commerce enables you to :ref:`manage "
"customers <ecommerce/customer_accounts/account-creation>`, control access to "
"the :ref:`shop <ecommerce/customer_accounts/shop-access>`, "
"the :ref:`checkout <ecommerce/customer_accounts/checkout-access>`, or "
"the :doc:`customer portal </applications/general/users/user_portals/"
"portal_access>`, and support both :doc:`B2B and B2C operations <b2b_b2c>`."
msgstr ""
"Usar cuentas de clientes para un comercio electrónico te "
"permite :ref:`gestionar clientes <ecommerce/customer_accounts/account-"
"creation>`, controlar el acceso a la :ref:`tienda <ecommerce/"
"customer_accounts/shop-access>`, el :ref:`pago <ecommerce/customer_accounts/"
"checkout-access>`, el :doc:`portal del cliente </applications/general/users/"
"user_portals/portal_access>` y realizar :doc:`operaciones B2B y B2C "
"<b2b_b2c>`."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/customer_accounts.rst:12
msgid ""
"After logging in, customers can access their :doc:`customer portal </"
"applications/general/users/user_portals>` by clicking their username in the "
"top-right corner of the screen and selecting :guilabel:`My Account`. From "
"there, they can view all their documents in one place, such as quotations, "
"orders, invoices, and more."
msgstr ""
"Después de iniciar sesión, los clientes pueden acceder a su :doc:`portal del "
"cliente </applications/general/users/user_portals>` si hacen clic en su "
"nombre de usuario en la esquina superior derecha de la pantalla y "
"seleccionan :guilabel:`Mi cuenta`. Desde ahí, pueden ver todos sus "
"documentos en un solo lugar, como cotizaciones, órdenes, facturas y más."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/customer_accounts.rst:None
msgid "Customer account access"
msgstr "Acceso a la cuenta del cliente"

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/customer_accounts.rst:21
msgid ""
"The customer account page can be customized with building blocks and other "
"features through the :doc:`website editor </applications/websites/website/"
"web_design>`."
msgstr ""
"La página de la cuenta del cliente se puede personalizar con bloques de "
"creación y otras funciones mediante el :doc:`editor de sitio web </"
"applications/websites/website/web_design>`."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/customer_accounts.rst:27
msgid "Customer account creation"
msgstr "Crear cuenta de cliente"

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/customer_accounts.rst:29
msgid ""
"You can choose whether customer accounts and document access are available "
"to everyone or restricted to invited users only. To do so, go "
"to :menuselection:`Website --> Configuration --> Settings`, and navigate to "
"the :guilabel:`General` section. Under :guilabel:`Customer Account`, select "
"one of the following options:"
msgstr ""
"Puedes elegir si las cuentas de clientes y permisos de acceso a documentos "
"están disponibles para todos o están restringido a usuarios invitados. Para "
"hacerlo, ve a :menuselection:`Sitio web --> Configuración --> Ajustes` y ve "
"a la sección :guilabel:`General`. En :guilabel:`Cuenta de cliente` "
"selecciona una de las siguientes opciones:"

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/customer_accounts.rst:34
msgid ""
":guilabel:`On invitation`: Customers can only create an account if the "
"website owner sends them an invitation."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Por invitación`: Los clientes solo pueden crear una cuenta si el "
"propietario del sitio web les envía una invitación."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/customer_accounts.rst:36
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Free sign up`: Every website visitor can create an account and "
"sign in. They will get access to the :doc:`portal </applications/general/"
"users/user_portals>` by default."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Regístrate gratis`: Todos los visitantes al sitio web pueden "
"crear una cuenta e iniciar sesión. Obtendrán acceso al :doc:`portal </"
"applications/general/users/user_portals>` de forma predeterminada."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/customer_accounts.rst:41
msgid "To send an email invitation to a customer:"
msgstr "Para enviar una invitación por correo electrónico a un cliente:"

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/customer_accounts.rst:43
msgid "Go to :menuselection:`Website --> eCommerce --> Customers`."
msgstr "Ve a :menuselection:`Sitio web --> Comercio electrónico --> Clientes`."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/customer_accounts.rst:44
msgid ""
"Select a customer or click :guilabel:`New` to create one, ensuring "
"an :guilabel:`Email` address is set."
msgstr ""
"Selecciona un cliente o haz clic en :guilabel:`Nuevo` para crear uno y "
"asegúrate de que tenga una dirección de :guilabel:`correo electrónico`."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/customer_accounts.rst:46
msgid ""
"Click the :icon:`fa-cog` :guilabel:`(Actions)` icon next to the record's "
"name at the top-left and select :guilabel:`Grant portal access`."
msgstr ""
"Haz clic en el icono :icon:`fa-cog` :guilabel:`(Acciones)` ubicado junto al "
"nombre del registro en la parte superior izquierda y "
"selecciona :guilabel:`Otorgar acceso al portal`."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/customer_accounts.rst:48
msgid ""
"In the :guilabel:`Portal Access Management` pop-up, click :guilabel:`Grant "
"Access` to send the invitation."
msgstr ""
"Haz clic en :guilabel:`Conceder acceso` en la ventana "
"emergente :guilabel:`Administración del acceso al portal` para enviar la "
"invitación."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/customer_accounts.rst:52
msgid ""
"To invite multiple customers at once, switch to the customers :icon:`oi-view-"
"list` :guilabel:`List` view, select several customers, click the :icon:`fa-"
"cog` :guilabel:`Actions` button, and select :guilabel:`Grant portal access`."
msgstr ""
"Para invitar a varios clientes al mismo tiempo, cambia a la vista "
"de :icon:`oi-view-list`:guilabel:`lista` de los clientes, selecciona "
"algunos, haz clic en el botón :icon:`fa-cog`:guilabel:`Acciones` y elige la "
"opción :guilabel:`Otorgar acceso al portal`."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/customer_accounts.rst:56
msgid ""
"Once done, the customer(s) receive an email confirming their account "
"creation, including instructions on setting a password and activating their "
"account."
msgstr ""
"Una vez que hayas hecho esto, los clientes recibirán un correo que confirma "
"la creación de su cuenta y que incluye las instrucciones para definir una "
"contraseña y activar su cuenta."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/customer_accounts.rst:60
msgid ""
"When selecting the :guilabel:`Free sign up`, a clickable :guilabel:`Don't "
"have an account?` link appears under the login form on the website."
msgstr ""
"Al seleccionar :guilabel:`Registro gratis` aparece el enlace :guilabel:`¿No "
"tienes una cuenta?` en la parte inferior del formulario de inicio de sesión "
"en el sitio web."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/customer_accounts.rst:62
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`On invitation` option is especially useful for :ref:`B2B "
"<ecommerce/b2b_b2c/prices>` businesses that prefer to keep :ref:`prices "
"hidden <ecommerce/prices/hide-prices>` on the website and grant access only "
"to invited customers."
msgstr ""
"La opción :guilabel:`Por invitación` es muy útil para empresas :ref:`B2B "
"<ecommerce/b2b_b2c/prices>` que prefieren mantener sus :ref:`precios ocultos "
"<ecommerce/prices/hide-prices>` en el sitio web y solo darle acceso a "
"clientes invitados."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/customer_accounts.rst:67
msgid ""
"It is possible to configure a website form with a :guilabel:`Create a "
"Customer` :ref:`action <building_blocks/forms/action>` to automatically "
"create a customer record in the backend when filled in."
msgstr ""
"Es posible configurar un formulario de sitio web con la :ref:`acción "
"<website/building_blocks/action>` :guilabel:`Crear un cliente` para crear un "
"registro de cliente en el backend de forma automática cuando alguien "
"complete y envíe el formulario."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/customer_accounts.rst:74
msgid "Access restriction"
msgstr "Restricción de acceso"

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/customer_accounts.rst:76
msgid ""
"Once a customer account is created, it is still possible to adjust the "
"access rights either globally or for individual users:"
msgstr ""
"Luego de crear una cuenta de cliente, aún puedes ajustar los permisos de "
"acceso de forma global o por usuario:"

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/customer_accounts.rst:79
msgid ""
":doc:`Revoke access or re-invite a customer </applications/general/users/"
"user_portals/portal_access>` using the related buttons in "
"the :guilabel:`Portal Access Management` pop-up."
msgstr ""
":doc:`Revoca el acceso o vuelve a invitar al cliente </applications/general/"
"users/user_portals/portal_access>` usando los botones relacionados en la "
"ventana emergente :guilabel:`Gestión de acceso al portal`."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/customer_accounts.rst:82
msgid ""
"Restrict :ref:`access to the shop <ecommerce/customer_accounts/shop-access>`;"
msgstr ""
"Restringe el :ref:`acceso a la tienda <ecommerce/customer_accounts/shop-"
"access>`."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/customer_accounts.rst:83
msgid ""
"Decide whether customers need to create an account to :ref:`complete the "
"checkout <ecommerce/customer_accounts/checkout-access>`."
msgstr ""
"Decide si los clientes deben crear una cuenta para :ref:`completar el pago "
"<ecommerce/customer_accounts/checkout-access>`."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/customer_accounts.rst:87
msgid ""
"It is also possible to define the types of documents customers have access "
"to. To do so, click your username in the upper-right corner of the website, "
"select :guilabel:`My Account` and open the :doc:`website builder </"
"applications/websites/website/web_design>`. On the :guilabel:`Style` tab, "
"enable or disable access to specific documents as needed."
msgstr ""
"También es posible definir los tipos de documentos a los que los clientes "
"tienen acceso. Para hacerlo, haz clic en tu nombre de usuario en la esquina "
"superior derecha del sitio web, selecciona :guilabel:`Mi cuenta` y abre "
"el :doc:`creador de sitios web </applications/websites/website/web_design>`. "
"En la pestaña :guilabel:`Estilo` puedes activar o desactivar el acceso a "
"documentos específicos como sea necesario."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/customer_accounts.rst:95
msgid "Shop access"
msgstr "Acceso a la tienda"

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/customer_accounts.rst:97
msgid ""
"To restrict access to the entire online shop for users who are not logged-"
"in, go to :menuselection:`Website --> Configuration --> Settings`, scroll to "
"the :guilabel:`eCommerce` section and under :guilabel:`Ecommerce Access`, "
"select :guilabel:`Logged in users`. Select :guilabel:`All users` if the shop "
"should be visible to every website visitor."
msgstr ""
"Para evitar que usuarios que no hayan iniciado sesión entren a la tienda en "
"línea, ve a :menuselection:`Sitio web --> Configuración --> Ajustes`, baja a "
"la sección :guilabel:`Comercio electrónico` y en :guilabel:`Acceso a "
"Comercio electrónico`, selecciona :guilabel:`Usuarios que iniciaron sesión`. "
"Selecciona :guilabel:`Todos los usuarios` si la tienda debe ser visible a "
"todos los visitantes del sitio web."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/customer_accounts.rst:103
msgid ""
"To restrict access to the shop's pricing, use :ref:`pricelists <ecommerce/"
"prices/pricelists>` with :ref:`country groups <ecommerce/prices/country-"
"groups>`."
msgstr ""
"Usa las :ref:`listas de precios <ecommerce/prices/pricelists>` "
"con :ref:`grupos de países <ecommerce/prices/country-groups>` para limitar "
"el acceso a los precios de la tienda."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/customer_accounts.rst:109
msgid "Checkout access"
msgstr "Acceso al proceso de pago"

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/customer_accounts.rst:111
msgid ""
"To allow customers to checkout as guests or force them to sign in/create an "
"account, go to :menuselection:`Website --> Configuration --> Settings`, "
"scroll down to the :guilabel:`eCommerce` section, and configure "
"the :guilabel:`Sign in/up at checkout` setting. The following options are "
"available:"
msgstr ""
"Para permitir que los clientes paguen como invitados, o hacer que inicien "
"sesión o creen una cuenta, ve a :menuselection:`Sitio web --> Configuración "
"--> Ajustes`, dirígete a la sección :guilabel:`Comercio electrónico` y "
"configura la opción :guilabel:`Iniciar sesión o registrarse al pagar`. Las "
"siguientes opciones están disponibles:"

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/customer_accounts.rst:116
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Optional`: Customers can check out as guests and register later "
"via the order confirmation email to track their order."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Opcional`: Los clientes pueden pagar como invitados y registrarse "
"después con el correo de confirmación de la orden para rastrear su orden."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/customer_accounts.rst:118
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Disabled`: Customers can checkout as guests without creating an "
"account."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Deshabilitado`: Los clientes pueden pagar como invitados sin "
"tener que crear una cuenta."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/customer_accounts.rst:119
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Mandatory`: Customers must sign in or create an account at "
"the :ref:`Order summary <ecommerce/checkout/review_order>` step to complete "
"their purchase."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Obligatorio`: Los clientes deben iniciar sesión o crear una "
"cuenta en el :ref:`resumen de la orden <ecommerce/checkout/review_order>` "
"para completar su compra."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/customer_accounts.rst:123
msgid ""
"Customer contacts created through guest checkout are :guilabel:`Archived` in "
"the backend by default. Once the customer creates an account, the relevant "
"contact form becomes unarchived."
msgstr ""
"Los contactos de clientes creados mediante el pago como invitado aparecen "
"como :guilabel:`Archivado` en el backend de forma predeterminada. Una vez "
"que el cliente crea una cuenta, el formulario de contacto correspondiente se "
"desarchiva."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/customer_accounts.rst:125
msgid ""
"Settings are specific to each website, allowing you to configure a B2C "
"website with guest checkout and a B2B website that requires customers to "
"sign in."
msgstr ""
"Los ajustes son específicos para cada sitio web, así que puedes configurar "
"un sitio web B2C en el que sea posible pagar como invitado y un sitio web "
"B2B que requiera que los clientes inicien sesión."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/customer_accounts.rst:127
msgid ""
"To use the :ref:`wishlist <ecommerce/products/additional_features/"
"wishlists>` feature, customers must create an account to save their favorite "
"items for later."
msgstr ""
"Para usar la función de :ref:`lista de deseos <ecommerce/products/"
"additional_features/wishlists>`, los clientes deben crear una cuenta para "
"guardar sus artículos favoritos para después."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/customer_accounts.rst:133
msgid "Multi-website account"
msgstr "Cuenta de múltiples sitios web"

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/customer_accounts.rst:135
msgid ""
"When managing multiple websites, it is possible to make customer accounts "
"available across *all* websites, allowing each customer to use a single "
"account. To do so, go to :menuselection:`Website --> Configuration --> "
"Settings`, in the :guilabel:`General` section, enable the :guilabel:`Shared "
"Customer Accounts` option."
msgstr ""
"Si trabajas con varios sitios web, es posible hacer que las cuentas de los "
"clientes estén disponibles en *todos* los sitios web para que los clientes "
"solo tengan que usar una cuenta. Para hacerlo, ve a :menuselection:`Sitio "
"web --> Configuración --> Settings`, en la sección :guilabel:`General` "
"activa la opción :guilabel:`Cuentas de cliente compartidas`."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/customer_accounts.rst:141
msgid ""
"When operating both :ref:`B2B and B2C online shops <ecommerce/b2b_b2c/"
"multiple-websites>`, it is recommended to use separate websites for each "
"business model."
msgstr ""
"Si operas :ref:`tiendas en línea B2B y B2C <ecommerce/b2b_b2c/multiple-"
"websites>`, lo recomendable es usar sitios web separados para el modelo de "
"cada negocio."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/prices.rst:5
msgid ""
"Odoo offers multiple options for configuring prices in e-commerce. For "
"example, you can apply :ref:`prices per unit <ecommerce/prices/price-per-"
"unit>`, offer :ref:`discounts <ecommerce/prices/discounts>`, and set "
"up :ref:`pricelists <ecommerce/prices/pricelists>`."
msgstr ""
"Odoo ofrece varias opciones para configurar precios en el comercio "
"electrónico. Por ejemplo, puedes aplicar :ref:`precios por unidad <ecommerce/"
"prices/price-per-unit>`, ofrecer :ref:`descuentos <ecommerce/prices/"
"discounts>` y configurar :ref:`listas de precios <ecommerce/prices/"
"pricelists>`."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/prices.rst:12
msgid "Taxes"
msgstr "Impuestos"

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/prices.rst:14
msgid ""
"To add a tax on a product, you can either set a tax in the :guilabel:`Sales "
"Taxes` field of the product form or use :doc:`fiscal positions </"
"applications/finance/accounting/taxes/fiscal_positions>`."
msgstr ""
"Para agregarle impuestos a un producto puedes definir un impuesto en el "
"campo :guilabel:`Impuesto de venta` del formulario del producto o usar "
"las :doc:`posiciones fiscales </applications/finance/accounting/taxes/"
"fiscal_positions>`."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/prices.rst:19
msgid ":doc:`/applications/finance/accounting/taxes`"
msgstr ":doc:`/applications/finance/accounting/taxes`"

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/prices.rst:20
msgid ":doc:`/applications/finance/accounting/taxes/avalara`"
msgstr ":doc:`/applications/finance/accounting/taxes/avalara`"

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/prices.rst:24
msgid ""
"Choosing the displayed price tax usually depends on a country's regulations "
"or the type of customers (:doc:`B2B vs. B2C <b2b_b2c>`). To select the type "
"of price displayed, go to :menuselection:`Website --> Configuration --> "
"Settings`, select the website, scroll down to the :guilabel:`eCommerce` "
"section, and under :guilabel:`Display Product Prices` select between:"
msgstr ""
"Seleccionar el impuesto que se mostrará en el precio depende de las "
"regulaciones de cada país o del tipo de clientes (:doc:`B2B o B2C "
"<b2b_b2c>`). Para seleccionar el tipo de precio que se mostrará, ve "
"a :menuselection:`Sitio web --> Configuración --> Ajustes`, selecciona el "
"sitio web, baja a la sección :guilabel:`Comercio electrónico` y "
"en :guilabel:`Mostrar los precios de los productos` selecciona una de las "
"siguientes opciones:"

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/prices.rst:29
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Tax Excluded`: The price displayed on the website is tax-"
"excluded, and the tax is computed at the :ref:`ecommerce/checkout/"
"review_order` step."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Impuestos no incluidos`: El precio mostrado en el sitio web no "
"incluye los impuestos y estos se calculan en el paso de :ref:`revisión de la "
"orden <ecommerce/checkout/review_order>`."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/prices.rst:31
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Tax Included`: The price displayed on the website is tax-included."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Impuesto incluido`: El precio mostrado en el sitio web incluye "
"impuestos."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/prices.rst:34
msgid ""
"This setting is website-specific and can therefore be configured "
"independently for every website in the database."
msgstr ""
"Este ajuste es específico de cada sitio web y puedes configurarlo de forma "
"independiente para cada uno en la base de datos."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/prices.rst:38
msgid ""
"Switch the :ref:`Tax indication <ecommerce_design/product_page/"
"customization>` toggle on in the website editor to explicitly indicate if "
"the price is `Tax excluded` or `Tax included` on the :doc:`../../ecommerce/"
"ecommerce_design/product_page`."
msgstr ""
"Activa la opción :ref:`para indicar impuestos <ecommerce_design/product_page/"
"customization>` en el editor de sitio web para indicar de forma explícita si "
"el precio es `con` o `sin` impuestos incluidos en la :doc:`página de "
"producto <../../ecommerce/ecommerce_design/product_page>`."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/prices.rst:41
msgid ""
"Enable specific :ref:`B2B fields <ecommerce/b2b_b2c/b2b-fields>` during "
"checkout in the :ref:`delivery step <ecommerce/checkout/delivery>` using "
"the :doc:`website editor </applications/websites/website/web_design>`."
msgstr ""
"Activa :ref:`campos específicos para B2B <ecommerce/b2b_b2c/b2b-fields>` en "
"el :ref:`paso de envío <ecommerce/checkout/delivery>` durante el proceso de "
"pago con el :doc:`editor del sitio web </applications/websites/website/"
"web_design>`."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/prices.rst:48
msgid "Price per unit"
msgstr "Precio por unidad"

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/prices.rst:50
msgid ""
"To display a :doc:`price per unit </applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/"
