msgstr ""
"Sigue estos pasos para mostrar un :doc:`precio por unidad </applications/"
"inventory_and_mrp/inventory/product_management/configure/uom>` junto al "
"precio de venta en la página del producto:"

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/prices.rst:55
msgid ""
"Enable the :guilabel:`Product Reference Price` checkbox in "
"the :guilabel:`eCommerce` section."
msgstr ""
"Activa la casilla :guilabel:`Precio de referencia del producto` en la "
"sección :guilabel:`Comercio electrónico`."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/prices.rst:56
msgid ""
":ref:`Navigate to the product form <ecommerce/products/product-creation>`."
msgstr ""
":ref:`Ve al formulario del producto <ecommerce/products/product-creation>`."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/prices.rst:57
msgid ""
"Set the product's :guilabel:`Sales Price` and select the unit "
"(e.g., :guilabel:`Units`)."
msgstr ""
"Configura el :guilabel:`precio de venta` del producto y selecciona la unidad "
"(por ejemplo, :guilabel:`Unidades`)."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/prices.rst:58
msgid ""
"In the :guilabel:`Base Unit Count` field, enter the number of units in the "
"product."
msgstr ""
"En el campo :guilabel:`Cantidad de unidades base`, ingresa el número de "
"unidades del producto."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/prices.rst:59
msgid "Select the relevant unit from the drop-down list."
msgstr "Selecciona la unidad correspondiente en la lista desplegable."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/prices.rst:62
msgid ""
"Imagine you want to sell a 2-liter bucket of paint for $60, i.e., $30 per "
"liter."
msgstr ""
"Imagina que quieres vender una cubeta de pintura de 2 litros a $60, es "
"decir, a $30 por litro."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/prices.rst:0
msgid "Cost per unit pricing on the product form."
msgstr "Precio por unidad en el formulario del producto."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/prices.rst:67
msgid ""
"The price per unit, in this case per liter, is shown next to the sales price "
"on the product page."
msgstr ""
"El precio por unidad, en este caso por litro, se muestra junto al precio de "
"venta en la página del producto."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/prices.rst:0
msgid "Unit pricing on the product page."
msgstr "Precio por unidad en la página del producto."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/prices.rst:73
msgid "The price per unit may be mandatory in some countries."
msgstr "El precio por unidad puede ser obligatorio en algunos países."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/prices.rst:76
msgid ""
":doc:`/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/product_management/configure/"
"uom`"
msgstr ""
":doc:`/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/product_management/configure/"
