#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/prices.rst:81
msgid "Pricelists"
msgstr "Listas de precios"

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/prices.rst:83
msgid ""
"Pricelists in Odoo allow for managing flexible pricing rules and offering "
"different prices and discounts based on currencies, time periods, purchase "
"volumes, :ref:`customers' location <ecommerce/prices/geoip>`, and/or "
"customer type."
msgstr ""
"Las listas de precios en Odoo te permiten gestionar reglas de precios "
"flexibles y ofrecer diferentes precios y descuentos en función de las "
"monedas, los periodos de tiempo, los volúmenes de compra, :ref:`la ubicación "
"de los clientes <ecommerce/prices/geoip>` o el tipo de cliente."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/prices.rst:87
msgid ""
"To enable pricelists for eCommerce, go to :menuselection:`Website --> "
"Configuration --> Settings`, scroll down to the :guilabel:`eCommerce` "
"section, enable :guilabel:`Pricelists`, and :guilabel:`Save`. Then, "
"click :icon:`fa-arrow-right` :guilabel:`Pricelists` or go "
"to :menuselection:`Website --> eCommerce --> Pricelists` and :ref:`configure "
"<sales/products/pricelist-configuration>` the relevant pricelists."
msgstr ""
"Para habilitar las listas de precios en el comercio electrónico, ve a "
":menuselection:`Sitio web --> Configuración --> Ajustes`, desplázate hasta "
"la sección :guilabel:`Comercio electrónico`, activa :guilabel:`Listas de "
"precios` y haz clic en :guilabel:`Guardar`. Luego, haz clic en :icon:`fa-"
"arrow-right` :guilabel:`Listas de precios` o ve a :menuselection:`Sitio "
"web --> Comercio electrónico --> Listas de precios` y :ref:`configura <sales/"
"products/pricelist-configuration>` las listas de precios correspondientes."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/prices.rst:93
msgid ""
"In the :guilabel:`Ecommerce` tab, configure options specific to online "
"sales, such as assigning a :guilabel:`Website` to a pricelist, allowing "
"customers to :ref:`select it <ecommerce/prices/selectable-pricelists>`, and/"
"or adding an :ref:`E-commerce Promotional Code <ecommerce/prices/promotional-"
"code>`."
msgstr ""
"En la pestaña :guilabel:`Comercio electrónico`, configura opciones "
"específicas para las ventas en línea, como asignar un :guilabel:`sitio web` "
"a una lista de precios, permitir que los clientes la :ref:`seleccionen "
"<ecommerce/prices/selectable-pricelists>` o agregar un :ref:`código "
"promocional de comercio electrónico <ecommerce/prices/promotional-code>`."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/prices.rst:99
msgid ""
"If you are using several websites and want to use the same pricelist on "
"several of them, you need to duplicate the pricelist for each website. If "
"you do not assign any website, the pricelist will not be used, unless it "
"is :ref:`selectable <ecommerce/prices/selectable-pricelists>`."
msgstr ""
"Si usas varios sitios web y quieres aplicar la misma lista de precios en "
"todos, necesitas duplicarla para cada sitio. Si no asignas ningún sitio web, "
"el sistema no usará la lista de precios, a menos que esta se pueda "
":ref:`seleccionar <ecommerce/prices/selectable-pricelists>`."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/prices.rst:103
msgid ""
"Pricelists can also be :ref:`assigned to a specific customer <sales/pricing/"
"customer-pricelist-application>`."
msgstr ""
"Las listas de precios también se pueden :ref:`asignar a un cliente "
"específico <sales/pricing/customer-pricelist-application>`."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/prices.rst:107
msgid ""
"When pricelists are enabled in the Sales app, they are automatically enabled "
"in the eCommerce app, and vice versa."
msgstr ""
"Cuando las listas de precios están habilitadas en la aplicación Ventas, el "
"sistema las activa automáticamente en la aplicación Comercio electrónico y "
"viceversa."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/prices.rst:109
msgid ""
"In the list of pricelists, order the pricelists by priority: the first takes "
"precedence over the second, the second over the third, and so on."
msgstr ""
"En la lista de las listas de precios, ordénalas por prioridad: la primera "
"tiene prioridad sobre la segunda, la segunda sobre la tercera y así "
"sucesivamente."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/prices.rst:111
msgid ""
"It is also possible to create specific pricelists for :ref:`variants "
"<products/variants/configure-variants>`."
msgstr ""
"También puedes crear listas de precios específicas para :ref:`variantes "
"<products/variants/configure-variants>`."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/prices.rst:115
msgid ":doc:`/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/prices/pricing`"
msgstr ":doc:`/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/prices/pricing`"

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/prices.rst:120
msgid "Selectable pricelists"
msgstr "Listas de precios seleccionables"

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/prices.rst:122
msgid ""
"Selectable pricelists are useful, for example, when selling products "
"in :doc:`multiple currencies <../../../sales/sales/products_prices/prices/"
"currencies>`, and allow customers to choose a pricelist using the pricelist "
"selector in the catalog, located next to the :ref:`search bar <ecommerce/"
"catalog/toolbar-and-filters>`."
msgstr ""
"Las listas de precios seleccionables son útiles, por ejemplo, al vender "
"productos en :doc:`varias monedas <../../../sales/sales/products_prices/"
"prices/currencies>` y permiten que los clientes elijan una lista de precios "
"mediante el selector de listas de precios del catálogo, ubicado junto a la "
":ref:`barra de búsqueda <ecommerce/catalog/toolbar-and-filters>`."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/prices.rst:None
msgid "Pricelist selector on the e-commerce."
msgstr "Selector de listas de precios en el comercio electrónico."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/prices.rst:130
msgid "To make a pricelist selectable, enable :guilabel:`Selectable`."
msgstr ""
"Habilita la opción :guilabel:`Seleccionable` para permitir la elección de "
"una lista de precios."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/prices.rst:133
msgid ""
"If a pricelist is designated as :guilabel:`Selectable` and not assigned to a "
"specific website, it is selectable on **all** websites."
msgstr ""
"Si una lista de precios se designa como :guilabel:`Seleccionable` y no se "
"asigna a un sitio web específico, se podrá seleccionar en **todos** los "
"sitios web."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/prices.rst:135
msgid ""
"If a pricelist does *not* appear in the selector, it may be due to the "
"following situations:"
msgstr ""
"Si una lista de precios no aparece en el selector, puede deberse a lo "
"siguiente:"

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/prices.rst:137
msgid ""
"Only one pricelist is defined as :guilabel:`Selectable`, and "
"the :ref:`contact has a pricelist assigned <sales/pricing/customer-pricelist-"
"application>`."
msgstr ""
"Solo una lista de precios está definida como :guilabel:`Seleccionable`, y el "
":ref:`contacto tiene una lista de precios asignada <sales/pricing/customer-"
"pricelist-application>`."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/prices.rst:139
msgid ""
"Multiple selectable pricelists exist, but only those matching the "
"customer's :ref:`country group <ecommerce/prices/country-groups>` are shown. "
"It is strongly recommended to disable the :guilabel:`Selectable` option when "
"using pricelists with country groups on the e-commerce."
msgstr ""
"Existen varias listas de precios seleccionables, pero solo aparecen las que "
"coinciden con el :ref:`grupo de países <ecommerce/prices/country-groups>` "
"del cliente. Te recomendamos desactivar la opción :guilabel:`Se puede "
"seleccionar` cuando uses listas de precios con grupos de países en tu "
"comercio electrónico."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/prices.rst:145
msgid ":ref:`sales/products/currencies/currency-specific-pricelists`"
msgstr ":ref:`sales/products/currencies/currency-specific-pricelists`"

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/prices.rst:150
msgid "GeoIP & country groups"
msgstr "GeoIP y grupos de países"

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/prices.rst:152
msgid ""
"It is possible to display a specific pricelist based on the visitor's "
"location and IP address by assigning :ref:`country groups <ecommerce/prices/"
"country-groups>` to pricelists."
msgstr ""
"Puedes mostrar una lista de precios específica según la ubicación y "
"dirección IP del visitante si asignas :ref:`grupos de países <ecommerce/"
"prices/country-groups>` a las listas de precios."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/prices.rst:157
msgid ""
"To do so, :ref:`navigate to the relevant pricelist form <ecommerce/prices/"
"pricelists>` and select the appropriate :guilabel:`Country Groups`. Create "
"or edit as many pricelists for specific regions as needed. For instance, "
"select :guilabel:`European Union` to apply the pricelist to all EU member "
"states."
msgstr ""
"Para hacerlo, :ref:`ve al formulario de la lista de precios correspondiente "
"<ecommerce/prices/pricelists>` y selecciona los :guilabel:`grupos de países` "
"correctos. Crea o edita tantas listas de precios regionales como necesites. "
"Por ejemplo, selecciona :guilabel:`Unión Europea` para aplicar la lista de "
"precios a todos los países miembros de la UE."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/prices.rst:162
msgid ""
"To create a new country group, click :guilabel:`Search more` in the drop-"
"down list, then :guilabel:`Create New`. Add a :guilabel:`Group Name` and "
"select the relevant :guilabel:`Countries`. Use :ref:`Custom filters <search/"
"custom-filters>` if needed."
msgstr ""
"Para crear un nuevo grupo de países, haz clic en :guilabel:`Buscar más` en "
"la lista desplegable y luego en :guilabel:`Crear nuevo`. Agrega un "
":guilabel:`Nombre del grupo` y selecciona los :guilabel:`Países` "
"correspondientes. Usa :ref:`Filtros personalizados <search/custom-filters>` "
"si es necesario."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/prices.rst:167
msgid "Each country group must contain at least one country."
msgstr "Cada grupo de países debe incluir al menos un país."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/prices.rst:170
msgid ""
"Use the following filter to add all non-EU countries to the country group."
msgstr ""
"Usa el siguiente filtro para agregar todos los países no pertenecientes a la "
"UE al grupo de países."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/prices.rst:172
msgid "`Country Groups` + `is not equal to` + `European Union`"
msgstr "`Grupos de países` + `no es igual a` + `Unión europea`"

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/prices.rst:0
msgid "Filter for country group creation."
msgstr "Filtro para la creación de grupos de países."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/prices.rst:178
msgid ""
"When using GeoIP to determine the appropriate pricelist, **all** pricelists "
"used on the e-commerce site must have a country group assigned."
msgstr ""
"Al usar GeoIP para determinar la lista de precios adecuada, **todas** las "
"listas de precios utilizadas en el sitio de comercio electrónico deben tener "
"un grupo de países asignado."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/prices.rst:180
msgid ""
"It is strongly recommended to disable the :guilabel:`Selectable` option when "
"using pricelists with country groups. Indeed, all pricelists with the "
"relevant country group are automatically applied to the catalog, but if one "
"of them is marked as :ref:`Selectable <ecommerce/prices/selectable-"
"pricelists>`, the others will disappear as soon as customers select the "
"selectable pricelist."
msgstr ""
"Te recomendamos desactivar la opción :guilabel:`Seleccionable` cuando usas "
"listas de precios con grupos de países. Todas las listas de precios que "
"pertenecen al grupo de países correspondiente se aplican en automático al "
"catálogo, pero si una está marcada como :ref:`Seleccionable <ecommerce/"
"prices/selectable-pricelists>`, las demás desaparecerán cuando el cliente "
"seleccione la lista de precios seleccionable."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/prices.rst:187
msgid "Imagine you create three pricelists:"
msgstr "Imagina que creas tres listas de precios:"

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/prices.rst:189
msgid "`EU regular prices` with the `EU` country group assigned"
msgstr "`Precios regulares para la UE` con el grupo de países `UE` asignado."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/prices.rst:190
msgid "`EU prices with discounts` with the `EU` country group assigned"
msgstr ""
"`Precios con descuento para la UE` con el grupo de países `UE` asignado."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/prices.rst:191
msgid "`US prices` with the `US` country group assigned"
msgstr "`Precios para EE. UU.` con el grupo de países `EE. UU.` asignado."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/prices.rst:193
msgid ""
"If the :guilabel:`Selectable` option is enabled for `EU regular prices` and "
"`US prices`, and the customer is from the European Union, only the "
"pricelists `EU regular prices` and `EU prices with discounts` will be "
"available. However, since the `EU prices with discount` list is not "
"selectable, it will disappear once the customer selects the `EU regular "
"prices` list, and prices will be displayed based on the `EU regular prices` "
"pricelist in the catalog."
msgstr ""
"Si la opción :guilabel:`Seleccionable` está activa en `Precios regulares "
"para la UE` y `Precios para EE. UU.`, y el cliente es de la Unión Europea, "
"solo estarán disponibles las listas `Precios regulares para la UE` y "
"`Precios con descuento para la UE`. Sin embargo, como la lista `Precios con "
"descuento para la UE` no es seleccionable, desaparecerá cuando el cliente "
"elija la lista `Precios regulares para la UE` y los precios del catálogo que "
"aparecerán serán los de esta última."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/prices.rst:200
msgid "Pricelist application"
msgstr "Aplicación de listas de precios"

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/prices.rst:202
msgid ""
"On the e-commerce, the *default* pricelist is automatically selected for "
"public, non-logged-in users when no country group is assigned. "
"If :ref:`GeoIP and country groups <ecommerce/prices/geoip>` are used, public "
"users see the pricelist of their country group by default."
msgstr ""
"En el comercio electrónico, la lista de precios *predeterminada* se "
"selecciona automáticamente para los usuarios públicos que no hayan iniciado "
"sesión cuando no hay ningún grupo de países asignado. Si se utilizan "
":ref:`GeoIP y grupos de países <ecommerce/prices/geoip>`, los usuarios "
"públicos ven de forma predeterminada la lista de precios de su grupo de "
"países."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/prices.rst:206
msgid ""
":ref:`Logged-in users <ecommerce/customer_accounts/shop-access>` "
"with :ref:`assigned pricelists <sales/pricing/customer-pricelist-"
"application>` see the assigned pricelist by default **if it is assigned to "
"the website** they are visiting. If not, the website's default pricelist is "
"applied (i.e., the first available pricelist assigned to the website and "
"without a country group, following the sequence order)."
msgstr ""
":ref:`Los usuarios con sesión iniciada <ecommerce/customer_accounts/shop-"
"access>` con :ref:`listas de precios asignadas <sales/pricing/customer-"
"pricelist-application>` ven la lista de precios asignada de forma "
"predeterminada **si está asignada al sitio web** que están visitando. De lo "
"contrario, se aplica la lista de precios predeterminada del sitio web (es "
"decir, la primera lista de precios disponible asignada al sitio web y sin "
"grupo de países, según el orden de secuencia)."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/prices.rst:212
msgid ""
"Assigned pricelists take precedence over country-based pricelists, when "
"applicable, unless the assigned pricelist is linked to a different country "
"group."
msgstr ""
"Las listas de precios asignadas tienen prioridad sobre las listas de precios "
"basadas en países, cuando aplica, a menos que la lista asignada esté "
"vinculada a un grupo de países distinto."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/prices.rst:216
msgid ""
"A customer from the United States visits the website. They do not have a "
"portal account. The :guilabel:`United States` pricelist is applied."
msgstr ""
"Un cliente de Estados Unidos visita el sitio web y no tiene una cuenta de "
"portal, entonces se aplica la lista de precios \":guilabel:`Estados "
"Unidos`\"."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/prices.rst:219
msgid ""
"A different visitor, also from the United States, has the :guilabel:`Loyal "
"Customer Discount` pricelist assigned in their contact form. This assignment "
"takes precedence over the country group assignment, so the :guilabel:`Loyal "
"Customer Discount` is applied."
msgstr ""
"Otro visitante, también de Estados Unidos, tiene asignada la lista de "
"precios :guilabel:`Descuento para clientes leales` en su formulario de "
"contacto. Esta asignación tiene prioridad sobre la asignación del grupo de "
"países, por lo que se aplica :guilabel:`Descuento para clientes leales`."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/prices.rst:0
msgid "An example of various pricelists assigned to a website."
msgstr "Un ejemplo de varias listas de precios asignadas a un sitio web."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/prices.rst:230
msgid "Discounts"
msgstr "Descuentos"

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/prices.rst:235
msgid "Discounts programs"
msgstr "Programas de descuento"

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/prices.rst:237
msgid ""
"To enable :doc:`discount programs </applications/sales/sales/products_prices/"
"loyalty_discount>` for your e-commerce, go to :menuselection:`Website --> "
"Configuration --> Settings`, scroll down to the :guilabel:`eCommerce` "
"section, and enable the :guilabel:`Discounts, Loyalty & Gift Card` feature."
msgstr ""
"Para habilitar los :doc:`programas de descuento </applications/sales/sales/"
"products_prices/loyalty_discount>` en tu comercio electrónico, ve "
"a :menuselection:`Sitio web --> Configuración --> Ajustes`, dirígete a la "
"sección :guilabel:`Comercio electrónico` y activa la "
"función :guilabel:`Descuentos, programas de lealtad y tarjetas de regalo`."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/prices.rst:241
msgid ""
":ref:`Configure <sales/loyalty_discount/configure-programs>` the discount "
"program, make sure the :guilabel:`Website` option is enabled, and add the "
"relevant :ref:`Pricelist <ecommerce/prices/pricelists>` "
"and :guilabel:`Website` on the program form, if needed."
msgstr ""
":ref:`Configura <sales/loyalty_discount/configure-programs>` el programa de "
"descuentos, asegúrate de que la opción :guilabel:`Sitio web` esté activada "
"y, si es necesario, agrega la :ref:`Lista de precios <ecommerce/prices/"
"pricelists>` y el :guilabel:`Sitio web` correspondientes en el formulario "
"del programa."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/prices.rst:248
msgid "Permanent product discount"
msgstr "Descuento permanente en un producto"

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/prices.rst:250
msgid ""
"When the price of a specific product is permanently reduced, the "
"strikethrough strategy is commonly used. This involves showing the new "
"discounted price, with the original price crossed out alongside it."
msgstr ""
"Cuando el precio de un producto específico se reduce de forma permanente, "
"suele utilizarse la estrategia de tachado. Esto implica mostrar el nuevo "
"precio con descuento junto con el precio original tachado."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/prices.rst:None
msgid "Price strikethrough."
msgstr "Precio tachado."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/prices.rst:257
msgid ""
"To display a permanently discounted price, navigate "
"to :menuselection:`Website --> Configuration --> Settings`, scroll down to "
"the :guilabel:`eCommerce` section, enable the :guilabel:`Comparison Price` "
"option, and :guilabel:`Save`. Then :ref:`go to the product form <ecommerce/"
"products/product-creation>`, enter the new (discounted) price in "
"the :guilabel:`Sales Price` field, and the original price (strikethrough) in "
"the :guilabel:`Compare to Price` field."
msgstr ""
"Para mostrar un precio con descuento permanente, ve a :menuselection:`Sitio "
"web --> Configuración --> Ajustes`, dirígete a la sección "
":guilabel:`Comercio electrónico`, activa la función :guilabel:`Precio "
"comparativo` y haz clic en :guilabel:`Guardar`. Luego, :ref:`ve al "
"formulario del producto <ecommerce/products/product-creation>`, escribe el "
"nuevo precio (con descuento) en el campo :guilabel:`Precio de venta` y el "
"precio original (tachado) en el campo :guilabel:`Comparar al precio`."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/prices.rst:264
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`Compare to Price` field must contain a price that is higher "
"than the :guilabel:`Sales Price` for the original price to appear with a "
"strikethrough."
msgstr ""
"El campo :guilabel:`Comparar al precio` debe tener un valor mayor que "
"el :guilabel:`precio de venta` para que el precio original aparezca tachado."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/prices.rst:268
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`Compare to Price` is not displayed if discounted pricelists "
"apply. If you want to use the :guilabel:`Compare to price` with another "
"discount, configure a pricelist with a :ref:`promotional code <ecommerce/"
"prices/promotional-code>`."
msgstr ""
"El campo :guilabel:`Comparar al precio` no aparecerá si aplicas las listas "
"de precios con descuentos. Si quieres usar :guilabel:`Comparar al precio` "
"junto con otro descuento, configura una lista de precios con un :ref:`código "
"promocional <ecommerce/prices/promotional-code>`."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/prices.rst:273
msgid "Discounted pricelists"
msgstr "Listas de precios con descuentos"

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/prices.rst:275
msgid ""
"It is also possible to create :ref:`pricelists with discounts <sales/"
"products/price-rules>`. To do so, :ref:`create a pricelist <sales/products/"
"pricelist-configuration>` and :ref:`configure the discount <sales/products/"
"price-rules>`."
msgstr ""
"También puedes crear :ref:`listas de precios con descuentos <sales/products/"
"price-rules>`. Para ello, :ref:`crea una lista de precios <sales/products/"
"pricelist-configuration>` y :ref:`configura el descuento <sales/products/"
"price-rules>`."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/prices.rst:279
msgid ""
"If a :ref:`pricelist <ecommerce/prices/pricelists>` contains "
"a :ref:`Discount <sales/products/price-rules>` price type, the price is "
"striked through for applicable customers, even if the :ref:`Comparison Price "
"<ecommerce/prices/permanent-discounts>` feature has not been enabled."
msgstr ""
"Si una :ref:`lista de precios <ecommerce/prices/pricelists>` contiene un "
"tipo de precio con :ref:`descuento <sales/products/price-rules>`, el precio "
"aparecerá tachado para los clientes correspondientes, incluso si la "
"función :ref:`Precio comparativo <ecommerce/prices/permanent-discounts>` no "
"está habilitada."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/prices.rst:285
msgid ""
"If using pricelists with :ref:`country groups <ecommerce/prices/geoip>`, the "
"discounted pricelist must be assigned the same country group as the non-"
"discounted pricelist."
msgstr ""
"Si utilizas listas de precios con :ref:`grupos de países <ecommerce/prices/"
"geoip>`, la lista de precios con descuento debe tener asignado el mismo "
"grupo de países que la lista de precios sin descuento."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/prices.rst:291
msgid "E-commerce promotional code"
msgstr "Código promocional de comercio electrónico"

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/prices.rst:293
msgid ""
"To offer a discounted pricelist for customers with a specific discount code, "
"access the relevant :ref:`pricelist form <ecommerce/prices/pricelists>`, go "
"to the :guilabel:`Ecommerce` tab, and add an :guilabel:`E-commerce "
"Promotional Code`, e.g., `SUMMERSALE10%`."
msgstr ""
"Para ofrecer una lista de precios con descuento a clientes con un código de "
"descuento específico, accede al :ref:`formulario de la lista de precios "
"<ecommerce/prices/pricelists>` correspondiente, ve a la pestaña "
":guilabel:`Comercio electrónico` y agrega un :guilabel:`Código promocional "
"de comercio electrónico`, por ejemplo, `SUMMERSALE10%`."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/prices.rst:297
msgid ""
"Then, go to the :guilabel:`Rules` tab, click :guilabel:`Add a line`, "
"and :ref:`configure the discount <sales/products/price-rules>`. When a "
"customer enters the code during :ref:`checkout <ecommerce/checkout/"
"review_order>`, the discount is applied according to the configuration in "
"the :guilabel:`Rules` tab."
msgstr ""
"Luego, ve a la pestaña :guilabel:`Reglas`, haz clic en :guilabel:`Agregar "
"una línea` y :ref:`configura el descuento <sales/products/price-rules>`. "
"Cuando un cliente introduce el código durante el :ref:`proceso de pago "
"<ecommerce/checkout/review_order>`, el descuento se aplica según la "
"configuración de la pestaña :guilabel:`Reglas`."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/prices.rst:303
msgid ""
"Make sure that the :ref:`Promo Code <ecommerce/checkout/review_order>` "
"option in the website editor is enabled and, if using :ref:`country groups "
"<ecommerce/prices/country-groups>`, that the discounted pricelist has the "
"same country group assigned as the non-discounted pricelist."
msgstr ""
"Asegúrate de que la opción :ref:`Código promocional <ecommerce/checkout/"
"review_order>` esté activada en el editor del sitio web y, si "
"usas :ref:`grupos de países <ecommerce/prices/country-groups>`, de que la "
"lista de precios con descuento tenga el mismo grupo de países asignado que "
"la lista sin descuento."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/prices.rst:310
msgid "Preventing direct sales and hiding prices"
msgstr "Evitar las ventas directas y ocultar los precios"

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/prices.rst:312
msgid ""
"Some businesses, such as :ref:`B2B shops <ecommerce/b2b_b2c/prices>` or "
"companies that sell luxury or custom items, may want to showcase their "
"products online while restricting direct purchases and hiding prices."
msgstr ""
"Algunas empresas, como las :ref:`tiendas B2B <ecommerce/b2b_b2c/prices>` o "
"las empresas que venden artículos de lujo o personalizados, tal vez deseen "
"exhibir sus productos en línea mientras restringen las compras directas y "
"ocultan los precios."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/prices.rst:316
msgid ""
"To control price visibility and prevent direct online sales on the e-"
"commerce site, go to :menuselection:`Website --> Configuration --> "
"Settings`, scroll down to the :guilabel:`eCommerce` section, and "
"enable :guilabel:`Hide Add To Cart`."
msgstr ""
"Para controlar la visibilidad de los precios y evitar las ventas directas en "
"línea en el sitio de comercio electrónico, ve a :menuselection:`Sitio "
"web --> Configuración --> Ajustes`, desplázate hacia abajo hasta la sección "
":guilabel:`Comercio electrónico` y activa :guilabel:`Ocultar Agregar al "
"carrito`."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/prices.rst:320
msgid ""
"Then, select one of the following options from the :guilabel:`For` drop-down "
"list to define which products are affected:"
msgstr ""
"Luego, selecciona una de las siguientes opciones de la lista desplegable "
":guilabel:`Para` para definir a qué productos afecta:"

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/prices.rst:323
msgid ""
"For :guilabel:`0 price products`: On the :ref:`product form <ecommerce/"
"products/product-creation>`, set the price to `0` for all desired products, "
"or create a :ref:`pricelist <ecommerce/prices/pricelists>` where all product "
"prices are set to `0`. The price is then **not** displayed on "
"the :doc:`product page <../ecommerce_design/product_page>`."
msgstr ""
"Para :guilabel:`Productos con precio 0`: en el :ref:`formulario del producto "
"<ecommerce/products/product-creation>`, establece el precio en `0` para "
"todos los productos deseados, o crea una :ref:`lista de precios <ecommerce/"
"prices/pricelists>` donde todos los precios de los productos estén "
"establecidos en `0`. De este modo, el precio **no** se mostrará en la "
":doc:`página del producto <../ecommerce_design/product_page>`."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/prices.rst:329
msgid ""
"Ensure the pricelist is assigned to the correct website and is listed first "
"among the website's pricelists."
msgstr ""
"Asegúrate de que la lista de precios esté asignada al sitio web correcto y "
"que aparezca en primer lugar entre las listas de precios del sitio web."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/prices.rst:332
msgid ""
"For :guilabel:`Specific categories`: Select one or more "
"product :ref:`categories <ecommerce/categories_variants/categories>` from "
"the :guilabel:`Categories` drop-down menu that appears. At least one "
"category **must** be selected. The price is only displayed for products in "
"these categories if it is **not** `0`."
msgstr ""
"Para :guilabel:`Categorías específicas`: selecciona una o más "
":ref:`categorías <ecommerce/categories_variants/categories>` de productos en "
"el menú desplegable :guilabel:`Categorías` que aparece. Se **debe** "
"seleccionar al menos una categoría. El precio solo se muestra para los "
"productos de estas categorías si **no** es `0`."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/prices.rst:337
msgid ""
"Then, enter a redirect URL in the :guilabel:`Link URL` field. "
"The :guilabel:`Add to Cart` button on the :doc:`product page <../"
"ecommerce_design/product_page>` for zero-priced products or the selected "
"shop categories is then replaced by a default :guilabel:`Contact us` button, "
"which can be :ref:`customized <ecommerce/checkout/prevent-sale>` if needed."
msgstr ""
"Luego, ingresa una URL de redireccionamiento en el campo :guilabel:`URL del "
"enlace`. El botón :guilabel:`Agregar al carrito` en la :doc:`página del "
"producto <../ecommerce_design/product_page>` para productos con precio cero "
"o para las categorías seleccionadas de la tienda se sustituye por un botón "
"predeterminado :guilabel:`Contáctanos`, el cual se puede :ref:`personalizar "
"<ecommerce/checkout/prevent-sale>` si es necesario."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/prices.rst:343
msgid ""
"Ensure no pricelist used on the e-commerce has been marked "
"as :guilabel:`Selectable` to prevent accidentally displaying the zero-priced "
"pricelist."
msgstr ""
"Asegúrate de que ninguna lista de precios usada en el comercio electrónico "
"tenga la opción :guilabel:`Se puede seleccionar` activada para evitar "
"mostrar por error la lista de precios con valor cero."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/prices.rst:345
msgid ""
"To hide prices from public visitors while keeping them visible to logged-in "
"customers, create a zero-priced pricelist for non-logged-in customers "
"and :ref:`assign <sales/pricing/customer-pricelist-application>` a regular "
"pricelist (with actual prices) to customers with :doc:`portal access "
"<../../../general/users/user_portals/portal_access>`."
msgstr ""
"Para ocultar los precios a los visitantes públicos pero mantenerlos visibles "
"para los clientes que iniciaron sesión, crea una lista de precios con valor "
"cero para los clientes que no iniciaron sesión y :ref:`asigna <sales/pricing/"
"customer-pricelist-application>` una lista de precios regular (con precios "
"reales) a los clientes con :doc:`acceso al portal <../../../general/users/"
"user_portals/portal_access>`."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/products.rst:5
msgid ""
"Odoo eCommerce allows you to :ref:`create products <ecommerce/products/"
"product-creation>` and manage their :ref:`visibility <ecommerce/products/"
"publish-products>` on the website. Products can be :ref:`configured "
"<ecommerce/products/product-configuration>` in various ways, including "
"adding :ref:`product images and videos <ecommerce/products/images>`, "
"creating :ref:`product combinations <ecommerce/products/combos>`, "
"implementing :ref:`cross-selling and upselling strategies <ecommerce/"
"products/cross_upselling>`, attaching :ref:`digital files <ecommerce/"
"products/digital-files>`, :ref:`translating <ecommerce/products/"
"translation>` product information, :ref:`managing stock <ecommerce/products/"
"stock-management>`, and setting :ref:`packaging options <ecommerce/products/"
"stock-management/packagings>`."
msgstr ""
"Comercio electrónico de Odoo te permite :ref:`crear productos <ecommerce/"
"products/product-creation>` y gestionar su :ref:`visibilidad <ecommerce/"
"products/publish-products>` en el sitio web. Los productos se "
"pueden :ref:`configurar <ecommerce/products/product-configuration>` de "
"varias formas, por ejemplo, se pueden agregar :ref:`imágenes y videos de "
"productos <ecommerce/products/images>`, crear :ref:`combinaciones de "
"productos <ecommerce/products/combos>`, implementar :ref:`estrategias para "
"ventas cruzadas y adicionales <ecommerce/products/cross_upselling>`, "
"adjuntar :ref:`archivos digitales <ecommerce/products/digital-"
"files>`, :ref:`traducir <ecommerce/products/translation>` la información del "
"producto, :ref:`gestionar el inventario <ecommerce/products/stock-"
"management>` y configurar :ref:`operaciones de empaquetamiento <ecommerce/"
"products/stock-management/packagings>`."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/products.rst:18
msgid "Product creation"
msgstr "Creación de productos"

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/products.rst:20
msgid ""
"To create a product from the frontend, go to the Website app, "
"click :guilabel:`New` :icon:`fa-caret-down` in the top-right corner, then "
"select :guilabel:`Product`. Enter the product name and other relevant "
"details, such as the :guilabel:`Barcode`, :guilabel:`Sales Price`, "
"default :guilabel:`Sales Taxes`, and a :ref:`Website Category <ecommerce/"
"categories_variants/categories>`, then add an image. Once you "
"click :guilabel:`Save`, you are redirected to the product page where you "
"can :ref:`customize it <ecommerce_design/product_page/customization>` using "
"the :doc:`website editor </applications/websites/website/web_design>`. Once "
"you are finished, click :guilabel:`Save`. To configure additional "
"advanced :ref:`product details <ecommerce/products/product-configuration>`, "
"click :guilabel:`Product` in the top-right corner to access the backend "
"product form."
msgstr ""
"Para crear un producto desde el frontend, ve a la aplicación Sitio web, haz "
"clic en :guilabel:`Nuevo` :icon:`fa-caret-down` en la esquina superior "
"derecha y selecciona :guilabel:`Producto`. Ingresa el :guilabel:`nombre del "
"producto` y otros detalles importantes como el :guilabel:`código de barras`, "
":guilabel:`precio de venta`, el :guilabel:`impuesto de venta` "
"predeterminado, y la :ref:`categoría de sitio web <ecommerce/"
"categories_variants/categories>`, después, agrega una imagen. Cuando hagas "
"clic en :guilabel:`Guardar` se te redirigirá a la página de producto, que "
"podrás :ref:`personalizar <ecommerce_design/product_page/customization>` con "
"el :doc:`editor de sitio web </applications/websites/website/web_design>`. "
"Cuando hayas terminado, haz clic en :guilabel:`Guardar`. Para configurar "
":ref:`detalles de producto <ecommerce/products/product-configuration>` "
"avanzados, haz clic en :guilabel:`Producto` en la esquina superior derecha "
"para acceder al backend del producto."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/products.rst:31
msgid ""
"It is also possible to create a product from the backend by navigating "
"to :menuselection:`Website --> eCommerce --> Products`. Then:"
msgstr ""
"También es posible crear un formulario de producto desde el backend "
"desde :menuselection:`Sitio web --> Comercio electrónico --> Productos` y "
"después:"

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/products.rst:34
msgid "Configure a new product by clicking :guilabel:`New`, or"
msgstr ""
"Puedes hacer clic en :guilabel:`Nuevo` para configurar un producto nuevo"

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/products.rst:35
