"(:guilabel:`engranaje`) junto a :guilabel:`Productos`. Luego:"

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/products.rst:38
msgid ""
"Select :icon:`fa-download` :ref:`Import <essentials/export_import_data/"
"import-data>`, then click :guilabel:`Upload` to import an XLSX or CSV file "
"from your device; or"
msgstr ""
"Selecciona :icon:`fa-download` :ref:`Importar <essentials/export_import_data/"
