"o CSV desde tu dispositivo; o"

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/products.rst:40
msgid ""
"Click :icon:`fa-globe` :ref:`Import from website <website_creation/import>` "
"to import the product catalog from an existing external website."
msgstr ""
"Haz clic en :icon:`fa-globe` :ref:`Importar desde el sitio web "
"<website_creation/import>` para importar el catálogo de productos desde un "
"sitio web externo existente."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/products.rst:44
msgid ""
":doc:`Create new products using the Barcode Lookup database </applications/"
"inventory_and_mrp/barcode/setup/barcodelookup>`."
msgstr ""
":doc:`Crear nuevos productos con la base de datos de Barcode Lookup </"
"applications/inventory_and_mrp/barcode/setup/barcodelookup>`."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/products.rst:46
msgid ""
":doc:`Configure the Gelato connector in Odoo to synchronize the product "
"catalog and automate order fulfillment with Gelato </applications/sales/"
"sales/gelato>`."
msgstr ""
":doc:`Configurar el conector de Gelato en Odoo para sincronizar el catálogo "
"de productos y automatizar el cumplimiento de órdenes con Gelato </"
"applications/sales/sales/gelato>`."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/products.rst:50
msgid "Product visibility"
msgstr "Visibilidad del producto"

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/products.rst:54
msgid ""
"To publish a product, access the product page on the website and switch the "
"toggle from :guilabel:`Unpublished` to :guilabel:`Published`."
msgstr ""
"Para publicar un producto, accede a la página del producto en el sitio web y "
"cambia la opción :guilabel:`No publicado` a :guilabel:`Publicado`."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/products.rst:58
msgid ""
"To access the product page from the product form in the backend, click "
"the :icon:`fa-globe` :guilabel:`Go to Website` smart button."
msgstr ""
"Para acceder a la página del producto desde el formulario del producto en el "
"backend, haz clic en el botón inteligente :icon:`fa-globe` :guilabel:`Ir al "
"sitio web`."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/products.rst:60
msgid ""
"To publish products from the backend, navigate to the :guilabel:`eCommerce` "
"tab of the :ref:`product form <ecommerce/products/product-form>`, then go to "
"the :guilabel:`Shop` section and toggle the :guilabel:`Published` switch on "
"or choose a date from the :guilabel:`Publish on` field to automatically "
"publish the product on the given date and time."
msgstr ""
"Para publicar productos desde el backend, ve a la pestaña "
":guilabel:`Comercio electrónico` del :ref:`formulario del producto "
"<ecommerce/products/product-form>`, luego ve a la sección :guilabel:`Tienda` "
"y activa el interruptor :guilabel:`Publicado` o elige una fecha en el campo "
":guilabel:`Publicar el` para publicar de forma automática el producto en la "
"fecha y hora indicadas."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/products.rst:65
msgid "To publish multiple products at once, follow these steps:"
msgstr ""
"Para publicar varios productos al mismo tiempo, sigue los siguientes pasos:"

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/products.rst:67
msgid "Go to :menuselection:`Website --> eCommerce --> Products`."
msgstr ""
"Ve a :menuselection:`Sitio web --> Comercio electrónico --> Productos`."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/products.rst:68
msgid ""
"Remove the :guilabel:`Published` filter and switch to the :guilabel:`List` "
"view."
msgstr ""
"Quite el filtro :guilabel:`Publicado` y cambie a la vista "
"de :guilabel:`Lista`."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/products.rst:69
msgid ""
"Click the :icon:`fa-sliders` (:guilabel:`dropdown toggle`) icon on the far "
"right of the view and enable :guilabel:`Is Published`."
msgstr ""
"Haz clic en el icono :icon:`fa-sliders` (:guilabel:`menú desplegable`) a la "
"derecha de la vista y activa :guilabel:`Está publicado`."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/products.rst:71
msgid ""
"Click the :guilabel:`Is Published` column to re-order it by *published* or "
"*unpublished* products."
msgstr ""
"Haga clic en la columna :guilabel:`Está publicado` para ordenar los "
"productos como *publicados* o *sin publicar*."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/products.rst:73
msgid "Select the products to publish by ticking their box on the far left."
msgstr "Selecciona la casilla a un lado de los productos que quieras publicar."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/products.rst:74
msgid ""
"In the :guilabel:`Is Published` column, tick the box for any of the selected "
"products, then :guilabel:`Update` to publish them."
msgstr ""
"En la columna :guilabel:`Está publicado`, marca la casilla de cualquiera de "
"los productos seleccionados, luego :guilabel:`Actualiza` para publicarlo."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/products.rst:80
msgid ""
"When managing multiple websites, the availability of a product on each "
"website can be set from the :ref:`product form <ecommerce/products/product-"
"form>`. Navigate to the :guilabel:`eCommerce` tab, then in "
"the :guilabel:`Shop` section, select the :guilabel:`Website` where the "
"product should be available. Leave the field blank to make the product "
"available on *all* websites. You can make a product available on either "
"*one* website or *all* websites, but selecting only *some* websites is not "
"possible. To sell the product on multiple specific websites without making "
"it available on all of them, **duplicate** the product for each website and "
"assign the corresponding website to each duplicate."
msgstr ""
"Al gestionar varios sitios web, la disponibilidad de un producto en cada "
"sitio web se puede establecer desde el :ref:`formulario del producto "
"<ecommerce/products/product-form>`. Ve a la pestaña :guilabel:`Ventas` y "
"luego, en la sección :guilabel:`Tienda de comercio electrónico`, selecciona "
"el :guilabel:`Sitio web` en el que el producto debe estar disponible. Deja "
"el campo en blanco para que el producto esté disponible en *todos* los "
"sitios web. Puedes hacer que un producto esté disponible en *un* sitio web o "
"en *todos*, pero no puedes seleccionar solo *algunos*. Para vender el "
"producto en varios sitios web específicos sin que esté disponible en todos, "
"**duplica** el producto para cada sitio web y asigna el sitio web "
"correspondiente en cada duplicado."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/products.rst:92
msgid "Product configuration"
msgstr "Configuración de productos"

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/products.rst:96
msgid ""
"To add general information to a product, navigate to :menuselection:`Website "
"--> eCommerce --> Products` and select the relevant product. You can "
"configure various options, such as choosing a :doc:`product type </"
"applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/product_management/configure/"
"type>`, adding :doc:`variants and categories <categories_variants>`, or "
"defining :doc:`prices <prices>`."
msgstr ""
"Para agregar información general al producto, ve a :menuselection:`Sitio web "
"--> Comercio electrónico --> Productos` y selecciona el producto relevante. "
"Puedes configurar varias opciones, como elegir un :doc:`tipo de producto </"
"applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/product_management/configure/"
"type>`, agregar :doc:`variantes y categorías <categories_variants>`, o "
"definir :doc:`precios <prices>`."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/products.rst:103
msgid ""
"Additionally, add an e-commerce-specific product description to be displayed "
"below the product name on the frontend :doc:`product page <../"
"ecommerce_design/product_page>`. To do so, go to the :guilabel:`eCommerce` "
"tab, scroll down to the :guilabel:`Long description` section, and write a "
"description. Use Odoo's :doc:`rich-text editor </applications/essentials/"
"html_editor>` to customize the content."
msgstr ""
"Además, agrega una descripción del producto específica para el comercio "
"electrónico que se mostrará debajo del nombre del producto en la "
":doc:`página del producto <../ecommerce_design/product_page>` del frontend. "
"Para hacerlo, ve a la pestaña :guilabel:`Comercio electrónico`, baja a la "
"sección :guilabel:`Descripción larga` y redacta una descripción. Utiliza el "
":doc:`editor de texto enriquecido </applications/essentials/html_editor>` de "
"Odoo para personalizar el contenido."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/products.rst:110
msgid ""
"Click the :icon:`fa-globe` :guilabel:`Go to Website` smart button to access "
"the frontend product page and :doc:`customize <../ecommerce_design/"
"product_page>` it using the :doc:`website editor <../../website/web_design>`."
msgstr ""
"Haz clic en el botón inteligente :icon:`fa-globe` :guilabel:`Ir a sitio web` "
"para acceder a la página del producto en el frontend y :doc:`personalízala "
"<../ecommerce_design/product_page>` usando el :doc:`editor de sitio web "
"<../../website/web_design>`."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/products.rst:113
msgid ""
"Product descriptions can also be generated using :doc:`AI </applications/"
"productivity/ai>`. To do so, type `/` in the :guilabel:`Long description` "
"section and select :guilabel:`AI` to open the :doc:`AI agent </applications/"
"productivity/ai/agents>`."
msgstr ""
"Las descripciones de producto también se pueden generar con :doc:`IA </"
"applications/productivity/ai>`. Para hacerlo, escribe `/` en la sección "
":guilabel:`Descripción larga` y selecciona :guilabel:`IA` para abrir el "
":doc:`agente de IA </applications/productivity/ai/agents>`."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/products.rst:120
#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/ecommerce_design/product_page.rst:17
msgid "Product images and videos"
msgstr "Imágenes y videos para los productos"

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/products.rst:122
msgid ""
"To add media items, such as images and videos, navigate to the :ref:`product "
"form <ecommerce/products/product-form>` and go to the :guilabel:`eCommerce` "
"tab. In the :guilabel:`Media` section, click :guilabel:`Add Media`. In "
"the :guilabel:`Select a media` pop-up window:"
msgstr ""
"Para agregar elementos multimedia, como imágenes y videos, ve al "
":ref:`formulario del producto <ecommerce/products/product-form>` y accede a "
"la pestaña :guilabel:`Comercio electrónico`. En la sección "
":guilabel:`Multimedia`, haz clic en :guilabel:`Agregar multimedia`. En la "
"ventana emergente :guilabel:`Seleccionar un archivo multimedia`:"

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/products.rst:126
msgid ""
"To add an image, select an image, click :guilabel:`Add URL` "
"or :guilabel:`Upload an image` in the :guilabel:`Images` tab."
msgstr ""
"Para agregar una imagen, selecciónala, haz clic en :guilabel:`Agregar URL` "
"o :guilabel:`Subir una imagen` en la pestaña :guilabel:`Imágenes`."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/products.rst:128
msgid ""
"To add a video, navigate to the :guilabel:`Videos` tab, paste a video URL, "
"or :ref:`embed HTML code <website/building_blocks/embed_code>`. Then, enable "
"the relevant :ref:`video options <website/elements/videos>`."
msgstr ""
"Para agregar un video, ve a la pestaña :guilabel:`Videos`, pega la URL de un "
"video, o :ref:`inserta código HTML <website/building_blocks/embed_code>`. "
"Luego, activa las :ref:`opciones relevantes de video <website/elements/"
"videos>`."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/products.rst:132
msgid "Once the media is selected, click :guilabel:`Add`."
msgstr "Cuando selecciones los medios, haz clic en :guilabel:`Agregar`."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/products.rst:135
msgid ""
":ref:`Customize product images and videos <ecommerce/product_page/image-"
"customization>` using the :doc:`website editor <../../website/web_design>` "
"from the frontend."
msgstr ""
":ref:`Personaliza imágenes y videos del producto <ecommerce/product_page/"
"image-customization>` con el :doc:`editor de sitio web <../../website/"
"web_design>` desde el frontend."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/products.rst:141
msgid "Product combos"
msgstr "Combos de productos"

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/products.rst:143
msgid ""
":ref:`Product combinations <pos/products/combos>` allow users to configure a "
"set of related products to buy as a bundle. To :ref:`configure combos <pos/"
"products/combo-choices>`, go to :menuselection:`Website --> eCommerce --> "
"Combo Choices`. Once finished and published, customers can choose the combo "
"when adding the product to the cart. Depending on the configuration, certain "
"items may incur an additional charge."
msgstr ""
"Las :ref:`combinaciones de productos <pos/products/combos>` te permiten "
"configurar un conjunto de productos relacionados para venderlos en paquete. "
"Para :ref:`configurar combos <pos/products/combo-choices>`, ve "
"a :menuselection:`Sitio web --> Comercio electrónico --> Opciones de los "
"combos`. Una vez que hayas terminado y los publiques, los clientes pueden "
"elegir el combo al agregar el producto al carrito. Según la configuración, "
"es posible que algunos artículos tengan un costo adicional."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/products.rst:None
msgid "Add the combo product to the cart."
msgstr "Agrega el producto en combo al carrito."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/products.rst:156
msgid "Cross-selling & Upselling"
msgstr "Ventas cruzadas y ventas adicionales"

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/products.rst:158
msgid ""
"Cross-selling and upselling are sales techniques used to present customers "
"with additional or higher-tier products and services from the :doc:`catalog "
"<../../ecommerce/ecommerce_design/catalog>`. Cross-selling focuses on "
"recommending accessory or :doc:`optional products </applications/sales/sales/"
"sales_quotations/optional_products>` alongside the item being purchased "
"during ordering and checkout. Upselling, on the other hand, encourages "
"customers to choose a higher-priced or upgraded alternative product."
msgstr ""
"Las ventas cruzadas y ventas adicionales son técnicas de ventas que se usan "
"para darle a los clientes productos y servicios adicionales o de gama alta "
"desde el :doc:`catálog <../../ecommerce/ecommerce_design/catalog>`. Las "
"ventas cruzadas se enfocan en recomendar productos accesorios :doc:`u "
"opcionales </applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/optional_products>` "
"junto con el artículo que se está comprando durante la orden o el proceso de "
"pago. Las ventas adicionales, por otro lado, convencen a los clientes "
"comprar productos más caros o a precio más alto."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/products.rst:165
msgid ""
"To configure these product suggestions, go to :menuselection:`Website --> "
"eCommerce --> Products`, select the relevant product, go to "
"the :guilabel:`Sales` tab, and add the desired products in the "
"corresponding :guilabel:`Optional Products`, :guilabel:`Accessory Products`, "
"and/or :guilabel:`Alternative Products` fields."
msgstr ""
"Para configurar estas sugerencias de productos, ve a :menuselection:`Sitio "
"web --> Comercio electrónico --> Productos` y selecciona los producto "
"relevantes. Ve a la pestaña :guilabel:`Ventas` y agrega los productos "
"deseados en los campos de :guilabel:`Productos opcionales`, "
":guilabel:`Productos accesorios` o :guilabel:`Productos alternos` "
"correspondientes."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/products.rst:172
msgid "Optional products"
msgstr "Productos opcionales"

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/products.rst:174
msgid ""
"Optional products are suggested when the customer clicks the :guilabel:`Add "
"to cart` button to buy a specific product."
msgstr ""
"Los productos opcionales se sugieren cuando el cliente hace clic en el "
"botón :guilabel:`Agregar al carrito` para comprar un producto específico."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/products.rst:0
msgid "Optional products cross-selling."
msgstr "Venta cruzada de productos opcionales."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/products.rst:180
msgid "Accessory products"
msgstr "Accesorios"

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/products.rst:182
msgid ""
"Accessory products appear in the :guilabel:`Suggested accessories` section "
"during the :guilabel:`Order summary` step, just prior to proceeding to "
"checkout."
msgstr ""
"Los productos accesorios en la sección :guilabel:`Accesorios sugeridos` "
"durante el paso :guilabel:`Resumen de la orden`, justo antes de continuar al "
"pago."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/products.rst:0
msgid "Suggested accessories at checkout during cart review"
msgstr "Accesorios sugeridos durante la confirmación del carrito."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/products.rst:189
msgid ""
"To hide this section, open the :doc:`website editor <../../website/"
"web_design>`, go to the :guilabel:`Style` tab, and toggle "
"the :guilabel:`Suggested Accessories` switch off."
msgstr ""
"Para ocultar esta sección, abre el :doc:`editor de sitio web <../../website/"
"web_design>`, ve a la pestaña :guilabel:`Estilo` y deshabilita la "
"opción :guilabel:`Accesorios sugeridos`."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/products.rst:192
msgid "Alternative products"
msgstr "Productos alternos"

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/products.rst:194
msgid ""
"Alternative products are displayed at the bottom of the :doc:`product page "
"<../ecommerce_design/product_page>` under the :guilabel:`Alternative "
"Products` heading."
msgstr ""
"Los productos alternos se pueden mostrar en la parte inferior de "
"la :doc:`página de producto <../ecommerce_design/product_page>`, en el "
"encabezado :guilabel:`Productos alternos`."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/products.rst:0
msgid "The alternative products section of an product page."
msgstr "La sección de productos alternativos de una página de producto."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/products.rst:201
msgid ""
"To customize this block, open the :doc:`website editor <../../website/"
"web_design>`, click the block on the page, and :doc:`adapt the heading and "
"text <../../website/web_design/elements>` if necessary. Go to "
"the :guilabel:`Style` tab, scroll to the :guilabel:`Alternative Products` "
"section, and modify the options as needed."
msgstr ""
"Para personalizar este bloque, abre el :doc:`editor de sitios web <../../"
"website/web_design>`, haz clic en el bloque en la página y :doc:`adapta el "
"encabezado y el texto <../../website/web_design/elements>` si es necesario. "
"Ve a la pestaña :guilabel:`Estilo`, baja a la sección :guilabel:`Productos "
"alternos` y modifica las opciones como sea necesario."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/products.rst:207
msgid ""
"To automatically add optional, accessory, and alternative products in "
"the :guilabel:`Sales` tab, go to :menuselection:`Website --> Configuration --"
"> Settings`, scroll down to the :guilabel:`eCommerce` section, and "
"enable :guilabel:`Automate suggested products`. Suggested products are "
"assigned to each product based on its :ref:`e-commerce category <ecommerce/"
"categories_variants/categories>`."
msgstr ""
"Para agregar automáticamente productos opcionales, accesorios y alternativos "
"en la pestaña :guilabel:`Ventas`, ve a :menuselection:`Sitio web --> "
"Configuración --> Ajustes`, baja a la sección :guilabel:`Comercio "
"electrónico` y activa :guilabel:`Automatizar productos sugeridos`. Los "
"productos sugeridos se asignan a cada producto según su :ref:`categoría de "
"comercio electrónico <ecommerce/categories_variants/categories>`."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/products.rst:216
msgid "Digital files"
msgstr "Archivos digitales"

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/products.rst:218
msgid ""
"It is possible to link digital files, such as certificates, eBooks, or user "
"manuals, to the products. To do so, go to the :ref:`product form <ecommerce/"
"products/product-form>` and click the :icon:`fa-file-text-"
"o` :guilabel:`Documents` smart button. Then, click :guilabel:`Upload` to "
"upload a file directly, or for additional options, click :guilabel:`New`. "
"Choose the :guilabel:`Type` of attachment:"
msgstr ""
"Es posible vincular archivos digitales, como certificados, eBooks, o "
"manuales del usuario a los productos. Para hacerlo, ve al :ref:`formulario "
"del producto <ecommerce/products/product-form>` y haz clic en el botón "
"inteligente :icon:`fa-file-text-o` :guilabel:`Documentos`. Después, haz clic "
"en :guilabel:`Subir` para subir un archivo directamente, o para ver opciones "
"adicionales, haz clic en :guilabel:`Nuevo`. Selecciona el :guilabel:`tipo` "
"de archivo adjunto:"

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/products.rst:224
msgid ":guilabel:`File`: :guilabel:`Upload your file`."
msgstr ":guilabel:`Archivo`: :guilabel:`Sube tu archivo`."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/products.rst:225
msgid ":guilabel:`URL`: Insert the link to the file or media item."
msgstr ":guilabel:`URL`: Inserta el enlace al archivo o elemento multimedia."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/products.rst:226
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Cloud Storage` (if applicable): Insert a link to your cloud "
"storage to store the file on the :doc:`cloud storage </applications/general/"
"integrations/cloud_storage>` platform instead of the database’s server."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Almacenamiento en la nube` (si aplica): Inserta un enlace a tu "
"almacenamiento en la nube para almacenar el archivo :doc:`en la nube </"
"applications/general/integrations/cloud_storage>` en lugar de en el servidor "
"de la base de datos."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/products.rst:230
msgid "These documents can be made available:"
msgstr "Estos documentos se pueden hacer disponibles:"

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/products.rst:232
msgid ""
"On the product page (before checkout): Set the :guilabel:`Sales visibility` "
"field to :guilabel:`Hidden` and enable :guilabel:`Publish on website`."
msgstr ""
"En la página de producto (antes del pago): En el "
"campo :guilabel:`Visibilidad de ventas` selecciona :guilabel:`Oculto` y "
"activa :guilabel:`Publicar en el sitio web`."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/products.rst:234
msgid ""
"In the :doc:`customer portal </applications/general/users/user_portals>` on "
"the confirmed sales order (after checkout): Set the :guilabel:`Sales "
"visibility` field to :guilabel:`On confirmed order` and "
"disable :guilabel:`Publish on website`."
msgstr ""
"En el :doc:`portal del cliente </applications/general/users/user_portals>` "
"en la orden de ventas confirmada (después del pago): En el "
"campo :guilabel:`Visibilidad de ventas` selecciona :guilabel:`Al confirmar "
"la orden` y desactiva :guilabel:`Publicar en el sitio web`."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/products.rst:239
msgid ""
"In :ref:`Kanban <studio/views/multiple-records/kanban>` view, click "
"the :icon:`fa-ellipsis-v` (:guilabel:`dropdown menu`) in the top-right "
"corner of the document card to :guilabel:`Edit`, :guilabel:`Delete`, "
"or :guilabel:`Download` the document."
msgstr ""
"En la vista de :ref:`kanban <studio/views/multiple-records/kanban>`, haz "
"clic en :icon:`fa-ellipsis-v` (:guilabel:`menú desplegable`) en la esquina "
"superior derecha de la tarjeta del documento "
"para :guilabel:`editar`, :guilabel:`eliminar` o :guilabel:`descargar` el "
"documento."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/products.rst:246
msgid "Translation"
msgstr "Traducción"

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/products.rst:248
msgid ""
"If a website is available in multiple languages, product information can be "
"translated directly on the :ref:`product form <ecommerce/products/product-"
"form>`. Fields that support multiple languages are identifiable by their "
"language abbreviation (e.g., `EN`) next to the field, such as "
"the :guilabel:`Product name`, :ref:`Out-of-Stock Message <ecommerce/products/"
"stock-management>`, the :ref:`e-commerce description <ecommerce/products/"
"description>`, :ref:`ribbon or badge <ecommerce/products/additional_features/"
"product-highlight>` names, :doc:`categories and variants "
"<categories_variants>` names, etc."
msgstr ""
"Si el sitio web está disponible en varios idiomas, la información del "
"producto se puede traducir directamente en el :ref:`formulario del producto "
"<ecommerce/products/product-form>`. Los campos que son compatibles con "
"varios idiomas se pueden identificar porque aparece la abreviatura del "
"idioma (por ejemplo, `ES`) a la derecha del campo traducible, como "
":guilabel:`Nombre del producto`, :ref:`Mensaje que aparecerá cuando no haya "
"existencias <ecommerce/products/stock-management>`, la :ref:`Descripción de "
"comercio electrónico <ecommerce/products/description>`, los nombres "
":ref:`del listón o insignia <ecommerce/products/additional_features/product-"
"highlight>`, los nombres de :doc:`categorías y variantes "
"<categories_variants>`, etc."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/products.rst:257
msgid ""
"Having untranslated content on a web page may be detrimental to the user "
"experience and :doc:`SEO </applications/websites/website/structure/seo>`. To "
"avoid this, use the :ref:`Translate <translate/translate>` feature to "
"translate any remaining untranslated content on the page."
msgstr ""
"Tener contenido no traducido en la página web no es ideal para la "
"experiencia del usuario y para el :doc:`SEO </applications/websites/website/"
"structure/seo>`. Para evitarlo, usa la función :ref:`Traducir <translate/"
"translate>` para traducir cualquier contenido que no esté traducido en la "
"página."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/products.rst:263
msgid ""
":doc:`Website languages and translations </applications/websites/website/"
"configuration/translate>`"
msgstr ""
":doc:`Idiomas y traducciones del sitio web </applications/websites/website/"
"configuration/translate>`"

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/products.rst:269
#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/order_handling.rst:178
msgid "Stock management"
msgstr "Gestión de existencias"

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/products.rst:271
msgid ""
"To configure stock-related e-commerce options, go to :menuselection:`Website "
"--> Configuration --> Settings`, scroll down to the :guilabel:`eCommerce` "
"section, then to the :guilabel:`Inventory Defaults` subsection. The "
"following settings are available:"
msgstr ""
"Para configurar las opciones relacionadas al inventario y comercio "
"electrónico, ve a :menuselection:`Sitio web --> Configuración --> Ajustes`, "
"baja a la sección :guilabel:`Comercio electrónico` y luego a la "
"subsección :guilabel:`Valores predeterminados de la aplicación Inventario`. "
"Te encontrarás con los ajustes a continuación:"

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/products.rst:275
msgid ""
"If multiple :doc:`warehouses </applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/"
"warehouses_storage/inventory_management/warehouses>` exist, select the "
"relevant one from the :guilabel:`Warehouse` dropdown menu to set it as the "
"default."
msgstr ""
"Si tienes varios :doc:`almacenes </applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/"
"warehouses_storage/inventory_management/warehouses>`, selecciona el "
"relevante en el menú desplegable :guilabel:`Almacén` para que este sea el "
"predeterminado."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/products.rst:279
msgid ""
"Next to :guilabel:`Out-of-Stock`, enable :guilabel:`Continue Selling` to "
"allow customers to place orders even when the product is out of stock. Keep "
"this option disabled to prevent customers from ordering products that are "
"out of stock."
msgstr ""
"A un lado de :guilabel:`Sin existencias`, activa la opción :guilabel:`Seguir "
"vendiendo` para que los clientes puedan realizar órdenes incluso cuando un "
"producto ya no tenga existencias. Mantén esta opción desactivada para evitar "
"que los clientes ordenen productos que ya no tengan existencias."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/products.rst:282
msgid ""
"Enable the :guilabel:`Show Available Quantity` option to display the "
"remaining available quantity on the product page when it drops below a "
"defined threshold. The available quantity is calculated based on "
"the :guilabel:`On hand` quantity minus the quantity already :doc:`reserved </"
"applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/"
"reservation_methods>` for outgoing transfers."
msgstr ""
"Activa la opción :guilabel:`Mostrar cantidad disponible` para mostrar la "
"cantidad disponible restante en la página del producto cuando sea menor que "
"el margen establecido. La cantidad disponible se calcula según la "
"cantidad :guilabel:`a la mano` menos la cantidad que ya está :doc:`reservada "
"</applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/"
"reservation_methods>` para transferencias salientes."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/products.rst:288
msgid ""
"These settings apply to *all* products, but can be adapted for individual "
"products if needed. To do so, go to the product form and ensure "
"the :ref:`Track inventory option <inventory/product_management/tracking-"
"inventory>` is enabled."
msgstr ""
"Estos ajustes se aplican a *todos* los productos, pero se pueden adaptar "
"para productos individuales si es necesario. Para hacerlo, ve al formulario "
"del producto y asegúrate de que la :ref:`opción Seguir inventario <inventory/"
"product_management/tracking-inventory>` esté habilitada."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/products.rst:293
msgid ""
"When the :doc:`Inventory app </applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory>` is "
"installed, and :ref:`lots and serial numbers are enabled <inventory/"
"product_management/enable-lot-serial>`, select an option from "
"the :guilabel:`Tracking` dropdown menu."
msgstr ""
"Cuando la :doc:`aplicación Inventario </applications/inventory_and_mrp/"
"inventory>` esté instalada y :ref:`los números de lote y de serie estén "
"habilitados <inventory/product_management/enable-lot-serial>`, selecciona "
"una opción en el menú desplegable :guilabel:`Seguimiento`."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/products.rst:297
msgid ""
"Then, navigate to the :guilabel:`eCommerce` tab and, in "
"the :guilabel:`Inventory` section, enable or disable the "
"relevant :guilabel:`Sell when Out-of-Stock` and :guilabel:`Show Available "
"Qty` options. You can also compose a custom :guilabel:`Out-of-Stock "
"Message`. If the field is left empty, the default message `Out of Stock` is "
"displayed on the product page when the item is no longer in stock."
msgstr ""
"Luego, ve a la pestaña :guilabel:`Comercio electrónico` y, en la sección "
":guilabel:`Inventario`, habilita o deshabilita las opciones correspondientes "
":guilabel:`Vender cuando no haya existencias` y :guilabel:`Mostrar cantidad "
"disponible`. También puedes redactar un :guilabel:`Mensaje por falta de "
"existencias` personalizado. Si el campo se deja vacío, el mensaje "
"predeterminado `Agotado` se mostrará en la página del producto cuando el "
"artículo ya no tenga existencias."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/products.rst:303
msgid ""
"Modifying the general :guilabel:`Inventory Defaults` settings does not "
"automatically modify the related option(s) on the product form for existing "
"products; it only affects products created after the feature is enabled/"
"disabled."
msgstr ""
"Modificar los ajustes de :guilabel:`Valores predeterminados de la aplicación "
"Inventario` no modifica de forma automática las opciones relacionadas en el "
"formulario de producto de los productos existentes. Este ajuste solo afecta "
"a los productos que se hayan creado después de que se haya activado o "
"desactivado."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/products.rst:306
msgid ""
"To display the stock level on the product page, the :guilabel:`Product Type` "
"field on the :ref:`product form <ecommerce/products/product-form>` must be "
"set to :guilabel:`Goods` or :guilabel:`Combo`."
msgstr ""
"Para mostrar los niveles de existencias en la página del producto, el "
"campo :guilabel:`Tipo de producto` en el :ref:`formulario del producto "
"<ecommerce/products/product-form>` se debe configurar "
"como :guilabel:`Bienes` o :guilabel:`Combo`."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/products.rst:309
msgid ""
"A :icon:`fa-envelope-o` (:guilabel:`envelope`) :guilabel:`Get notified when "
"back in stock` button appears on the product page when an item is out of "
"stock. Customers can click the link to enter their email address and receive "
"a notification once the item is back in stock."
msgstr ""
"Aparece un botón :icon:`fa-envelope-o` (:guilabel:`sobre`) :guilabel:`Recibe "
"una notificación cuando el producto vuelva a estar disponible` en la página "
"del producto cuando el artículo ya no tiene existencias. Los clientes pueden "
"hacer clic en el enlace para ingresar la dirección de correo y recibir una "
"notificación una vez que el artículo vuelva a tener existencias."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/products.rst:313
msgid ""
"You can also add an :ref:`out-of-stock ribbon or badge <ecommerce/products/"
"additional_features/product-highlight>` in the :guilabel:`Shop` section of "
"the :guilabel:`eCommerce` tab on the :ref:`product form <ecommerce/products/"
"product-form>`."
msgstr ""
"También puedes agregar una :ref:`cinta o insignia de falta de existencias "
"<ecommerce/products/additional_features/product-highlight>` en la sección "
":guilabel:`Tienda` de la pestaña :guilabel:`Comercio electrónico` del "
":ref:`formulario del producto <ecommerce/products/product-form>`."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/products.rst:316
msgid ""
"If the :ref:`Click & Collect <ecommerce/shipping/instore-pickup>` feature is "
"enabled, the product availability is displayed on the product page based on "
"the stock in the warehouse defined on the related :doc:`delivery method </"
"applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/"
"setup_configuration/new_delivery_method>` form."
msgstr ""
"Si la función :ref:`Hacer clic y recolectar <ecommerce/shipping/instore-"
"pickup>` está activada, la disponibilidad del producto se muestra en la "
"página del producto según las existencias en el almacén definido en el "
"formulario de :doc:`método de entrega </applications/inventory_and_mrp/"
"inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/new_delivery_method>` "
"relacionado."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/products.rst:323
msgid ""
"Currently, the `Boko Chair` is not available in any warehouses. However, "
"customers can click the :icon:`fa-envelope-o` "
"(:guilabel:`envelope`) :guilabel:`Get notified when back in stock` link to "
"receive a notification as soon as the product becomes available again. A "
"custom :guilabel:`Out-of-Stock Message` can also be added to inform "
"customers that the item will be replenished."
msgstr ""
"Por ahora, el producto `silla Boko` no está disponible en ningún almacén. "
"Sin embargo, los clientes pueden hacer clic en el enlace :icon:`fa-envelope-"
"o` (:guilabel:`sobre`) :guilabel:`Recibe una notificación cuando el producto "
"vuelva a estar disponible` para recibir una notificación cuando vuelva a "
"haber existencias del producto. También se puede agregar un "
":guilabel:`mensaje que aparecerá cuando no haya existencias` para recibir "
"una notificación tan pronto como el producto vuelva a estar disponible."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/products.rst:0
msgid ""
"Example of a product that is out of stock, but which will be available again."
msgstr ""
"Ejemplo de un producto del que ya no se tienen existencias, pero que volverá "
"a estar disponible."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/products.rst:333
msgid ""
"If a unique reference is needed for inventory management, install "
"the :doc:`Manufacturing app </applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing>` "
"and create :doc:`kit bills of materials </applications/inventory_and_mrp/"
"manufacturing/advanced_configuration/kit_shipping>`. Each kit links its "
"published \"virtual\" products to the main reference tracked in Inventory. "
"This ensures that any item sold on the website is converted into the "
"corresponding stocked item in the delivery order."
msgstr ""
"Si necesitas una referencia única para gestionar el inventario, instala la "
"aplicación :doc:`Manufactura </applications/inventory_and_mrp/"
"manufacturing>` y crea :doc:`listas de materiales de tipo kit </applications/"
"inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/advanced_configuration/kit_shipping>`. Cada "
"kit vincula los productos \"virtuales\" publicados con la referencia "
"principal que se rastrea en Inventario. Esto garantiza que cualquier "
"artículo que vendas en el sitio web se convierta en el artículo "
"correspondiente con existencias en la orden de entrega."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/products.rst:343
msgid "Packagings"
msgstr "Embalajes"

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/products.rst:345
msgid ""
"To offer different product pack sizes to customers on the e-commerce, "
"configure product :doc:`packagings </applications/inventory_and_mrp/"
"inventory/product_management/configure/packaging>`. Then go to "
"the :ref:`product form <ecommerce/products/product-form>` and navigate to "
"the :guilabel:`Sales` tab. Under :guilabel:`Upsell & cross-sell`, add as "
"many package types as needed in the :guilabel:`Packagings` field. The "
"available package types are displayed on the e-commerce :doc:`product page "
"<../ecommerce_design/product_page>`."
msgstr ""
"Para ofrecer diferentes tamaños de paquete de producto a los clientes en el "
"comercio electrónico, configura el :doc:`embalaje </applications/"
"inventory_and_mrp/inventory/product_management/configure/packaging>` de los "
"productos. Después, ve al :ref:`formulario de los productos <ecommerce/"
"products/product-form>` y navega a la pestaña :guilabel:`Ventas`. "
"En :guilabel:`Ventas adicionales y ventas cruzadas` agrega todos los tipos "
"de paquete que sean necesarios en el campo :guilabel:`Embalaje`. Los tipos "
"de paquete disponibles se muestran en la :doc:`página del producto <../"
"ecommerce_design/product_page>` en comercio electrónico."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/products.rst:None
msgid "Product packages on the e-commerce page."
msgstr "Embalajes de productos en la página de comercio electrónico."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/products.rst:357
msgid ""
"It is also possible to add packagings to a specific :ref:`product variant "
"<ecommerce/categories_variants/product-variants>`. To do so, go to the "
"product form, click the :icon:`fa-sitemap` :guilabel:`Variants` :ref:`smart "
"button <products/variants/variants-smart-button>`, and select the relevant "
"product variant. Under :guilabel:`Sales`, add as many package types as "
"needed in the :guilabel:`Packagings` field."
msgstr ""
"También es posible agregar embalajes a una :ref:`variante de producto "
"<ecommerce/categories_variants/product-variants>` específica. Para hacerlo, "
"ve al formulario del producto, haz clic en el :ref:`botón inteligente "
"<products/variants/variants-smart-button>` :icon:`fa-"
"sitemap` :guilabel:`Variantes` y selecciona la variante del producto que "
"necesites. En :guilabel:`Ventas` agrega todos los tipos de embalaje que "
"necesites en el campo :guilabel:`Embalajes`."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/products.rst:362
msgid ""
"To prevent selected packaging units from being sold on the e-commerce, go "
"to :menuselection:`Website --> Configuration --> Settings`, and scroll down "
"to the :guilabel:`eCommerce` section. Then, under :guilabel:`Restrict "
"Packagings`, select the units that should not be available for sale."
msgstr ""
"Para evitar que se vendan unidades de empaquetado seleccionadas en el "
"comercio electrónico, ve a :menuselection:`Sitio web --> Configuración --> "
"Ajustes` y baja hasta la sección :guilabel:`Comercio electrónico`. Luego, en "
":guilabel:`Restringir empaquetados`, selecciona las unidades que no deberían "
"estar disponibles para la venta."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/ecommerce_design.rst:9
msgid ""
"Customize the design of the :doc:`product pages <../ecommerce/"
"ecommerce_design/product_page>`, structure the :doc:`product catalog <../"
"ecommerce/ecommerce_design/catalog>` and use :doc:`additional features <../"
"ecommerce/ecommerce_design/additional_features>` to improve the customer's "
"shopping experience."
msgstr ""
"Personaliza el diseño de las :doc:`páginas de producto <../ecommerce/"
"ecommerce_design/product_page>`, estructura el :doc:`catálogo de producto "
"<../ecommerce/ecommerce_design/catalog>` y utiliza :doc:`las funciones "
"adicionales <../ecommerce/ecommerce_design/additional_features>` para "
"mejorar la experiencia de compra del cliente."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/ecommerce_design.rst:16
#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/ecommerce_design/additional_features.rst:27
#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/ecommerce_design/additional_features.rst:63
#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/ecommerce_design/product_page.rst:3
msgid "Product page"
msgstr "Página del producto"

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/ecommerce_design.rst:16
msgid ""
"Design the product pages by showcasing product details and additional "
"information, customizing product images and videos, and adding content and "
"design elements using building blocks."
msgstr ""
"Diseña las página de producto para mostrar los detalles de producto e "
"información adicional. Personaliza imágenes y videos de los productos y "
"agrega contenido y elementos de diseño con bloques de creación."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/ecommerce_design.rst:23
#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/ecommerce_design/catalog.rst:3
msgid "Product catalog"
msgstr "Catálogo de productos"

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/ecommerce_design.rst:23
msgid ""
"Organize the product catalog by customizing the layout, using categories, "
"and adding building blocks, and filtering options."
msgstr ""
"Organiza el catálogo del producto, personaliza su diseño, agrega categorías, "
"bloques de creación y opciones de filtrado."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/ecommerce_design.rst:30
msgid ""
"Enable additional features, such as the wishlist and product comparison, and "
"highlight products using ribbons."
msgstr ""
"Activa las funciones adicionales, como la lista de deseos y la comparación "
"de productos y resalta productos con cintas."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/ecommerce_design/additional_features.rst:5
msgid ""
"Odoo eCommerce provides additional features for online shops, including "
"a :ref:`product comparison <ecommerce/products/additional_features/product-"
"comparison>` tool, a :ref:`wishlist <ecommerce/products/additional_features/"
"wishlists>`, and :ref:`product highlight options <ecommerce/products/"
"additional_features/product-highlight>`."
msgstr ""
"La aplicación Comercio electrónico de Odoo ofrece funciones adicionales para "
"tiendas en línea, como la herramienta de :ref:`comparación de productos "
"<ecommerce/products/additional_features/product-comparison>`, "
"las :ref:`listas de deseos <ecommerce/products/additional_features/"
"wishlists>` y las :ref:`opciones para destacar productos <ecommerce/products/"
"additional_features/product-highlight>`."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/ecommerce_design/additional_features.rst:13
msgid "Product comparison"
msgstr "Comparación de productos"

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/ecommerce_design/additional_features.rst:15
msgid ""
"The :icon:`fa-exchange` (:guilabel:`Add to compare`) button allows website "
"visitors to compare products based on their :ref:`attributes <ecommerce/"
"categories_variants/attributes>`. Customers can click this button to select "
"the products they wish to compare, then click :guilabel:`Compare` in the pop-"
"up window at the bottom of the page to see the comparison summary."
msgstr ""
"El botón :icon:`fa-exchange` (:guilabel:`Agregar para comparar`) permite que "
"los visitantes del sitio web comparen productos según sus :ref:`atributos "
"<ecommerce/categories_variants/attributes>`. Los clientes pueden hacer clic "
"en este botón para seleccionar los productos que quieren comparar y luego "
"hacer clic en :guilabel:`Comparar` en la ventana emergente en la parte "
"inferior de la página para ver el resumen de la comparación."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/ecommerce_design/additional_features.rst:None
msgid "Product comparison window"
msgstr "Ventana de comparación de productos"

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/ecommerce_design/additional_features.rst:23
#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/ecommerce_design/additional_features.rst:59
msgid ""
"This button can be enabled independently in different sections of the "
"website:"
msgstr ""
"Este botón se puede activar de forma independiente en distintas secciones "
"del sitio web:"

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/ecommerce_design/additional_features.rst:29
msgid ""
"Go to a product page, open the website editor, go to the :guilabel:`Style` "
"tab, navigate to the :guilabel:`Products Details` section, and toggle "
"the :icon:`fa-exchange` :guilabel:`Compare` button. Once done, it becomes "
"available on each product page that has attributes."
msgstr ""
"Ve a una página de producto, abre el editor del sitio web, ve a la "
"pestaña :guilabel:`Estilo`, dirígete a la sección :guilabel:`Detalles del "
"producto` y presiona el botón :icon:`fa-exchange` :guilabel:`Comparar`. Al "
"hacerlo, estará disponible en cada página de producto que tenga atributos."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/ecommerce_design/additional_features.rst:34
#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/ecommerce_design/additional_features.rst:69
msgid "Catalog page"
msgstr "Página del catálogo"

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/ecommerce_design/additional_features.rst:36
msgid ""
"To display the :icon:`fa-exchange` (:guilabel:`Compare`) button on "
"the :ref:`shop page <ecommerce/catalog/product-listing>`, open the website "
"editor, go to the :guilabel:`Style` tab, and click the :icon:`fa-paint-"
"brush` (:guilabel:`paint brush`) icon next to :guilabel:`Product Design`. In "
"the :guilabel:`Actions` section, toggle the :icon:`fa-exchange` "
"(:guilabel:`Compare`) button, and choose between :guilabel:`Inline` "
"and :guilabel:`On Hover`."
msgstr ""
"Para mostrar el botón :icon:`fa-exchange` (:guilabel:`Comparar`) en "
"la :ref:`página de la tienda <ecommerce/catalog/product-listing>`, abre el "
"editor del sitio web, ve a la pestaña :guilabel:`Estilo` y haz clic en el "
"icono :icon:`fa-paint-brush` (:guilabel:`pincel`) junto a :guilabel:`Diseño "
"del producto`. En la sección :guilabel:`Acciones`, presiona el "
"botón :icon:`fa-exchange` (:guilabel:`Comparar`) y elige entre :guilabel:`En "
"línea` y :guilabel:`Al pasar el cursor por encima`."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/ecommerce_design/additional_features.rst:44
msgid "You can only compare a maximum of four products at a time."
msgstr "Solo es posible comparar máximo de cuatro productos a la vez."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/ecommerce_design/additional_features.rst:47
msgid ""
"Define :ref:`attribute categories <ecommerce/categories_variants/attribute-"
"categories>` to group similar attributes under the same section when "
"comparing products."
msgstr ""
"Define :ref:`categorías de atributos <ecommerce/categories_variants/"
"attribute-categories>` para agrupar atributos similares en la misma sección "
"al comparar los productos."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/ecommerce_design/additional_features.rst:53
msgid "Wishlist"
msgstr "Lista de deseos"

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/ecommerce_design/additional_features.rst:55
msgid ""
"The :icon:`fa-heart-o` (:guilabel:`Add to wishlist`) button allows customers "
"to add products to their wishlist, i.e., save them for later. It is enabled "
"by default and available on each product page."
msgstr ""
"El botón :icon:`fa-heart-o` (:guilabel:`Agregar a la lista de deseos`) "
"permite que los clientes agreguen productos a su lista de deseos, es decir, "
"que los guarden para después. Está activado de forma predeterminada y "
"también está disponible en cada página de producto."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/ecommerce_design/additional_features.rst:65
msgid ""
"Go to a product page, open the website editor, go to the :guilabel:`Style` "
"tab, navigate to the :guilabel:`Products Details` section, and toggle "
"the :icon:`fa-heart` :guilabel:`Wishlist` button. Once done, it becomes "
"available on each product page."
msgstr ""
"Ve a una página de producto, abre el editor del sitio web, ve a la "
"pestaña :guilabel:`Estilo`, dirígete a la sección :guilabel:`Detalles del "
"producto` y presiona el botón :icon:`fa-heart` :guilabel:`Lista de deseos`. "
"Al hacerlo, estará disponible en cada página de producto."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/ecommerce_design/additional_features.rst:71
msgid ""
"To display the :icon:`fa-heart-o` (:guilabel:`Wishlist`) button on "
"the :ref:`shop page <ecommerce/catalog/product-listing>`, open the website "
"editor, go to :guilabel:`Style`, and click the :icon:`fa-paint-brush` "
"(:guilabel:`paint brush`) icon next to :guilabel:`Product Design`. In "
"the :guilabel:`Actions` section, toggle the :icon:`fa-heart` "
"(:guilabel:`Wishlist`) button and choose between :guilabel:`Fixed` "
"and :guilabel:`Fixed - On Hover`."
msgstr ""
"Para mostrar el botón :icon:`fa-heart-o` (:guilabel:`Lista de deseos`) en "
"la :ref:`página de la tienda <ecommerce/catalog/product-listing>`, abre el "
"editor del sitio web, ve a :guilabel:`Estilo` y haz clic en el "
"icono :icon:`fa-paint-brush` (:guilabel:`pincel`) junto a :guilabel:`Diseño "
"del producto`. En la sección :guilabel:`Acciones`, presiona el "
"botón :icon:`fa-heart` (:guilabel:`Lista de deseos`) y elige "
"entre :guilabel:`Fijo` y :guilabel:`Fijo - Al pasar el cursor por encima`."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/ecommerce_design/additional_features.rst:78
msgid "Header"
msgstr "Encabezado"

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/ecommerce_design/additional_features.rst:80
msgid ""
"To display the :icon:`fa-heart` (:guilabel:`Wishlist`) icon in the header, "
"open the website editor, click the header, navigate to the :guilabel:`Show/"
"Hide Elements` section, and toggle the :icon:`fa-heart` "
"(:guilabel:`Wishlist`) icon next to :guilabel:`Show Empty`. If it is not "
"enabled, the wishlist icon only appears when an item has been added to the "
"wishlist. The number of items in the wishlist is also displayed next to the "
"icon."
msgstr ""
"Para mostrar el icono :icon:`fa-heart` (:guilabel:`Lista de deseos`) en el "
"encabezado, abre el editor del sitio web, haz clic en el encabezado, "
"dirígete a la sección :guilabel:`Mostrar u ocultar elementos` y presiona el "
"icono :icon:`fa-heart` (:guilabel:`Lista de deseos`) junto "
"a :guilabel:`Mostrar vacío`. Si no lo activas, el icono de la lista de "
"deseos solo aparecerá al agregae un artículo a la lista. El número de "
"artículos en la lista también aparece junto al icono."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/ecommerce_design/additional_features.rst:87
msgid "Wishlist page"
msgstr "Página de la lista de deseos"

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/ecommerce_design/additional_features.rst:89
msgid ""
"It is possible to customize the layout of the :guilabel:`My Wishlist` page. "
"To do so, open the website editor while on the wishlist page, and in "
"the :guilabel:`Style` tab under the :guilabel:`Wishlist Page` section, "
"choose a :guilabel:`Products Design`. Depending on the selected design, "
"adapt the layout according to :guilabel:`Desktop` or :guilabel:`Mobile` "
"devices. Click the :icon:`fa-paint-brush` (:guilabel:`paint brush`) icon "
"next to :guilabel:`Products Design` to access more customization options."
msgstr ""
"Puedes personalizar el diseño de la página :guilabel:`Mi lista de deseos`. "
"Para hacerlo, abre el editor del sitio web desde la página de la lista de "
"deseos y, en la pestaña :guilabel:`Estilo`, dentro de la "
"sección :guilabel:`Página de la lista de deseos`, elige un :guilabel:`diseño "
"de productos`. Según el diseño seleccionado, ajusta la vista para "
"dispositivos de :guilabel:`escritorio` o :guilabel:`portátiles`. Haz clic en "
"el icono :icon:`fa-paint-brush` (:guilabel:`pincel`) junto "
"a :guilabel:`Diseño de productos` para acceder a más opciones de "
"personalización."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/ecommerce_design/additional_features.rst:97
msgid ""
"Customers can move products from their cart to their wishlist by clicking "
"the :guilabel:`Save for Later` button in the :guilabel:`Order "
"summary` :ref:`checkout step <ecommerce/checkout/review_order>`."
msgstr ""
"Los clientes pueden mover productos de su carrito a su lista de deseos al "
"hacer clic en el botón :guilabel:`Guardar para después` en el paso "
":guilabel:`Resumen de la orden` del :ref:`proceso de pago <ecommerce/"
"checkout/review_order>`."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/ecommerce_design/additional_features.rst:100
msgid ""
"On the :guilabel:`My Wishlist` page, customers can move products from their "
"wishlist to the cart."
msgstr ""
"Los clientes pueden mover productos de su lista de deseos al carrito en la "
"página :guilabel:`Mi lista de deseos`."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/ecommerce_design/additional_features.rst:106
msgid "Product highlight"
msgstr "Producto destacado"

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/ecommerce_design/additional_features.rst:108
msgid ""
"The eCommerce app allows you to highlight products to increase their "
"visibility. To do so, go to :menuselection:`Website --> eCommerce --> "
"Ribbons`. You can either use one of the preconfigured ribbons "
"(:guilabel:`Sold out`, :guilabel:`Sale`, :guilabel:`Out of stock` "
"or :guilabel:`New!`) or create a :guilabel:`New` one. Add a ribbon name, and "
"select the method to :guilabel:`Assign` it:"
msgstr ""
"La aplicación Comercio electrónico te permite resaltar productos para "
"aumentar su visibilidad. Para hacerlo, ve a :menuselection:`Sitio web --> "
"Comercio electrónico --> Cintas de opciones del producto`. Usa una de las "
"cintas preconfiguradas (:guilabel:`Agotado`, :guilabel:`Oferta`, "
":guilabel:`Sin disponibilidad` o :guilabel:`Nuevo`) o crea una "
":guilabel:`nueva`. Agrega un nombre para la cinta y selecciona el método "
"para :guilabel:`asignarla`:"

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/ecommerce_design/additional_features.rst:113
msgid ":guilabel:`Manually`: assign the ribbon manually."
msgstr ":guilabel:`Manual`: asigna la cinta de forma manual."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/ecommerce_design/additional_features.rst:114
msgid ""
":guilabel:`On Sale`: the ribbon is displayed when the product is on sale, "
"e.g., when using a :ref:`comparison price <ecommerce/prices/permanent-"
"discounts>`."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`En oferta`: muestra la cinta cuando el producto está en oferta, "
"por ejemplo, al usar un :ref:`precio de comparación <ecommerce/prices/"
"permanent-discounts>`."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/ecommerce_design/additional_features.rst:116
msgid ""
":guilabel:`When New`: the ribbon is displayed when a new product is added. "
"Specify the number of :guilabel:`days after publication` it should be "
"displayed."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Cuando es nuevo`: muestra la cinta al agregar un producto nuevo. "
"Define el número de :guilabel:`días después de la publicación` durante los "
"cuales aparece."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/ecommerce_design/additional_features.rst:118
msgid ""
":guilabel:`when out of stock`: the ribbon is displayed when the product is "
"currently no longer available."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Cuando esté agotado`: muestra la cinta cuando el producto ya no "
"está disponible."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/ecommerce_design/additional_features.rst:121
msgid ""
"Choose its :guilabel:`Position`, either :guilabel:`Left` "
"or :guilabel:`Right`, and a :guilabel:`Style`, either :guilabel:`Ribbon` "
"or :guilabel:`Badge`. Define the :guilabel:`Text Color` and "
"the :guilabel:`Background Color`. Then :guilabel:`Save`. The ribbon is now "
"available for all the e-commerce products."
msgstr ""
"Elige su :guilabel:`posición`, ya sea :guilabel:`izquierda` "
"o :guilabel:`derecha`, y un :guilabel:`estilo`, ya sea :guilabel:`cinta` "
"o :guilabel:`insignia`. Define el :guilabel:`color del texto` y "
"el :guilabel:`color de fondo`. Luego, haz clic en :guilabel:`Guardar`. La "
"cinta estará disponible para todos los productos de comercio electrónico."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/ecommerce_design/additional_features.rst:None
msgid "Product with badge"
msgstr "Producto con distintivo"

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/ecommerce_design/additional_features.rst:130
msgid "There are other ways to create a new product ribbon:"
msgstr "Existen otras formas de crear una nueva cinta de producto:"

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/ecommerce_design/additional_features.rst:132
msgid ""
"Access the product form, and under the :guilabel:`eCommerce` tab, change or "
"create the ribbon in the :guilabel:`Ribbon` field."
msgstr ""
"Accede al formulario del producto y, en la pestaña :guilabel:`Comercio "
"electrónico`, cambia o crea la cinta en el campo :guilabel:`Cinta`."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/ecommerce_design/additional_features.rst:134
msgid ""
"Edit/create ribbons from the :doc:`website editor <../../website/"
"web_design>`. To do so, go to the :guilabel:`Style` tab, and navigate to "
"the :guilabel:`Product Details` section. Click the green :icon:`fa-plus` "
"(:guilabel:`Create`) icon next to the :guilabel:`Ribbon` field or "
"the :icon:`fa-pencil-square-o` (:guilabel:`Edit`) icon next to "
"the :guilabel:`Ribbon` label. The :guilabel:`Assign` feature is not "
"available for configuration in the website editor."
msgstr ""
"Edita o crea cintas desde el :doc:`editor del sitio web <../../website/"
"web_design>`. Ve a la pestaña :guilabel:`Estilo` y dirígete a la "
"sección :guilabel:`Detalles del producto`. Haz clic en el icono "
"verde :icon:`fa-plus` (:guilabel:`Crear`) ubicado junto al "
"campo :guilabel:`Cinta` o en el icono :icon:`fa-pencil-square-o` "
"(:guilabel:`Editar`) ubicado junto a la etiqueta :guilabel:`Cinta`. La "
"función :guilabel:`Asignar` no está disponible para configurarla en el "
"editor del sitio web."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/ecommerce_design/additional_features.rst:0
msgid "Create a new ribbon in the website editor"
msgstr "Crear una nueva cinta en el editor del sitio web"

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/ecommerce_design/additional_features.rst:144
msgid ""
"It is also possible to add ribbons for specific :ref:`product variants "
"<ecommerce/categories_variants/product-variants>`. To do so, go "
"to :menuselection:`Website --> eCommerce --> Products` and select a product. "
"Click the :icon:`fa-sitemap` :guilabel:`Variants` smart button, choose a "
"variant, and add a ribbon in the :guilabel:`Ribbon` field of "
"the :guilabel:`Sales` section."
msgstr ""
"También puedes agregar cintas a :ref:`variantes de producto <ecommerce/"
"categories_variants/product-variants>` específicas. Para hacerlo, ve a "
":menuselection:`Sitio web --> Comercio electrónico --> Productos` y "
"selecciona un producto. Haz clic en el botón inteligente :icon:`fa-sitemap` "
":guilabel:`Variantes`, elige una variante y agrega una cinta en el campo "
":guilabel:`Cinta` de la sección :guilabel:`Ventas`."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/ecommerce_design/catalog.rst:5
msgid ""
"The e-commerce catalog displays products for customers to browse. It is "
"organized using :ref:`product categories <ecommerce/categories_variants/"
"categories>`, available :ref:`product variants <ecommerce/"
"categories_variants/product-variants>`, sorting options, and navigation "
"paths. Essentially, the e-commerce catalog is the shop page of your website."
msgstr ""
"El catálogo de comercio electrónico muestra los productos para que los "
"clientes puedan consultarlos. Está organizado por :ref:`categorías de "
"producto <ecommerce/categories_variants/categories>`, :ref:`variantes de "
"producto <ecommerce/categories_variants/product-variants>` disponibles, "
"opciones de ordenamiento y rutas de navegación. En esencia, el catálogo de "
"comercio electrónico es la página de la tienda de tu sitio web."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/ecommerce_design/catalog.rst:10
msgid ""
"The product catalog features a :ref:`toolbar and some filters <ecommerce/"
"catalog/toolbar-and-filters>` in the sidebar (or slide-out menu), along with "
"a dedicated :ref:`product listing area <ecommerce/catalog/product-listing>`. "
"Additionally, the shop and category pages' :ref:`layout <ecommerce/catalog/"
"customize-layout>`, as well as the :ref:`e-commerce footer <ecommerce/"
"catalog/footer>`, can be customized, and you can add :ref:`building blocks "
"<ecommerce/catalog/catalog-blocks>` as needed."
msgstr ""
"El catálogo de productos incluye una :ref:`barra de herramientas y varios "
"filtros <ecommerce/catalog/toolbar-and-filters>` en la barra lateral (o en "
"el menú desplegable), junto con un :ref:`área dedicada a la lista de "
"productos <ecommerce/catalog/product-listing>`. Además, puedes personalizar "
"el :ref:`diseño <ecommerce/catalog/customize-layout>` de las páginas de "
"tienda y de categoría, así como el :ref:`pie de página del comercio "
"electrónico <ecommerce/catalog/footer>`, y agregar :ref:`bloques de creación "
"<ecommerce/catalog/catalog-blocks>` en caso de que sean necesarios."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/ecommerce_design/catalog.rst:17
msgid ""
"To customize the catalog, go to the shop page, click :guilabel:`Edit` in the "
"upper-right corner, select the section you want to change, and navigate to "
"the :guilabel:`Style` tab."
msgstr ""
"Para personalizar el catálogo, ve a la página de la tienda, haz clic "
"en :guilabel:`Editar` en la esquina superior derecha, selecciona la sección "
"que quieres cambiar y ve a la pestaña :guilabel:`Estilo`."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/ecommerce_design/catalog.rst:23
msgid "Toolbar and filters"
msgstr "Barra de herramientas y filtros"

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/ecommerce_design/catalog.rst:25
msgid ""
"The toolbar and sidebar (or slide-out menu) provide advanced filtering tools "
"to help customers search and navigate the product catalog "
"using :ref:`categories <ecommerce/catalog/categories>` and :ref:`attributes "
"<ecommerce/catalog/attributes>`."
msgstr ""
"La barra de herramientas y la barra lateral (o el menú desplegable) ofrecen "
"herramientas avanzadas de filtrado que ayudan a los clientes a buscar y "
"navegar por el catálogo de productos mediante :ref:`categorías <ecommerce/"
"catalog/categories>` y :ref:`atributos <ecommerce/catalog/attributes>`."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/ecommerce_design/catalog.rst:30
msgid ""
"If you do not want to display a toolbar or sidebar, disable all related "
"options in the website editor, :ref:`hide attributes <ecommerce/"
"categories_variants/attributes>`, and make sure to only assign one pricelist "
"to the website."
msgstr ""
"Si no deseas mostrar la barra de herramientas ni la barra lateral, desactiva "
"todas las opciones relacionadas en el editor del sitio web, :ref:`oculta los "
"atributos <ecommerce/categories_variants/attributes>` y asegúrate de solo "
"asignar una lista de precios al sitio web."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/ecommerce_design/catalog.rst:37
msgid "Categories"
msgstr "Categorías"

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/ecommerce_design/catalog.rst:39
msgid ""
"To create a :ref:`category <ecommerce/categories_variants/categories>` quick "
"access in the toolbar or general access in the sidebar, click "
"the :guilabel:`Top` and/or :guilabel:`Sidebar` button next "
"to :guilabel:`Categories`, and choose a :guilabel:`Style` for them. When "
"the :guilabel:`Sidebar` is selected, the option :guilabel:`Collapse Category "
"Recursive` appears, allowing you to collapse the category in the sidebar."
msgstr ""
"Para crear un acceso rápido a una :ref:`categoría <ecommerce/"
"categories_variants/categories>` en la barra de herramientas o un acceso "
"general en la barra lateral, haz clic en los botones :guilabel:`Superior` "
"o :guilabel:`Barra lateral` ubicados junto a :guilabel:`Categorías` y elige "
"un :guilabel:`estilo`. Al seleccionar :guilabel:`Barra lateral` aparece la "
"opción :guilabel:`Contraer categoría de forma recursiva`, que te permite "
"ocultar la categoría en la barra lateral."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/ecommerce_design/catalog.rst:49
msgid ""
"The category filters located in the sidebar are not affected by "
"the :guilabel:`Filters` setting."
msgstr ""
"Los filtros de categoría que aparecen en la barra lateral no dependen del "
"ajuste :guilabel:`Filtros`."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/ecommerce_design/catalog.rst:54
msgid "Toolbar"
msgstr "Barra de herramientas"

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/ecommerce_design/catalog.rst:56
msgid ""
"It is possible to display a search bar, sort-by options or a date selector "
"for :doc:`rental products <../../../sales/rental>` in the toolbar of the "
"shop page by clicking the :guilabel:`Sort By`, :guilabel:`Search` and/"
"or :guilabel:`Rental` buttons next to the :guilabel:`Toolbar` label. Toggle "
"the :guilabel:`Floating` switch on to always display the search bar, "
"the :ref:`pricelist selector <ecommerce/prices/pricelists>` (if any), and "
"sort-by options at the bottom of the window, even when scrolling, and select "
"a :guilabel:`Default Sort` option."
msgstr ""
"Es posible mostrar una barra de búsqueda, opciones para ordenar o un "
"selector de fechas para :doc:`productos de alquiler <../../../sales/rental>` "
"en la barra de herramientas de la página de la tienda al hacer clic en los "
"botones :guilabel:`Ordenar por`, :guilabel:`Buscar` y/o :guilabel:`Alquiler` "
"junto a la etiqueta :guilabel:`Barra de herramientas`. Activa el interruptor "
":guilabel:`Flotante` para mostrar siempre la barra de búsqueda, el "
":ref:`selector de listas de precios <ecommerce/prices/pricelists>` (si lo "
"hay) y las opciones para ordenar en la parte inferior de la ventana, incluso "
"al desplazarse, y selecciona una opción de :guilabel:`Orden predeterminado`."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/ecommerce_design/catalog.rst:64
msgid ""
"The default sort applies to *all* :ref:`categories <ecommerce/"
"categories_variants/categories>`."
msgstr ""
"El orden predeterminado aplica a *todas* las :ref:`categorías <ecommerce/"
"categories_variants/categories>`."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/ecommerce_design/catalog.rst:69
msgid "Filters"
msgstr "Filtros"

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/ecommerce_design/catalog.rst:71
msgid "Set the :guilabel:`Filters` field to:"
msgstr ""
"Configura el campo :guilabel:`Filtros` con alguna de las siguientes opciones:"

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/ecommerce_design/catalog.rst:73
msgid ":guilabel:`Sidebar`: to display filters in the side panel;"
msgstr ":guilabel:`Barra lateral`: muestra los filtros en el panel lateral."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/ecommerce_design/catalog.rst:74
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Off-screen menu`: to display filters in a slide-out menu that "
"opens when clicking the :icon:`fa-sliders` :guilabel:`Filters` button in the "
"toolbar;"
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Menú fuera de la pantalla`: muestra los filtros en un menú "
"desplegable que se abre al hacer clic en el botón :icon:`fa-"
"sliders` :guilabel:`Filtros` de la barra de herramientas."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/ecommerce_design/catalog.rst:76
msgid ":guilabel:`Hide`: to hide filters entirely."
msgstr ":guilabel:`Ocultar`: oculta todos los filtros."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/ecommerce_design/catalog.rst:78
msgid "By default, two :guilabel:`Filters` are enabled:"
msgstr "Hay dos :guilabel:`Filtros` habilitados de forma predeterminada:"

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/ecommerce_design/catalog.rst:80
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Price`: Use the switch to display a :guilabel:`Price Range` bar, "
"which allows customers to filter products according to a specific price "
"range by dragging adjustable handles."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Precio`: Usa el botón para mostrar una barra de :guilabel:`rango "
"de precios` que permite que los clientes filtren los productos según un "
"rango específico al mover los controles ajustables."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/ecommerce_design/catalog.rst:83
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Tags`: Toggle the switch to display product :guilabel:`Tags` on "
"the shop page, and allow customers to filter products using those tags by "
"going to the :guilabel:`Tags` section."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Etiquetas`: Presiona el botón para mostrar "
"las :guilabel:`etiquetas` de los productos en la página de la tienda y "
"permitir que los clientes las usen para filtrar los productos desde la "
"sección :guilabel:`Etiquetas`."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/ecommerce_design/catalog.rst:87
msgid ""
"To create product tags on your e-commerce, go to :menuselection:`Website --> "
"eCommerce --> Products`, and select the product you want to create a tag "
"for. On the product form, navigate to the :guilabel:`eCommerce` tab, then, "
"in the :guilabel:`Tags` field, select a tag or :guilabel:`Create and edit` "
"one. On the :guilabel:`Create Tags` pop-up, add a :guilabel:`Tag` name, "
"toggle the :guilabel:`Visible to customers` switch on/off, and select "
"a :guilabel:`Color`. Optionally, add an image. Then go to the product form, "
"and assign the relevant tags where needed."
msgstr ""
"Para crear etiquetas de producto en tu comercio electrónico, ve a "
":menuselection:`Sitio web --> Comercio electrónico --> Productos` y "
"selecciona el producto para el que deseas crear una etiqueta. En el "
"formulario del producto, ve a la pestaña :guilabel:`Comercio electrónico`, "
"luego, en el campo :guilabel:`Etiquetas`, selecciona una etiqueta o haz clic "
"en :guilabel:`Crear y editar`. En la ventana emergente :guilabel:`Crear "
"etiquetas`, agrega un nombre para la :guilabel:`Etiqueta`, activa o "
"desactiva el interruptor :guilabel:`Visible para los clientes` y selecciona "
"un :guilabel:`Color`. De forma opcional, agrega una imagen. Luego ve al "
"formulario del producto y asigna las etiquetas correspondientes donde sea "
"necesario."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/ecommerce_design/catalog.rst:100
msgid ""
"When you offer :ref:`product variants <ecommerce/categories_variants/product-"
"variants>` with different :ref:`attributes <ecommerce/categories_variants/"
"attributes>`, those options appear in the sidebar or slide-out menu when "
"filters are shown. The menu automatically adapts to the number of attribute "
"sections:"
msgstr ""
"Cuando ofreces :ref:`variantes de producto <ecommerce/categories_variants/"
"product-variants>` con distintos :ref:`atributos <ecommerce/"
"categories_variants/attributes>`, esas opciones aparecen en la barra lateral "
"o en el menú desplegable cuando los filtros son visibles. El menú se adapta "
"de forma automática según la cantidad de secciones de atributos:"

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/ecommerce_design/catalog.rst:105
msgid "**Up to 4 attributes**: all the attribute values are displayed."
msgstr "**Hasta 4 atributos**: muestra todos los valores de atributo."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/ecommerce_design/catalog.rst:106
msgid "**More than 4 attributes**: the sections are automatically collapsed."
msgstr "**Más de 4 atributos**: contrae las secciones de forma automática."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/ecommerce_design/catalog.rst:109
msgid ""
"For :guilabel:`Radio` and :guilabel:`Select` :ref:`display types <products/"
"variants/attributes>`, a :guilabel:`View More` button appears when there are "
"more than **8** values, and a search field when the number of values exceeds "
"**20**."
msgstr ""
"Para los :ref:`tipos de visualización <products/variants/"
"attributes>` :guilabel:`Opción` y :guilabel:`Seleccionar`, aparece el "
"botón :guilabel:`Ver más` cuando hay más de **8** valores, el campo de "
"búsqueda aparece cuando el número de valores es superior a **20**."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/ecommerce_design/catalog.rst:112
msgid ""
"At least two attribute values are required for the filter to be visible."
msgstr ""
"Deben de existir al menos dos valores de atributo para que el filtro sea "
"visible."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/ecommerce_design/catalog.rst:113
msgid ""
"The attribute filters located in the sidebar or slide-out menu are affected "
"by the :guilabel:`Filters` setting."
msgstr ""
"Los filtros de atributos que aparecen en la barra lateral o en el menú "
"desplegable dependen del ajuste :guilabel:`Filtros`."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/ecommerce_design/catalog.rst:117
msgid ":doc:`../../../sales/sales/products_prices/products/variants`"
msgstr ":doc:`../../../sales/sales/products_prices/products/variants`"

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/ecommerce_design/catalog.rst:118
msgid ":doc:`../../ecommerce/configuration/categories_variants`"
msgstr ":doc:`../../ecommerce/configuration/categories_variants`"

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/ecommerce_design/catalog.rst:123
msgid "Product listing area"
msgstr "Área de productos"

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/ecommerce_design/catalog.rst:127
msgid ""
"Define the number of products to display on your shop pages by configuring "
"the :guilabel:`Size` displayed per page and line, and specify the number of "
"columns for :guilabel:`Mobile` devices."
msgstr ""
"Define el número de productos que aparecen en las páginas de la tienda al "
"configurar el :guilabel:`tamaño` que se muestra por página y por fila, y "
"especifica la cantidad de columnas para dispositivos :guilabel:`móviles`."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/ecommerce_design/catalog.rst:131
msgid ""
"The number of products displayed on a page may affect performance and page "
"loading speed."
msgstr ""
"El número de productos que aparecen en una página puede afectar el "
"rendimiento y la velocidad de carga."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/ecommerce_design/catalog.rst:133
msgid ""
"In addition, you can manually change a product’s position on the shop page "
"or product category page. To do so, click a specific product, change "
"its :guilabel:`Size`, and :guilabel:`Re-order` it using the arrows in "
"the :guilabel:`Product` section of the :guilabel:`Style` tab. The :icon:`fa-"
"angle-double-left` (:guilabel:`double left arrow`) and :icon:`fa-angle-"
"double-right` (:guilabel:`double right arrow`) buttons allow you to move the "
"product to the extreme left or right, and the :icon:`fa-angle-left` "
"(:guilabel:`single left arrow`) and :icon:`fa-angle-right` "
"(:guilabel:`single right arrow`) buttons allow you to move it one row to the "
"left or right. You can also choose or create a :ref:`ribbon or badge "
"<ecommerce/products/additional_features/product-highlight>` to highlight a "
"specific product."
msgstr ""
"Además, puedes cambiar la posición de un producto en la página de la tienda "
"o en la página de una categoría de forma manual. Para hacerlo, haz clic en "
"un producto específico, cambia su :guilabel:`tamaño` y :guilabel:`ajusta su "
"orden` con las flechas en la sección :guilabel:`Producto` de la "
"pestaña :guilabel:`Estilo`. Los botones :icon:`fa-angle-double-left` "
"(:guilabel:`flecha doble hacia la izquierda`) y :icon:`fa-angle-double-"
"right` (:guilabel:`flecha doble hacia la derecha`) mueven el producto al "
"extremo izquierdo o derecho, y los botones :icon:`fa-angle-left` "
"(:guilabel:`flecha simple hacia la izquierda`) y :icon:`fa-angle-right` "
"(:guilabel:`flecha simple haciaa la derecha`) lo mueven una fila a la "
"izquierda o a la derecha. También puedes elegir o crear una :ref:`cinta o "
"insignia <ecommerce/products/additional_features/product-highlight>` para "
"resaltar un producto específico."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/ecommerce_design/catalog.rst:144
msgid ""
"It is also possible to change the products' positions on the shop page by "
"going to :menuselection:`Website --> eCommerce --> Products`, switching to "
"the list view, and dragging and dropping the products within the list."
msgstr ""
"También puedes cambiar la posición de los productos en la página de la "
"tienda desde :menuselection:`Sitio web --> Comercio electrónico --> "
"Productos`, luego deberás seleccionar la vista de lista y arrastrar y soltar "
"los productos dentro de la lista."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/ecommerce_design/catalog.rst:151
msgid "Product card design"
msgstr "Diseño de las tarjetas de producto"

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/ecommerce_design/catalog.rst:153
msgid ""
"To customize the product cards' design, choose a :guilabel:`Products "
"Design`, click the :icon:`fa-paint-brush` :guilabel:`(paint brush)` icon "
"next to it to:"
msgstr ""
"Para personalizar el diseño de las tarjetas de producto, elige una opción "
"en :guilabel:`Diseño de los productos` y haz clic en el icono :icon:`fa-"
"paint-brush` :guilabel:`(pincel)` que aparece junto a él para:"

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/ecommerce_design/catalog.rst:156
msgid "Choose a :guilabel:`Preset` layout;"
msgstr "Elegir un diseño :guilabel:`predefinido`."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/ecommerce_design/catalog.rst:157
msgid "Adapt the :guilabel:`General` design;"
msgstr "Ajustar el diseño :guilabel:`general`."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/ecommerce_design/catalog.rst:158
msgid ""
"Customize the :guilabel:`Text & content` (e.g., show "
"a :guilabel:`Description`, and :guilabel:`Ratings`);"
msgstr ""
"Personalizar el :guilabel:`texto y contenido` (por ejemplo, mostrar "
"una :guilabel:`descripción` y las :guilabel:`calificaciones`)."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/ecommerce_design/catalog.rst:160
msgid ""
"Customize the :guilabel:`Images`' layout (e.g., enable :guilabel:`Secondary "
"Image` to show a second image when hovering over the product image on the "
"shop or category page);"
msgstr ""
"Personalizar el diseño de las :guilabel:`imágenes` (por ejemplo, activar "
"una :guilabel:`imagen secundaria` para mostrar una segunda imagen al pasar "
"el cursor sobre la imagen del producto en la página de tienda o de "
"categoría)."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/ecommerce_design/catalog.rst:162
msgid ""
"Enable some :guilabel:`Actions` (e.g., :icon:`fa-shopping-cart` :ref:`Add to "
"Cart <ecommerce/checkout/add-to-cart>`, :icon:`fa-exchange` :ref:`Compare "
"<ecommerce/products/additional_features/product-comparison>`, or :icon:`fa-"
"heart` :ref:`Wishlist <ecommerce/products/additional_features/wishlists>`) "
"and customize their placement."
msgstr ""
"Activar algunas :guilabel:`acciones` (por ejemplo, :icon:`fa-shopping-cart` "
":ref:`Agregar al carrito <ecommerce/checkout/add-to-cart>`, :icon:`fa-"
"exchange` :ref:`Comparar <ecommerce/products/additional_features/product-"
"comparison>` o :icon:`fa-heart` :ref:`Lista de deseos <ecommerce/products/"
"additional_features/wishlists>`) y personalizar su ubicación."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/ecommerce_design/catalog.rst:168
msgid ""
"You can also add a :ref:`variant picture <ecommerce/categories_variants/"
"attributes>` on the product card."
msgstr ""
"También puedes agregar una :ref:`imagen de la variante <ecommerce/"
"categories_variants/attributes>` en la tarjeta del producto."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/ecommerce_design/catalog.rst:174
msgid "Shop and category page design"
msgstr "Diseño de la tienda y las páginas de categoría"

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/ecommerce_design/catalog.rst:176
msgid ""
"The design of the shop and individual category pages can be customized as "
"follows:"
msgstr ""
"Puedes personalizar el diseño de la tienda y de cada página de categoría de "
"la siguiente forma:"

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/ecommerce_design/catalog.rst:178
msgid ""
"Choose whether the :guilabel:`Content Width` of the shop and category pages "
"should be :guilabel:`Regular` or :guilabel:`Full` width."
msgstr ""
"Elige si el :guilabel:`ancho del contenido` de las páginas de tienda y de "
"categoría debe ser :guilabel:`Regular` o :guilabel:`Completo`."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/ecommerce_design/catalog.rst:180
msgid ""
"Define the headers: navigate to the relevant page, then change the header "
"directly on the page if needed. Toggle the :guilabel:`Show Title` and/or "
"the :guilabel:`Center Content` switches. For product category pages, toggle "
"the :guilabel:`Show Description` switch to show the :ref:`category "
"description <ecommerce/categories_variants/categories>`."
msgstr ""
"Define los encabezados. Ve a la página correspondiente y cambia el "
"encabezado directamente en la página si es necesario. Presiona los "
"botones :guilabel:`Mostrar título` y :guilabel:`Centrar contenido`. En las "
"páginas de categoría de producto, presiona el botón :guilabel:`Mostrar "
"descripción` para mostrar la :ref:`descripción de la categoría <ecommerce/"
"categories_variants/categories>`."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/ecommerce_design/catalog.rst:184
msgid ""
"Use :doc:`building blocks <../../website/web_design/building_blocks>` to add "
"content in the top/bottom section of the page, either for the entire shop "
"page or for a specific category. In the latter case, the block appears "
"*only* when filtering by that category. To do so, move the block to the far "
"top or bottom section to display it on the general shop page or to the area "
"below the category's name at the top or beneath the product list to display "
"it only when filtering by that specific category."
msgstr ""
"Usa los :doc:`bloques de creación <../../website/web_design/"
"building_blocks>` para agregar contenido en la sección superior o inferior "
"de la página, ya sea para toda la página de la tienda o para una categoría "
"específica. En este último caso, el bloque *solo* aparece al filtrar por esa "
"categoría. Para hacerlo, mueve el bloque a la sección superior o inferior "
"extrema para mostrarlo en la página general de la tienda, o colócalo abajo "
"del nombre de la categoría en la parte superior o abajo de la lista de "
"productos para que aparezca solo al filtrar por esa categoría específica."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/ecommerce_design/catalog.rst:0
msgid "Place building block in the header or footer."
msgstr ""
"Captura de pantalla que muestra cómo colocar el bloque de creación en el "
"encabezado o en el pie de página."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/ecommerce_design/catalog.rst:195
msgid ""
"Adding content to an e-commerce category page helps improve the :doc:`SEO "
"<../../website/structure/seo>` strategy. Using keywords linked to the "
"products or the e-commerce categories can also increase organic traffic. "
"Additionally, each category has its own specific URL that can be pointed to "
"and is indexed by search engines."
msgstr ""
"Agregar contenido a la página de una categoría de Comercio electrónico ayuda "
"a mejorar la estrategia :doc:`SEO <../../website/structure/seo>`. Usar "
"palabras clave relacionadas con los productos o las categorías de Comercio "
"electrónico también aumenta el tráfico orgánico. Además, cada categoría "
"tiene su propia URL y los motores de búsqueda pueden indexarla."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/ecommerce_design/catalog.rst:199
msgid ""
"E-commerce categories can also be added as :ref:`mega menu items <website/"
"header_footer/mega-menus>` for quick access."
msgstr ""
"También puedes agregar categorías de comercio electrónico "
"como :ref:`elementos de mega menú <website/header_footer/mega-menus>` para "
"acceder a ellas con rapidez."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/ecommerce_design/catalog.rst:201
msgid ""
"It is also possible to customize individual :doc:`product pages "
"<product_page>`."
msgstr ""
"También es posible personalizar :doc:`páginas de producto <product_page>` "
"individuales."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/ecommerce_design/catalog.rst:206
msgid "Catalog blocks"
msgstr "Bloques de catálogo"

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/ecommerce_design/catalog.rst:208
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`Catalog` :doc:`building blocks </applications/websites/"
"website/web_design/building_blocks>` can be used, for example, to create "
"quick access to the shop page, showcase specific product categories, "
"highlight a specific product selection, or add a banner with general "
"information or promotions."
msgstr ""
"Puedes usar los :guilabel:`bloques de creación` de :guilabel:`catálogo </"
"applications/websites/website/web_design/building_blocks>`, por ejemplo, "
"para crear accesos rápidos a la página de la tienda, mostrar categorías de "
"producto específicas, resaltar una selección específica de productos o "
"agregar un elemento con información general o promociones."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/ecommerce_design/catalog.rst:213
msgid ""
"Depending on the selected template, you can :ref:`customize <website/"
"building_blocks/edit>` the blocks in the :guilabel:`Style` tab."
msgstr ""
"Según la plantilla que hayas seleccionado puedes :ref:`personalizar <website/"
"building_blocks/edit>` los bloques en la pestaña :guilabel:`Estilo`."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/ecommerce_design/catalog.rst:0
msgid "Example of a catalog block for specific products"
msgstr "Ejemplo de un bloque de catálogo para productos específicos"

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/ecommerce_design/catalog.rst:220
msgid ""
"For example, this specific :guilabel:`Catalog` block template displays a "
"selection of products and can be customized to:"
msgstr ""
"Por ejemplo, esta plantilla de bloque de :guilabel:`catálogo` muestra una "
"selección de productos y puedes personalizarla para:"

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/ecommerce_design/catalog.rst:223
msgid "Adapt the block's design."
msgstr "Adaptar el diseño del bloque."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/ecommerce_design/catalog.rst:224
msgid ""
"Select a :guilabel:`Cards Design`, and :ref:`configure <ecommerce/catalog/"
"products-design>` it using the :icon:`fa-paint-brush` :guilabel:`(paint "
"brush)` icon."
msgstr ""
"Seleccionar un :guilabel:`diseño de tarjetas` y :ref:`configurarlo "
"<ecommerce/catalog/products-design>` con el icono :icon:`fa-paint-"
"brush` :guilabel:`(pincel)`."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/ecommerce_design/catalog.rst:226
msgid ""
"Define which items are shown in the block by selecting the "
"relevant :guilabel:`Filter` option, e.g., :guilabel:`Newest Products` to "
"show the latest arrivals."
msgstr ""
"Definir qué artículos aparecen en el bloque al seleccionar la "
"opción :guilabel:`Filtro` correspondiente, por ejemplo, :guilabel:`Productos "
"más recientes` para mostrar las novedades."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/ecommerce_design/catalog.rst:228
msgid ""
"Select a specific product category in the :guilabel:`Category` dropdown list."
msgstr ""
"Seleccionar una categoría de producto específica en la lista "
"desplegable :guilabel:`Categoría`."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/ecommerce_design/catalog.rst:229
msgid ""
"Filter products by toggling the :guilabel:`Tags` and/or :guilabel:`Show "
"variants` options."
msgstr ""
"Filtrar productos al activar las opciones :guilabel:`Etiquetas` "
"y :guilabel:`Mostrar variantes`."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/ecommerce_design/catalog.rst:234
msgid "E-commerce-specific website footer"
msgstr "Pie de página del sitio web específico para comercio electrónico"

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/ecommerce_design/catalog.rst:236
msgid ""
"The :ref:`website footer <website/header_footer/design>` can also be "
"configured to use the e-commerce-specific template. Then, add the "
"relevant :ref:`links <website/elements/links>`, and adapt the footer's text "
"and layout as needed in the website editor. The :doc:`available payment "
"methods </applications/finance/payment_providers>` are also shown in this "
"footer. To adapt their display, go to the :guilabel:`Supported Payment "
"Methods` section in the website editor."
msgstr ""
"También puedes configurar el :ref:`pie de página del sitio web <website/"
"header_footer/design>` para usar la plantilla específica de comercio "
"electrónico. Agrega los :ref:`enlaces <website/elements/links>` "
"correspondientes y ajusta el texto y el diseño del pie de página según lo "
"necesites desde el editor del sitio web. En este pie de página también "
"aparecen los :doc:`métodos de pago disponibles </applications/finance/"
"payment_providers>`. Para ajustar su visualización, ve a la "
"sección :guilabel:`Métodos de pago aceptados` en el editor del sitio web."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/ecommerce_design/catalog.rst:243
msgid "It is not possible to create a customized footer per category."
msgstr "No es posible crear un pie de página personalizado por categoría."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/ecommerce_design/product_page.rst:5
msgid ""
"The e-commerce product pages showcase all product details and media items "
"related to the relevant products. It is possible to customize "
"the :ref:`images and videos section <ecommerce/product_page/image-"
"customization>`, choose :ref:`which product information to display "
"<ecommerce_design/product_page/customization>`, show specific :ref:`buttons "
"<ecommerce_design/product_page/buttons>`, customize the :ref:`attribute "
"details section <ecommerce_design/product_page/attributes>`, "
"enable :ref:`additional organizational features <ecommerce_design/"
"product_page/page-features>`, and add content using :ref:`building blocks "
"<ecommerce_design/product_page/building_blocks>`."
msgstr ""
"Las páginas de producto de comercio electrónico demuestran todos los "
"detalles del producto y elementos audiovisuales relacionados a los productos "
"relevantes. Puedes personalizar la :ref:`sección de imágenes y videos "
"<ecommerce/product_page/image-customization>`, seleccionar :ref:`qué "
"información de producto mostrar <ecommerce_design/product_page/"
"customization>`, mostrar :ref:`botones <ecommerce_design/product_page/"
"buttons>` específicos, personalizar la :ref:`sección de detalles de los "
"atributos <ecommerce_design/product_page/attributes>`, "
"activar :ref:`funciones de organización adicionales <ecommerce_design/"
"product_page/page-features>` y agregar contenido usando :ref:`los bloques de "
"creación <ecommerce_design/product_page/building_blocks>`."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/ecommerce_design/product_page.rst:19
msgid ""
"After :ref:`adding media items on the product form <ecommerce/products/"
"images>` or upon :ref:`product creation in the frontend <ecommerce/products/"
"product-creation>`, customize them on the frontend product pages. To do so, "
"navigate to the relevant product page in the online shop, "
"click :guilabel:`Edit` in the upper-right corner, and navigate to "
"the :guilabel:`Style` tab."
msgstr ""
"Después de :ref:`agregar elementos audiovisuales al formulario del producto "
"<ecommerce/products/images>` o al :ref:`crear productos en el frontend "
"<ecommerce/products/product-creation>`, puedes personalizarlos en el "
"frontend de las páginas del producto. Para hacerlo, ve a la página de "
"producto relevante en la tienda en línea, haz clic en :guilabel:`Editar` en "
"la esquina superior derecha y ve a la pestaña :guilabel:`Estilo`."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/ecommerce_design/product_page.rst:25
msgid ""
"To access the relevant product page from the :ref:`product form <ecommerce/"
"products/product-form>` in the backend, click the :icon:`fa-"
"globe` :guilabel:`Go to Website` smart button at the top of the form."
msgstr ""
"Para acceder a la página del producto relevante desde el :ref:`formulario "
"del producto <ecommerce/products/product-form>` en el backend, haz clic en "
"el botón inteligente :icon:`fa-globe` :guilabel:`Ir al sitio web` en la "
"parte superior del formulario."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/ecommerce_design/product_page.rst:29
msgid ""
"To manage individual media items, click the item on the product page and "
"scroll down to the :guilabel:`Image` section of the website editor. You can "
"then :guilabel:`Replace` or :guilabel:`Remove` the image or video "
"and :guilabel:`Re-order` the items. Use the :icon:`fa-angle-double-left` "
"(:guilabel:`left double arrow`) or :icon:`fa-angle-double-right` "
"(:guilabel:`right double arrow`) to move the media to the first or last "
"position, and the :icon:`fa-angle-left` (:guilabel:`left arrow`) "
"or :icon:`fa-angle-right` (:guilabel:`right arrow`) to move them by one "
"position."
msgstr ""
"Para gestionar elementos audiovisuales individuales, haz clic en el elemento "
"en la página del producto y deslízate a la sección :guilabel:`Imagen` del "
"editor de sitio web. Aquí puedes :guilabel:`Reemplzar` "
"o :guilabel:`Eliminar` la imagen o el video y :guilabel:`Volver a ordenar` "
"los elementos. Usa los iconos :icon:`fa-angle-double-left` "
"(:guilabel:`flecha doble a la izquierda`) o :icon:`fa-angle-double-right` "
"(:guilabel:`flecha doble a la derecha`) para mover el elemento audiovisual a "
"la primera o a la última posición; usa los iconos :icon:`fa-angle-left` "
"(:guilabel:`flecha a la izquierda`) o :icon:`fa-angle-right` "
"(:guilabel:`flecha a la derecha`) para moverlos una posición."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/ecommerce_design/product_page.rst:37
msgid ""
"To adjust the layout of the images and videos section, go "
"to :guilabel:`Images Area` and define the images' size "
"and :guilabel:`Position`. Then, navigate to the :guilabel:`Images` section, "
"and use the following options to customize this section:"
msgstr ""
"Para ajustar el diseño de la sección de imágenes y videos, ve "
"al :guilabel:`área de las imágenes` y define el tamaño de la imagen y "
"su :guilabel:`posición`. Después ve a la sección :guilabel:`imágenes` y usa "
"las opciones a continuación para personalizar esta sección:"

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/ecommerce_design/product_page.rst:41
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Main image`: Click :guilabel:`Replace` to change the main product "
"image."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Imagen principal`: Haz clic en :guilabel:`Reemplazar` para "
"cambiar la imagen principal del producto."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/ecommerce_design/product_page.rst:44
msgid "It is not possible to use a video as the main media item."
msgstr "No es posible usar un video como elemento audiovisual principal."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/ecommerce_design/product_page.rst:46
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Extra Media`: :guilabel:`Add More` images or videos (including "
"via URL) or :guilabel:`Remove all` media items."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Medios adicionales`: :guilabel:`Agrega más` imágenes o videos "
"(incluso con una URL) o :guilabel:`elimina todos` los elementos "
"audiovisuales."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/ecommerce_design/product_page.rst:48
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Display`: Choose between the following layouts when you use more "
"than one media item:"
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Visualización`: Selecciona uno de los diseños a continuación "
"cuando uses más de un elemento audiovisual:"

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/ecommerce_design/product_page.rst:50
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Carousel`: This option allows visitors to navigate from one image "
"to the next using the :icon:`fa-angle-left` (:guilabel:`left arrow`) "
"or :icon:`fa-angle-right` (:guilabel:`right arrow`). "
"Show :guilabel:`Thumbnails` on the :icon:`fa-long-arrow-left` "
"(:guilabel:`Left`) or at the :icon:`fa-long-arrow-down` (:guilabel:`Bottom`) "
"and adapt the corner :guilabel:`Roundness` of the images."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Carrusel`: Esta opción permite que los visitantes naveguen de una "
"imagen a la otra usando el icono :icon:`fa-angle-left` (:guilabel:`flecha a "
"la izquierda`) o :icon:`fa-angle-right` (:guilabel:`flecha a la derecha`). "
"Muestra las :guilabel:`Miniaturas` a la :icon:`fa-long-arrow-left` "
"(:guilabel:`izquierda`) o hasta :icon:`fa-long-arrow-down` "
"(:guilabel:`abajo`) y adapta el :guilabel:`redondeo` de las esquinas de la "
"imagen."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/ecommerce_design/product_page.rst:56
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Grid`: This layout displays media items in a square layout. "
"Adjust the number of :guilabel:`Columns` and define the :guilabel:`Spacing` "
"between the images in the grid, if necessary."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Cuadrícula`: Este diseño muestra los elementos multimedia en "
"formato cuadrado. Ajusta el número de :guilabel:`columnas` y define "
"el :guilabel:`espaciado` entre las imágenes de la cuadrícula en caso de que "
"sea necesario."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/ecommerce_design/product_page.rst:60
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Auto-crop`: Choose a size to cut/trim images to match the page "
"layout. This is useful when designing the :guilabel:`Mobile` :ref:`layout "
"<website/visibility/mobile-and-computer>`."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Corte automático`: Selecciona un tamaño al que cortar o recortar "
"las imágenes y que encaje con el diseño de la página. Esto es útil al "
"crear :ref:`el diseño <website/visibility/mobile-and-computer>` "
"para :guilabel:`dispositivos móviles`."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/ecommerce_design/product_page.rst:62
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Zoom on click`: Enable image zoom when visitors click an image."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Aumento al hacer clic`: Activa esta función para que se haga un "
"acercamiento a la imagen cuando los visitantes hagan clic en ella."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/ecommerce_design/product_page.rst:67
msgid "Page layout and product information display"
msgstr "Visualización del diseño de la página e información del producto"

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/ecommerce_design/product_page.rst:69
msgid ""
"To customize the layout of the product pages, access any product page, "
"click :guilabel:`Edit` in the upper-right corner, and navigate to "
"the :guilabel:`Style` tab. Then, go to the :guilabel:`Page Width` setting "
"and choose either the :guilabel:`Regular` or :guilabel:`Full-width` option."
msgstr ""
"Para personalizar el diseño de las páginas de producto, accede a cualquier "
"página de producto, haz clic en :guilabel:`Editar` en la esquina superior "
"derecha y ve a la pestaña :guilabel:`Estilo`. Después, ve al "
"ajuste :guilabel:`Ancho de la página` y selecciona la "
"opción :guilabel:`Regular` o :guilabel:`Ancho completo`."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/ecommerce_design/product_page.rst:74
msgid ""
"You can choose a different width for the :ref:`shop page <ecommerce/catalog/"
"customize-layout>`."
msgstr ""
"Puedes elegir un ancho diferente para la :ref:`página de la tienda "
"<ecommerce/catalog/customize-layout>`."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/ecommerce_design/product_page.rst:76
msgid ""
"Select which product information appears on product pages using the options "
"available in the :guilabel:`Product Details` section. You can "
"configure :ref:`buttons <ecommerce_design/product_page/buttons>`, "
"define :ref:`how attributes are displayed <ecommerce_design/product_page/"
"attributes>`, organize the page using :ref:`page customization features "
"<ecommerce_design/product_page/page-features>`, and add content "
"using :ref:`building blocks <ecommerce_design/product_page/building_blocks>`."
msgstr ""
"Selecciona qué información del producto aparecerá en las páginas del "
"producto usando las opciones disponibles en la sección :guilabel:`Detalles "
"del producto`. Puedes configurar :ref:`botones <ecommerce_design/"
"product_page/buttons>`, definir :ref:`cómo se muestran los atributos "
"<ecommerce_design/product_page/attributes>`, organizar la página "
"usando :ref:`las funciones de personalización de la página <ecommerce_design/"
"product_page/page-features>` y agregar contenido usando los :ref:`bloques de "
"creación <ecommerce_design/product_page/building_blocks>`."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/ecommerce_design/product_page.rst:86
#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/web_design/elements.rst:44
