"filtro :guilabel:`Confirmadas` está habilitado. Elimina este filtro para "
"mostrar todos los registros."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/order_handling.rst:28
msgid ""
"The dashboard at the top of the :guilabel:`Orders` page provides a summary "
"of the orders and includes the following filter buttons:"
msgstr ""
"El tablero en la parte superior de la página :guilabel:`Órdenes` proporciona "
"un resumen de las órdenes e incluye los siguientes botones de filtro:"

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/order_handling.rst:31
msgid ""
":guilabel:`To Fulfill`: confirmed and paid orders (i.e., :ref:`sales orders "
"<ecommerce/handling/sales-sales-order>`)"
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Por procesar`: órdenes confirmadas y pagadas (es decir, "
":ref:`órdenes de venta <ecommerce/handling/sales-sales-order>`)"

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/order_handling.rst:33
msgid ""
":guilabel:`To Confirm`: unpaid and unconfirmed orders (i.e., :ref:`sent but "
"unconfirmed quotations <ecommerce/handling/sales-quotation-sent>`)"
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Por confirmar`: órdenes sin pagar y sin confirmar (es decir, "
":ref:`cotizaciones enviadas pero no confirmadas <ecommerce/handling/sales-"
"quotation-sent>`)"

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/order_handling.rst:35
msgid ""
":guilabel:`To Invoice`: confirmed orders that are ready for invoicing but "
"have not necessarily been fulfilled (i.e., :ref:`sales orders <ecommerce/"
"handling/sales-sales-order>`)"
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Por facturar`: órdenes confirmadas que están listas para "
"facturarse pero que no necesariamente se han procesado (es decir, "
":ref:`órdenes de venta <ecommerce/handling/sales-sales-order>`)"

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/order_handling.rst:38
msgid ""
"The number of :guilabel:`Visitors`, :guilabel:`Orders`, and "
"the :guilabel:`Sales` amount for a given period is displayed on the right "
"side of the :guilabel:`Orders` page dashboard."
msgstr ""
