#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/order_handling.rst:146
msgid ""
"Delivery orders are not generated for :guilabel:`Service` "
"or :doc:`subscription </applications/sales/subscriptions>` products."
msgstr ""
"Las órdenes de entrega no se generan para productos de :guilabel:`servicio` "
"o :doc:`suscripción </applications/sales/subscriptions>`."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/order_handling.rst:149
msgid ""
"Once a sales order is confirmed, a delivery order is automatically created. "
"To access it, click the :icon:`fa-truck` :guilabel:`Delivery` smart button "
"on the sales order."
msgstr ""
"Una vez que se haya confirmado la orden de ventas, la orden de entrega se "
"crea de forma automática. Para acceder a ella, haz clic en el botón "
"inteligente :icon:`fa-truck` :guilabel:`Entrega` en la orden de venta."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/order_handling.rst:152
msgid ""
"The next step is preparing e-commerce orders in the warehouse. Depending on "
"order volume, refill and stock management strategies, or available "
"resources, different :doc:`stock handling flows for receipts and deliveries "
"</applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/"
"daily_operations>` can be implemented. These flows may involve manually "
"receiving, :doc:`picking </applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/"
"shipping_receiving/picking_methods>`, and :doc:`packing </applications/"
"inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/"
"multipack>` products, printing :doc:`shipping labels </applications/"
"inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/labels>`, "
"and :doc:`shipping  <shipping>` orders to customers, or handling these "
"processes through :doc:`dropshipping </applications/inventory_and_mrp/"
"inventory/shipping_receiving/daily_operations/dropshipping>` "
"or :doc:`consignment flows </applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/"
"shipping_receiving/daily_operations/owned_stock>`."
msgstr ""
"El siguiente paso es preparar las órdenes de comercio electrónico en el "
"almacén. Dependiendo del volumen de la orden, las estrategias de "
"reabastecimiento y gestión de existencias, o los recursos disponibles, se "
"pueden implementar diferentes :doc:`flujos de gestión de existencias para "
"recepciones y entregas </applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/"
"shipping_receiving/daily_operations>`. Estos flujos involucran "
"recepción, :doc:`recolección </applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/"
"shipping_receiving/picking_methods>` y :doc:`embalaje </applications/"
"inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/"
"multipack>` manual de los productos, imprimir :doc:`etiquetas de envío </"
"applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/"
"setup_configuration/labels>`, y :doc:`enviar <shipping>` las órdenes a los "
"clientes, o gestionar estos procesos con flujos de :doc:`triangulación de "
"pedidos </applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/"
"daily_operations/dropshipping>` o :doc:`flujos de consignación </"
"applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/daily_operations/"
"owned_stock>`."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/order_handling.rst:167
msgid ""
"After completing the warehouse operations, return to the delivery order and "
"click :guilabel:`Validate` once the order has been shipped."
msgstr ""
"Después de completar las operaciones de almacén, regresa a la orden de envío "
"y haz clic en :guilabel:`Validar` cuando se haya enviado la orden."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/order_handling.rst:171
msgid ""
"To enable automatic confirmation emails for completed delivery orders "
"(:guilabel:`Done` status), go to :menuselection:`Inventory --> Configuration "
"--> Settings`, scroll to the :guilabel:`Shipping` section, and "
"enable :guilabel:`Confirmation Email`."
msgstr ""
"Para activar correos de confirmación automáticos para órdenes de envío "
"completadas (con el estado :guilabel:`Hecho`) ve a "
":menuselection:`Inventario --> Configuración --> Ajustes` y deslízate a la "
"sección :guilabel:`Envío`. Activa la :guilabel:`Confirmación por correo "
"electrónico`."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/order_handling.rst:180
msgid ""
"To ensure that products ordered by customers are reserved in stock, go "
"to :menuselection:`Inventory --> Configuration --> Operation Types`, click "
"the :guilabel:`Delivery Orders` operation type, and set "
"the :guilabel:`Reservation Method` field to :doc:`At Confirmation </"
"applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/"
"reservation_methods/at_confirmation>`. When enabled, product quantities are "
"automatically reserved once the order is confirmed, preventing items from "
"becoming unavailable after the order is placed."
msgstr ""
"Para asegurar que los productos que los clientes ordenen se reserven en las "
"existencias, ve a :menuselection:`Inventario --> Configuración --> Tipos de "
"operación`, haz clic en el tipo de operación :guilabel:`Órdenes de entrega` "
"y en el campo :guilabel:`Método de reserva` selecciona :doc:`En la "
"confirmación </applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/"
"reservation_methods/at_confirmation>`. Cuando se active, las cantidades de "
"los productos se reservan en automático una vez que se confirma la orden, lo "
"cual evita que los artículos ya no estén disponibles después de que se "
"realice la orden."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/order_handling.rst:188
msgid ""
"If the customer pays by :ref:`wire transfer <payment_providers/bank_payments/"
"wire_transfer>`, products are not reserved in stock until the payment is "
"received and the order is manually confirmed."
msgstr ""
"Si el cliente paga con :ref:`transferencia bancaria <payment_providers/"
"bank_payments/wire_transfer>`, los productos no se reservan en la existencia "
"hasta que se reciba el pago y la orden se confirme de forma manual."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/order_handling.rst:193
msgid ":doc:`shipping`"
msgstr ":doc:`shipping`"

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/order_handling.rst:198
msgid "Returns and refunds"
msgstr "Devoluciones y reembolsos"

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/order_handling.rst:200
msgid ""
"To allow customers to initiate :doc:`returns </applications/sales/sales/"
"products_prices/returns>` through the :doc:`customer portal </applications/"
"general/users/user_portals>`, go to :menuselection:`Inventory --> "
"Configuration --> Settings`, scroll down to the :guilabel:`Operations` "
"section, and enable :guilabel:`Allow Spontaneous Returns`. Then, specify how "
"many :guilabel:`days after delivery` customers can return products, and "
"click :guilabel:`Save`."
msgstr ""
"Para permitir que los clientes inicien :doc:`devoluciones </applications/"
"sales/sales/products_prices/returns>` a través del :doc:`portal del cliente "
"</applications/general/users/user_portals>`, ve a "
":menuselection:`Inventario --> Configuración --> Ajustes`, desplázate hacia "
"abajo hasta la sección :guilabel:`Operaciones` y habilita "
":guilabel:`Permitir devoluciones espontáneas`. Luego, especifica cuántos "
":guilabel:`días después de la entrega` los clientes pueden devolver los "
"productos y haz clic en :guilabel:`Guardar`."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/order_handling.rst:206
msgid ""
"Once enabled, click :icon:`fa-arrow-right` :guilabel:`Manage Return Reasons` "
"to view all configured :guilabel:`Return Reasons`. To create a new reason, "
"click :guilabel:`New` and enter the reason in the :guilabel:`Reason` field."
msgstr ""
"Una vez habilitado, haz clic en :icon:`fa-arrow-right` :guilabel:`Gestionar "
"motivos de devolución` para ver todos los :guilabel:`Motivos de devolución` "
"configurados. Para crear un nuevo motivo, haz clic en :guilabel:`Nuevo` e "
"ingresa el motivo en el campo :guilabel:`Motivo`."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/order_handling.rst:211
msgid ""
"At least one return reason must exist to allow customers to complete the "
"return process."
msgstr ""
"Debe existir al menos un motivo de devolución para que los clientes puedan "
"completar el proceso de devolución."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/order_handling.rst:213
msgid "Customers can return a product by following these steps:"
msgstr "Los clientes pueden devolver un producto siguiendo estos pasos:"

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/order_handling.rst:215
msgid "Navigate to the :guilabel:`Your Orders` section of the portal."
msgstr "Ve a la sección :guilabel:`Tus pedidos` del portal."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/order_handling.rst:216
msgid "Select the relevant order."
msgstr "Selecciona la orden correspondiente."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/order_handling.rst:217
msgid "Click the :icon:`fa-reply` :guilabel:`Return` button."
msgstr "Haz clic en el botón :icon:`fa-reply` :guilabel:`Devolver`."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/order_handling.rst:0
msgid "Return button in the portal."
msgstr "Botón de devolución en el portal."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/order_handling.rst:222
msgid ""
"In the :guilabel:`Request a return` pop-up window, specify the quantity of "
"the product to return and select a :guilabel:`Return reason` from the drop-"
"down menu."
msgstr ""
"En la ventana emergente :guilabel:`Solicitar una devolución`, especifica la "
"cantidad del producto a devolver y selecciona un :guilabel:`Motivo de "
"devolución` en el menú desplegable."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/order_handling.rst:224
msgid ""
"Click :guilabel:`Continue` and :guilabel:`Download Return Label` to view and "
"print the return document."
msgstr ""
"Haz clic en :guilabel:`Continuar` y en :guilabel:`Descargar etiqueta de "
"devolución` para ver e imprimir el documento de devolución."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/order_handling.rst:227
msgid ""
"Once the returned items are received, initiate the :doc:`return and refund "
"process </applications/sales/sales/products_prices/returns>` in the backend."
msgstr ""
"Cuando se reciban los artículos devueltos, inicia el :doc:`proceso de "
"devolución y reembolso </applications/sales/sales/products_prices/returns>` "
"en el backend."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/order_handling.rst:231
msgid ""
":doc:`Returning </applications/sales/sales/products_prices/returns>` "
"products may not be possible depending on the :doc:`product type </"
"applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/product_management/configure/type>`."
msgstr ""
"Dependiendo del :doc:`tipo de producto </applications/inventory_and_mrp/"
"inventory/product_management/configure/type>`, es posible que "
"la :doc:`devolución </applications/sales/sales/products_prices/returns>` no "
"se pueda hacer."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/order_handling.rst:234
msgid ""
"To issue :doc:`refunds </applications/finance/accounting/customer_invoices/"
"credit_notes>`, the payment must have been made through a :ref:`refund-"
"compatible payment provider <payment_providers/supported_providers>`."
msgstr ""
"Para emitir :doc:`reembolsos </applications/finance/accounting/"
"customer_invoices/credit_notes>`, el pago se debe realizar a través de "
"un :ref:`proveedor de pago compatible con reembolsos <payment_providers/"
"supported_providers>`."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/order_handling.rst:239
msgid ":doc:`/applications/services/helpdesk/advanced/after_sales`"
msgstr ":doc:`/applications/services/helpdesk/advanced/after_sales`"

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/order_handling.rst:244
msgid "Invoicing"
msgstr "Facturación"

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/order_handling.rst:246
msgid ""
"The final step of an e-commerce order is generating and sending "
"the :doc:`customer invoice </applications/finance/accounting/"
"customer_invoices>`. Depending on your needs, invoices can be generated "
"manually or automatically."
msgstr ""
"El último paso de una orden de comercio electrónico es enviar :doc:`la "
"factura del cliente </applications/finance/accounting/customer_invoices>`. "
"Según tus necesidades, las facturas se pueden generar de forma manual o "
"automática."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/order_handling.rst:250
msgid "To automate invoicing:"
msgstr "Para automatizar la facturación:"

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/order_handling.rst:253
msgid ""
"In the :guilabel:`eCommerce` section, enable :guilabel:`Automatic Invoice`."
msgstr ""
"En la sección :guilabel:`Comercio electrónico`, activa "
"la :guilabel:`facturación automática`."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/order_handling.rst:254
msgid ""
"Select the relevant :guilabel:`Email Template`, then click :guilabel:`Save`."
msgstr ""
"Selecciona la :guilabel:`plantilla de correo` relevante y después haz clic "
"en :guilabel:`Guardar`."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/order_handling.rst:255
msgid ""
"If needed, click the :icon:`fa-arrow-right` (:guilabel:`Internal link`) icon "
"next to the template name to customize the :doc:`email template </"
"applications/general/companies/email_template>`."
msgstr ""
"Si es necesario, haz clic en el icono :icon:`fa-arrow-right` "
"(:guilabel:`Enlace interno`) junto al nombre de la plantilla para "
"personalizar la :doc:`plantilla de correo electrónico </applications/general/"
"companies/email_template>`."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/order_handling.rst:259
msgid ""
"Customers can view their invoices under :guilabel:`Your Invoices` in "
"the :doc:`portal </applications/general/users/user_portals>`."
msgstr ""
"Los clientes pueden ver sus facturas en la sección :guilabel:`Tus facturas` "
"del :doc:`portal </applications/general/users/user_portals>`."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/order_handling.rst:261
msgid ""
"Invoices are only sent automatically if (and when) the :doc:`payment </"
"applications/finance/payment_providers>` is registered."
msgstr ""
"Las facturas solo se envían de forma automática si (y cuando) se registre "
"el :doc:`pago </applications/finance/payment_providers>`."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/order_handling.rst:263
msgid ""
"When automatic invoicing is disabled, and invoices are created manually, "
"they appear as :doc:`pro-forma invoices </applications/sales/sales/invoicing/"
"proforma>` in the customer portal until they are manually :ref:`sent to the "
"customer <accounting/invoice/sending>`."
msgstr ""
"Cuando se desactiva la facturación automática y las facturas se crean de "
"forma manual, aparecen como :doc:`facturas proforma </applications/sales/"
"sales/invoicing/proforma>` en el portal del cliente hasta que se "
":ref:`envíen al cliente <accounting/invoice/sending>` de forma manual."

