#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/payments.rst:3
msgid "Payments"
msgstr "Pagos"

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/payments.rst:5
msgid "E-commerce orders can be paid:"
msgstr "Las órdenes de comercio electrónico se pueden pagar:"

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/payments.rst:7
msgid ""
"via a payment method made available through a :ref:`supported payment "
"provider <payment_providers/supported_providers>`, such as debit and credit "
"cards;"
msgstr ""
"mediante un método de pago disponible a través de un :ref:`proveedor de pago "
"compatible <payment_providers/supported_providers>`, como tarjetas de débito "
"y crédito;"

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/payments.rst:9
msgid ""
"via a :doc:`bank payment </applications/finance/payment_providers/"
"bank_payments>`;"
msgstr ""
"a través de un :doc:`pago bancario </applications/finance/payment_providers/"
"bank_payments>`;"

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/payments.rst:10
msgid ""
"in person, either :ref:`on site <ecommerce/payments/pay-on-site>` "
"or :ref:`upon delivery <ecommerce/payments/cash-on-delivery>`;"
msgstr ""
"en persona, ya sea :ref:`en el sitio <ecommerce/payments/pay-on-site>` o "
":ref:`contra entrega <ecommerce/payments/cash-on-delivery>`;"

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/payments.rst:12
msgid ""
"later, :ref:`after receiving an invoice <ecommerce/payments/pay-on-invoice>`."
msgstr ""
"más adelante, :ref:`después de recibir una factura <ecommerce/payments/pay-"
"on-invoice>`."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/payments.rst:15
msgid ""
"The payment options displayed at :ref:`checkout <ecommerce/checkout/steps>` "
"depend on the :ref:`active payment providers <payment_providers/add_new>`, "
"the enabled :ref:`payment methods <payment_providers/payment_methods>`, "
"the :ref:`availability options <payment_providers/availability>` set for the "
"provider, the :ref:`customer's country and currency <payment_providers/"
"currencies_countries>`, and the :doc:`delivery method <shipping>` selected "
"by the customer."
msgstr ""
"Las opciones de pago que se muestran en :ref:`el proceso de pago <ecommerce/"
"checkout/steps>` dependen de los :ref:`proveedores de pago activos "
"<payment_providers/add_new>`, de los :ref:`métodos de pago "
"<payment_providers/payment_methods>` habilitados, de las :ref:`opciones de "
"disponibilidad <payment_providers/availability>` configuradas para el "
"proveedor, del :ref:`país y la moneda del cliente <payment_providers/"
"currencies_countries>` y del :doc:`método de entrega <shipping>` "
"seleccionado por el cliente."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/payments.rst:23
msgid "Payment providers"
msgstr "Proveedores de pag"

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/payments.rst:25
msgid ""
"Several :ref:`payment providers are supported <payment_providers/"
"supported_providers>`. Each provider supports a specific list "
"of :ref:`countries and currencies <payment_providers/currencies_countries>` "
"and offers specific :ref:`payment methods <payment_providers/"
"payment_methods>`, which can be individually (de)activated to match business "
"requirements."
msgstr ""
"Hay varios :ref:`proveedores de pago compatibles <payment_providers/"
"supported_providers>`. Cada proveedor es compatible con una lista específica "
"de :ref:`países y monedas <payment_providers/currencies_countries>` y ofrece "
":ref:`métodos de pago <payment_providers/payment_methods>` específicos que "
"puedes (des)activar de forma individual según las necesidades de tu negocio."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/payments.rst:31
msgid ""
"To make a payment provider's payment methods available to customers "
"at :ref:`checkout <ecommerce/checkout/payment>`, go "
"to :menuselection:`Website --> Configuration --> "
"Payments`, :guilabel:`Install` the relevant provider, :ref:`configure it, "
"and publish it <payment_providers/add_new>`."
msgstr ""
"Para que los métodos de pago de un proveedor estén disponibles para los "
"clientes en :ref:`el proceso de pago <ecommerce/checkout/payment>`, ve a "
":menuselection:`Sitio web --> Configuración --> Pagos`, :guilabel:`instala` "
"el proveedor correspondiente, :ref:`configúralo y publícalo "
"<payment_providers/add_new>`."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/payments.rst:39
msgid "Pay on site"
msgstr "Pagar en el sitio"

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/payments.rst:41
msgid ""
"To allow customers to reserve products online and pay when collecting them "
"in-store, enable and configure the :ref:`Click & Collect feature <ecommerce/"
"shipping/instore-pickup>`. The :guilabel:`Pay on Site` payment provider is "
"then automatically installed and published."
msgstr ""
"Para permitir que los clientes reserven productos en línea y paguen al "
"recogerlos en la tienda, habilita y configura la :ref:`función Click & "
"Collect <ecommerce/shipping/instore-pickup>`. A continuación, el proveedor "
"de pago :guilabel:`Pago en el sitio` se instala y publica automáticamente."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/payments.rst:46
msgid ""
"This payment method is available at checkout only for customers who select "
"the :guilabel:`Pick up in store` delivery method."
msgstr ""
"Este método de pago solo está disponible en el proceso de pago para los "
"clientes que seleccionen el método de entrega :guilabel:`Recoger en tienda`."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/payments.rst:52
msgid "Cash on delivery"
msgstr "Pago contra entrega"

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/payments.rst:54
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`Cash on Delivery` payment method allows customers to pay for "
"their order at the time of delivery. To make it available to customers, "
"follow these steps:"
msgstr ""
"El método de pago :guilabel:`Pago contra entrega` permite a los clientes "
"pagar su pedido al momento de la entrega. Para ponerlo a disposición de los "
"clientes, sigue estos pasos:"

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/payments.rst:57
msgid ":doc:`Navigate to the relevant delivery method form <shipping>`."
msgstr ""
":doc:`Ve al formulario del método de entrega correspondiente <shipping>`."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/payments.rst:58
msgid "Enable :guilabel:`Cash on Delivery`."
msgstr "Habilita :guilabel:`Pago contra entrega`."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/payments.rst:59
msgid "Go to :menuselection:`Website --> Configuration --> Payments`."
msgstr "Ve a :menuselection:`Sitio web --> Configuración --> Pagos`."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/payments.rst:60
msgid ""
"Select the :guilabel:`Cash on Delivery` payment provider and :ref:`publish "
"it <payment_providers/add_new>`."
msgstr ""
"Selecciona el proveedor de pago :guilabel:`Pago contra entrega` y "
":ref:`publícalo <payment_providers/add_new>`."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/payments.rst:66
msgid "Pay on invoice"
msgstr "Pago contra factura"

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/payments.rst:68
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`Pay on Invoice` payment method allows customers to place an "
"order without upfront payment. The sales order is confirmed automatically, "
"and payment is made based on the invoice issued for it. This method is "
"particularly useful for :doc:`B2B customers </applications/websites/"
"ecommerce/configuration/b2b_b2c>`, who commonly settle invoices after "
"delivery rather than at the time of purchase."
msgstr ""
"El método de pago :guilabel:`Pago contra factura` permite a los clientes "
"realizar un pedido sin pagar por adelantado. La orden de venta se confirma "
"de forma automática y el pago se realiza según la factura emitida para esta. "
"Este método es especialmente útil para los :doc:`clientes B2B </applications/"
"websites/ecommerce/configuration/b2b_b2c>`, quienes suelen liquidar las "
"facturas después de la entrega en lugar de hacerlo al momento de la compra."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/payments.rst:74
msgid ""
"To configure it, go to :menuselection:`Website --> Configuration --> "
"Payments` and select the :guilabel:`Pay on Invoice` payment provider. "
"Then, :ref:`restrict its availability <payment_providers/availability>` if "
"needed (e.g., by selecting a B2B-specific :ref:`pricelist <ecommerce/prices/"
"pricelists>`) and :ref:`publish it <payment_providers/add_new>`."
msgstr ""
"Para configurarlo, ve a :menuselection:`Sitio web --> Configuración --> "
"Pagos` y selecciona el proveedor de pago :guilabel:`Pago contra factura`. "
"Luego, :ref:`restringe su disponibilidad <payment_providers/availability>` "
"si es necesario (por ejemplo, al seleccionar una :ref:`lista de precios "
"<ecommerce/prices/pricelists>` específica para B2B) y :ref:`publícalo "
"<payment_providers/add_new>`."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/payments.rst:80
msgid ""
"Enable the :ref:`Automatic Invoicing <ecommerce/handling/invoices>` feature "
"in the eCommerce settings to automatically send an invoice to the customer."
msgstr ""
"Activa la función de :ref:`Facturación automática <ecommerce/handling/"
"invoices>` en los ajustes de Comercio electrónico para enviar de forma "
