"applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/"
"setup_configuration/third_party_shipper>`, como :doc:`FedEx </applications/"
"inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/"
"fedex>`, :doc:`UPS </applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/"
"shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/ups_credentials>`, o :doc:`DHL </"
"applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/"
"setup_configuration/dhl_credentials>` para optimizar las operaciones de "
"envío. Conectarte con un proveedor externo te permite "
"generar :doc:`etiquetas de rastreo </applications/inventory_and_mrp/"
"inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/labels>` de forma "
"automática y ofrecerle a los clientes varias opciones de envío al momento "
"del :ref:`pago <ecommerce/checkout/steps>`."

