msgstr ""
"En el :ref:`editor de menús <website/header_footer/open-menu-editor>`, haz "
"clic en :guilabel:`Agregar elemento de megamenú`."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/structure/header_footer.rst:147
msgid "In the pop-up window, enter the :guilabel:`Title` of the mega menu."
msgstr "En la ventana emergente, escribe el :guilabel:`título` del megamenú."

