"agregar el botón :icon:`fa-caret-up` :guilabel:`Desplazar hacia arriba` y "
"elige su posición."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/structure/header_footer.rst:251
msgid ""
"Toggle the :guilabel:`Copyright` switch to hide or show the copyright "
"notice. If enabled, add a color in the :guilabel:`Copyright` section if "
"needed."
msgstr ""
"Activa o desactiva la opción :guilabel:`Derechos de autor` para mostrar u "
"ocultar el aviso de derechos de autor. Si la activas, puedes agregar un "
"color en la sección :guilabel:`Derechos de autor` en caso de que sea "
"necesario."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/structure/header_footer.rst:253
msgid ""
"Hide or show the footer for the current page by toggling the :guilabel:`Page "
"visibility` switch. Hidden elements, including the footer when applicable, "
"are available under :ref:`Invisible Elements <website/visibility/invisible-"
"elements>`."
msgstr ""
"Muestra u oculta el pie de página de la página actual con la "
"opción :guilabel:`Visibilidad de la página`. Los elementos ocultos, incluido "
"el pie de página cuando corresponda, están disponibles en :ref:`Elementos "
"invisibles <website/visibility/invisible-elements>`."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/structure/header_footer.rst:258
msgid ""
"You can also add :guilabel:`Inner Content` :ref:`blocks <website/"
"building_blocks/add>` to the header or footer for further customization, "
"such as :ref:`e-commerce-specific footer options <ecommerce/catalog/footer>`."
msgstr ""
"También puedes agregar :ref:`bloques <website/building_blocks/add>` "
"de :guilabel:`contenido interno` al encabezado o al pie de página para "
"personalizarlos aún más, por ejemplo, con :ref:`opciones del pie de página "
"para comercio electrónico <ecommerce/catalog/footer>`."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/structure/pages.rst:7
msgid ""
"Odoo allows you to :ref:`create <website/pages/page_creation>` different "
"kinds of webpages, including with the help of :ref:`AI <website/pages/ai-"
"generator>`, :ref:`publish <website/pages/un-publish-page>` them, and define "
"their structure and visibility by configuring :ref:`page properties <website/"
"pages/page_properties>`. Pages can be :ref:`duplicated <website/pages/"
"duplicate-page>`, :ref:`deleted <website/pages/delete-page>`, "
"and :ref:`redirected <website/pages/URL-redirection>`."
msgstr ""
"Odoo te permite :ref:`crear <website/pages/page_creation>` distintos tipos "
"de páginas web, incluso con ayuda de :ref:`IA <website/pages/ai-"
"generator>`, :ref:`publicarlas <website/pages/un-publish-page>` y definir su "
"estructura y visibilidad al configurar las :ref:`propiedades de la página "
"<website/pages/page_properties>`. Puedes :ref:`duplicar <website/pages/"
"duplicate-page>`, :ref:`eliminar <website/pages/delete-page>` "
"y :ref:`redirigir <website/pages/URL-redirection>` páginas."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/structure/pages.rst:16
msgid "Page types"
msgstr "Tipos de páginas"

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/structure/pages.rst:18
msgid ""
"**Static** pages, such as the homepage or :ref:`custom <website/pages/"
"page_creation>` pages, contain fixed content that does not change "
"dynamically. You can manually create these pages, define their URLs, and "
"adapt their :ref:`properties <website/pages/page_properties>` as needed."
msgstr ""
"Las páginas **estáticas**, como la página de inicio o las "
"páginas :ref:`personalizadas <website/pages/page_creation>`, tienen "
"contenido fijo que no cambia de forma dinámica. Puedes crearlas de forma "
"manual, definir sus URL y ajustar sus :ref:`propiedades <website/pages/"
"page_properties>` a tus necesidades."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/structure/pages.rst:22
msgid ""
"**Dynamic** pages, on the other hand, display content that changes "
"automatically based on the data in the database and user interaction (e.g., "
"filtering). They are generated automatically by Odoo, for example, when "
"installing an app or module (e.g., `/shop` or `/blog`) or publishing a "
"new :doc:`product <../../ecommerce>` or :doc:`blog post <../../blog>`. "
"Dynamic pages are managed differently from static pages."
msgstr ""
"Las páginas **dinámicas**, en cambio, muestran contenido que cambia de forma "
"automática según los datos de la base de datos y la interacción del usuario "
"(por ejemplo, al aplicar un filtro). Odoo las genera de forma automática, "
"por ejemplo, al instalar una aplicación o módulo (como `/tienda` o `/blog`) "
"o al publicar un nuevo :doc:`producto <../../ecommerce>` o una "
"nueva :doc:`entrada de blog <../../blog>`. Estas páginas se gestionan de "
"forma distinta a las páginas estáticas."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/structure/pages.rst:31
msgid "Page creation"
msgstr "Creación de páginas"

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/structure/pages.rst:33
msgid "Website pages can be created from the **frontend** and the **backend**."
msgstr "Puedes crear páginas web desde el **frontend** y el **backend**."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/structure/pages.rst:35
msgid "To create a new website page:"
msgstr "Para crear una nueva página web:"

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/structure/pages.rst:37
msgid ""
"Either open the **Website** app, click :guilabel:`New` :icon:`fa-caret-down` "
"in the top-right corner, then select :guilabel:`Page`;"
msgstr ""
"Abre la aplicación **Sitio web**, haz clic en :guilabel:`Nuevo` :icon:`fa-"
"caret-down` en la esquina superior derecha y selecciona :guilabel:`Página`."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/structure/pages.rst:39
msgid ""
"Or go to :menuselection:`Website --> Site --> Pages` and "
"click :guilabel:`New`."
msgstr ""
"O, vaya a :menuselection:`Sitio web --> Sitio --> Páginas` y haga clic "
"en :guilabel:`Nuevo`. "

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/structure/pages.rst:41
msgid ""
"In the :guilabel:`New Page` pop-up, select a template. Templates are grouped "
"by type:"
msgstr ""
"Selecciona una plantilla en la ventana emergente :guilabel:`Nueva página`. "
"Las plantillas están agrupadas por tipo:"

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/structure/pages.rst:43
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Basic`: Multi-purpose page. A blank page is also available to "
"start from scratch."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Básica`: Una página multiusos. También puedes usar una página en "
"blanco para empezar desde cero."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/structure/pages.rst:44
msgid ":guilabel:`About`: Information about the brand and company."
msgstr ":guilabel:`Acerca de`: Información sobre la marca y la empresa."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/structure/pages.rst:45
msgid ":guilabel:`Landing Pages`: Summary of company content and information."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Páginas principales`: Resumen del contenido e información de la "
"empresa."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/structure/pages.rst:46
msgid ":guilabel:`Gallery`: Photos and media showcase."
msgstr ":guilabel:`Galería`: Exhibición de fotografías y otros medios."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/structure/pages.rst:47
msgid ":guilabel:`Services`: Overview of the services offered by the company."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Servicios`: Información general de los servicios que ofrece la "
"empresa."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/structure/pages.rst:48
msgid ":guilabel:`Pricing Plans`: Overview of the subscriptions and prices."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Planes de precios`: Vista general de las suscripciones y los "
"precios."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/structure/pages.rst:49
msgid ":guilabel:`Team`: The people behind the company."
msgstr ":guilabel:`Equipo`: Las personas de la empresa."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/structure/pages.rst:50
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Custom`: Custom-created templates. To add a custom template, open "
"the page you want to save as a template and :ref:`edit the page's properties "
"<website/pages/page_properties>`."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Personalizado`: Plantillas creadas a la medida. Para agregar una "
"plantilla personalizada, abre la página que quieres guardar como plantilla "
"y :ref:`edita las propiedades de la página <website/pages/page_properties>`."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/structure/pages.rst:54
msgid "In the :guilabel:`New Page` pop-up:"
msgstr "En la ventana emergente :guilabel:`Nueva página`:"

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/structure/pages.rst:56
msgid ""
"Enter a :guilabel:`Page Title`. This title is used in the menu and the "
"page's URL."
msgstr ""
"Escribe un :guilabel:`título de página`. Este título se usa en el menú y en "
"la URL de la página."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/structure/pages.rst:57
msgid ""
"Disable :guilabel:`Add to menu` if the page should not appear in the menu."
msgstr ""
"Desactive la opción :guilabel:`Agregar al menú` si la página no debe "
"aparecer en el menú. "

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/structure/pages.rst:58
msgid ""
"Enable :guilabel:`Generate text` to use the :ref:`AI <website/pages/ai-"
"generator>` tool to build the page."
msgstr ""
"Activa :guilabel:`Generar texto` para usar la herramienta de :ref:`IA "
"<website/pages/ai-generator>` y crear la página."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/structure/pages.rst:62
msgid ""
"If needed, :doc:`customize the page's content and appearance <../"
"web_design>` using the website editor or :ref:`translate <translate/"
"translate>` it, then click :guilabel:`Save`."
msgstr ""
"Si lo necesitas, :doc:`personaliza el contenido y la apariencia de la página "
"<../web_design>` con el editor del sitio web o :ref:`tradúcela <translate/"
"translate>`, luego haz clic en :guilabel:`Guardar`."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/structure/pages.rst:64
msgid ":ref:`Publish <website/pages/un-publish-page>` the page."
msgstr ":ref:`Publica <website/pages/un-publish-page>` la página."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/structure/pages.rst:69
msgid "AI webpage generator"
msgstr "Generador de páginas web con IA"

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/structure/pages.rst:71
msgid ""
"To generate content using AI when :ref:`creating a new page <website/pages/"
"page_creation>`, follow these steps:"
msgstr ""
"Sigue estos pasos para generar contenido con IA al :ref:`crear una nueva "
"página <website/pages/page_creation>`:"

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/structure/pages.rst:74
msgid ""
"After choosing a template, in the :guilabel:`New Page` pop-up, toggle "
"the :guilabel:`AI Generate Text` switch."
msgstr ""
"Después de elegir una plantilla, en la ventana :guilabel:`Nueva página`, "
"presiona el botón :guilabel:`Generar texto con IA`."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/structure/pages.rst:76
msgid ""
"In the :guilabel:`Instructions` field, enter a short description of the page "
"being created. This should include a few important keywords that define the "
"page's focus and scope."
msgstr ""
"Ingresa una breve descripción de la página en el "
"campo :guilabel:`Instrucciones`. Incluye algunas palabras clave que definan "
"su enfoque y alcance."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/structure/pages.rst:78
msgid ""
"Select one of the tone options for the page, such "
"as :guilabel:`Concise`, :guilabel:`Professional`, :guilabel:`Friendly`, :guilabel:`Persuasive`, "
"or :guilabel:`Informative`."
msgstr ""
"Selecciona una de las opciones de tono para la página, "
"como :guilabel:`Conciso`, :guilabel:`Profesional`, :guilabel:`Amigable`, :guilabel:`Persuasivo` "
"o :guilabel:`Informativo`."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/structure/pages.rst:81
msgid ""
"Click :guilabel:`Create with AI`. It may take a few moments for the webpage "
"to load."
msgstr ""
"Haz clic en :guilabel:`Crear con IA`. La página web puede tardar un poco en "
"cargar."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/structure/pages.rst:None
msgid "The new page pop-up window with the \"AI Generate text\" options."
msgstr ""
"La ventana emergente de nueva página con las opciones de \"Generar texto con "
"IA\"."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/structure/pages.rst:88
msgid ""
"The AI application does **not** need to be installed on the database to use "
"the webpage generator."
msgstr ""
"**No** necesitas instalar la aplicación IA en la base de datos para usar el "
"generador de páginas web."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/structure/pages.rst:90
msgid ""
"Content created by the AI generator can be customized using "
"the :doc:`website editor <../web_design>`."
msgstr ""
"Puedes personalizar el contenido creado por el generador de IA con "
"el :doc:`editor del sitio web <../web_design>`."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/structure/pages.rst:92
msgid "The AI webpage generator is not available for the *Blank* page type."
msgstr ""
"El generador de páginas web con IA no está disponible cuando el tipo de "
"página es *En blanco*."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/structure/pages.rst:93
msgid ""
"The webpage generator may create :ref:`buttons <website/elements/buttons>`. "
"Before publishing the webpage, confirm that all buttons are linked to an "
"active webpage."
msgstr ""
"El generador de páginas web puede crear :ref:`botones <website/elements/"
"buttons>`. Antes de publicar la página, confirma que todos los botones estén "
"vinculados a una página activa."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/structure/pages.rst:97
msgid ":doc:`Web design <../web_design>`"
msgstr ":doc:`Diseño web <../web_design>`"

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/structure/pages.rst:98
msgid ":doc:`/applications/productivity/ai`"
msgstr ":doc:`/applications/productivity/ai`"

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/structure/pages.rst:103
msgid "Publishing/unpublishing pages"
msgstr "Publicar/No publicar páginas "

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/structure/pages.rst:105
msgid ""
"Pages need to be published to make them visible to website visitors. To "
"publish or unpublish a page, access it and toggle the switch in the upper-"
"right corner from :guilabel:`Unpublished` to :guilabel:`Published`, or vice "
"versa."
msgstr ""
"Las páginas deben estar publicadas para que los visitantes del sitio web "
"puedan verlas. Para publicar alguna o pausar su publicación, dirígete a ella "
"y presiona el botón ubicado en la esquina superior derecha para cambiar su "
"estado de :guilabel:`Sin publicar` a :guilabel:`Publicado` o viceversa."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/structure/pages.rst:None
msgid "Unpublished/Published toggle"
msgstr "Botón para publicar o pausar una publicación"

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/structure/pages.rst:113
msgid "It is also possible to:"
msgstr "También es posible:"

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/structure/pages.rst:115
msgid ""
"Publish/unpublish a page from the :ref:`page properties <website/pages/"
"page_properties>`."
msgstr ""
"Publicar o despublicar una página desde las :ref:`propiedades de la página "
"<website/pages/page_properties>`."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/structure/pages.rst:116
msgid ""
"Publish/unpublish several pages at once. To do so, go "
"to :menuselection:`Website --> Site --> Pages`, select the pages, then "
"click :icon:`fa-cog` :guilabel:`Actions` and select :icon:`fa-"
"globe` :guilabel:`Publish` or :icon:`fa-chain-broken` :guilabel:`Unpublish`."
msgstr ""
"Publica o despublica varias páginas a la vez. Para hacerlo, ve "
"a :menuselection:`Sitio web --> Sitio --> Páginas`, selecciona las páginas, "
"luego haz clic en :icon:`fa-cog` :guilabel:`Acciones` y selecciona :icon:`fa-"
"globe` :guilabel:`Publicar` o :icon:`fa-chain-"
"broken` :guilabel:`Despublicar`."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/structure/pages.rst:123
msgid "Page properties"
msgstr "Propiedades de página "

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/structure/pages.rst:125
msgid ""
"To modify a :ref:`static page's <website/pages/page_type>` properties, "
"access the page you wish to modify, then go to :menuselection:`Website --> "
"Site --> Properties`, where the following properties can be adapted:"
msgstr ""
"Para modificar las propiedades de una :ref:`página estática <website/pages/"
"page_type>`, accede a la página que quieres modificar y luego ve "
"a :menuselection:`Sitio web --> Sitio --> Propiedades`, donde podrás ajustar "
"las siguientes propiedades:"

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/structure/pages.rst:129
msgid ":guilabel:`Page Title`: Modify the page's title."
msgstr ":guilabel:`Título de la página`: Modifica el título de la página."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/structure/pages.rst:130
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Page URL`: Modify the page URL in the field. In this case, you "
"can redirect the old URL to the new one if needed. To do so, "
"enable :guilabel:`Redirect Old URL`, then select the :guilabel:`Type` "
"of :ref:`redirection <website/pages/URL-redirection>`:"
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`URL de la página`: Modifica la URL de la página en el campo. En "
"este caso puedes redirigir la URL antigua a la nueva si es necesario. Para "
"ello, habilita la opción :guilabel:`Redirigir URL antigua` y después elige "
"el :guilabel:`tipo` de :ref:`redirección <website/pages/URL-redirection>`:"

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/structure/pages.rst:134
msgid ":guilabel:`301 Moved permanently`: to redirect the page permanently."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`301 Movido de forma permanente`: para redirigir la página de "
"manera permanente."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/structure/pages.rst:135
msgid ":guilabel:`302 Moved temporarily`: to redirect the page temporarily."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`302 Movido de forma temporal`: para redirigir la página "
"temporalmente."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/structure/pages.rst:137
msgid ""
":guilabel:`In Menu`: Disable if the page should not appear in the menu. "
"Click the :icon:`fa-arrow-right` :guilabel:`Edit Menu` link to modify the "
"menu."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`En el menú`: Desactívalo si la página no debe aparecer en el "
"menú. Haz clic en el enlace :icon:`fa-arrow-right` :guilabel:`Editar menú` "
"para modificar el menú."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/structure/pages.rst:139
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Is Homepage`: Enable if the *static* page should serve as the "
"homepage of the website."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Es la página de inicio`: Actívalo si la página *estática* debe "
"funcionar como la página de inicio del sitio web."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/structure/pages.rst:140
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Has Parent Page`: Toggle the switch on to add a parent page in "
"breadcrumbs format."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Tiene página principal`: activa la opción para agregar una página "
"superior en formato de migas de pan."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/structure/pages.rst:141
msgid ":guilabel:`Published`: Enable it to publish the page."
msgstr ":guilabel:`Publicado`: Actívalo para publicar la página."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/structure/pages.rst:142
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Publish on`: To publish the page at a specific date and time, "
"click the field, set the date and time, then press **Enter** or "
"click :guilabel:`Apply` to validate the selection."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Publicar el`: para publicar la página en una fecha y hora "
"específicas, haz clic en el campo, establece la fecha y la hora, y luego "
"presiona **Enter** o haz clic en :guilabel:`Aplicar` para validar la "
"selección."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/structure/pages.rst:144
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Indexed`: Disable if the page should not appear in search engine "
"results."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Indexado`: Desactívalo si la página no debe aparecer en los "
"resultados de los motores de búsqueda."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/structure/pages.rst:145
msgid ":guilabel:`Visibility`: Select who can access the page:"
msgstr ":guilabel:`Visibilidad`: seleccione quién puede acceder a la página: "

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/structure/pages.rst:147
msgid ":guilabel:`Public`: Everyone can access the page."
msgstr ":guilabel:`Público`: Todas las personas pueden acceder a la página."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/structure/pages.rst:148
msgid ":guilabel:`Signed In`: Only signed-in users can access the page."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Inició sesión`: Solo los usuarios que iniciaron sesión pueden "
"acceder a la página."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/structure/pages.rst:149
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Restricted Group`: Select the :doc:`user access group(s) </"
"applications/general/users/access_rights>` in the :guilabel:`Authorized "
"Groups` field."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Grupo restringido`: Selecciona el o los :doc:`grupos de acceso de "
"usuario </applications/general/users/access_rights>` en el "
"campo :guilabel:`Grupos autorizados`."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/structure/pages.rst:151
msgid ""
":guilabel:`With Password`: Type the password required to access the page in "
"the :guilabel:`Password` field."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Con contraseña`: Escribe la contraseña necesaria para acceder a "
"la página en el campo :guilabel:`Contraseña`."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/structure/pages.rst:154
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Is a Template`: Toggle the switch to save the page as a template. "
"It is now available in the :guilabel:`Custom` category when :ref:`creating a "
"new page <website/pages/page_creation>`."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Es una plantilla`: Presiona el botón para guardar la página como "
"una plantilla. Ahora está disponible en la "
"categoría :guilabel:`Personalizado` cuando :ref:`creas una nueva página "
"<website/pages/page_creation>`."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/structure/pages.rst:160
msgid "Duplicating pages"
msgstr "Duplicar páginas"

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/structure/pages.rst:162
msgid ""
"To duplicate one or several pages, go to :menuselection:`Website --> Site --"
"> Pages`, select the relevant page(s), click :icon:`fa-"
"cog` :guilabel:`Actions`, and select :icon:`fa-files-"
"o` :guilabel:`Duplicate`. In the :guilabel:`Confirmation` window, enter "
"a :guilabel:`Page Name`, then click :guilabel:`Ok`. By default, the new page "
"is not published; it is added after the originally duplicated page in the "
"menu. Use the :doc:`menu editor <header_footer>` to remove it from the menu "
"or change its position."
msgstr ""
"Para duplicar una o varias páginas, ve a :menuselection:`Sitio web --> "
"Sitio --> Páginas`, selecciona las páginas correspondientes, haz clic en "
":icon:`fa-cog` :guilabel:`Acciones` y selecciona :icon:`fa-files-o` "
":guilabel:`Duplicar`. En la ventana de :guilabel:`Confirmación`, ingresa un "
":guilabel:`Nombre de la página` y haz clic en :guilabel:`Aceptar`. De forma "
"predeterminada, la nueva página no se publica; se agrega después de la "
"página duplicada originalmente en el menú. Usa el :doc:`editor de menús "
"<header_footer>` para eliminarla del menú o cambiar su posición."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/structure/pages.rst:172
msgid "Deleting pages"
msgstr "Eliminar páginas "

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/structure/pages.rst:174
msgid "To delete delete one or several pages, proceed as follows:"
msgstr "Para eliminar una o varias páginas, sigue estos pasos:"

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/structure/pages.rst:176
msgid ""
"Go to :menuselection:`Website --> Site --> Pages`, and select the relevant "
"page(s)."
msgstr ""
"Ve a :menuselection:`Sitio web --> Sitio --> Páginas` y selecciona las "
"páginas correspondientes."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/structure/pages.rst:177
msgid ""
"Click :icon:`fa-cog` :guilabel:`Actions`, and select :icon:`fa-"
"trash` :guilabel:`Delete`."
msgstr ""
"Haz clic en :icon:`fa-cog` :guilabel:`Acciones` y selecciona :icon:`fa-"
"trash` :guilabel:`Eliminar`."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/structure/pages.rst:178
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`Delete Page` pop-up shows all links referring to the page you "
"want to delete, organized by category. To ensure website visitors do not "
"land on an error page, update all links on the website that refer to the "
"page. To do so, expand a category, then click on a link to open it in a new "
"window. Alternatively, you can set up a :ref:`redirection <website/pages/URL-"
"redirection>` for the deleted page."
msgstr ""
"La ventana emergente :guilabel:`Eliminar página` muestra todos los enlaces "
"que apuntan a la página que quieres eliminar, organizados por categoría. "
"Para evitar que los visitantes del sitio lleguen a una página de error, "
"actualiza todos los enlaces del sitio web que apuntan a esa página. Para "
"hacerlo, abre una categoría y haz clic en un enlace para abrirlo en una "
"nueva ventana. También puedes configurar una :ref:`redirección <website/"
"pages/URL-redirection>` para la página eliminada."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/structure/pages.rst:183
msgid ""
"Once you have updated the links (or set up a :ref:`redirect <website/pages/"
"URL-redirection>`), tick the :guilabel:`I am sure about this.` checkbox, "
"then click :guilabel:`Delete`."
msgstr ""
"Un vez que hayas actualizado los enlaces (o configurado "
"una :ref:`redirección <website/pages/URL-redirection>`), selecciona la "
"casilla :guilabel:`Estoy seguro.` y luego haz clic en :guilabel:`Eliminar`."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/structure/pages.rst:189
msgid "URL redirect mapping"
msgstr "Mapeo de redirección de URL"

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/structure/pages.rst:191
msgid ""
"URL redirect mapping involves sending visitors and search engines to a URL "
"other than the one they initially requested. This technique is used, for "
"example, to prevent broken links when :ref:`deleting a page <website/pages/"
"delete-page>`, :ref:`modifying its URL <website/pages/page_properties>`, or "
"migrating the site from another platform to an Odoo :doc:`domain <../"
"configuration/domain_names>`. It can also be used to improve :doc:`seo`."
msgstr ""
"El mapeo de redirecciones de URL consiste en enviar a los visitantes y a los "
"motores de búsqueda a una URL distinta de la que solicitaron al inicio. Esta "
"técnica se usa, por ejemplo, para evitar que hayan enlaces rotos "
"al :ref:`eliminar una página <website/pages/delete-page>`, :ref:`modificar "
"su URL <website/pages/page_properties>` o migrar el sitio desde otra "
"plataforma a un :doc:`dominio <../configuration/domain_names>` de Odoo. "
"También puedes usarla para mejorar el :doc:`seo`."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/structure/pages.rst:198
msgid ""
"A redirect record is added automatically every time you :ref:`modify a "
"page's URL <website/pages/page_properties>` and enable :guilabel:`Redirect "
"Old URL`."
msgstr ""
"Cada vez que :ref:`modificas la URL de una página <website/pages/"
"page_properties>` y habilitas la opción :guilabel:`Redirigir URL antigua` se "
"agrega un registro de redirección en automático."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/structure/pages.rst:200
msgid ""
"Redirections can be configured for :ref:`static and dynamic pages <website/"
"pages/page_type>`."
msgstr ""
"Puedes configurar redirecciones para :ref:`páginas estáticas y dinámicas "
"<website/pages/page_type>`."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/structure/pages.rst:202
msgid ""
"To access existing URL redirections and create new ones, go "
"to :menuselection:`Website --> Configuration --> Redirects`, "
"click :guilabel:`New` in the :guilabel:`Rewrite` view, then adapt the fields:"
msgstr ""
"Para acceder a las redirecciones de URL existentes y crear nuevas, ve a "
":menuselection:`Sitio web --> Configuración --> Redirecciones`, haz clic en "
":guilabel:`Nuevo` en la vista :guilabel:`Redirección` y luego adapta los "
"campos:"

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/structure/pages.rst:206
msgid ":guilabel:`Name`: Enter a name to identify the redirect."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Nombre`: escriba un nombre para identificar la redirección. "

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/structure/pages.rst:207
msgid ":guilabel:`Action`: Select the type of redirection:"
msgstr ":guilabel:`Acción`: seleccione el tipo de redirección: "

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/structure/pages.rst:209
msgid ""
":guilabel:`404 Not found`: Visitors land on a 404 error page when they try "
"to access an unpublished or deleted page."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`404 No encontrado`: Los visitantes llegan a una página de error "
"404 cuando intentan acceder a una página que no está publicada o que fue "
"eliminada."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/structure/pages.rst:211
msgid ""
":guilabel:`301 Moved permanently`: for permanent redirections of unpublished "
"or deleted :ref:`static pages <website/pages/page_type>`. The new URL is "
"shown in search engine results, and the redirect is cached by browsers."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`301 Movido permanentemente`: Para redirecciones permanentes "
"de :ref:`páginas estáticas <website/pages/page_type>` que no están "
"publicadas o que fueron eliminadas. La nueva URL aparece en los resultados "
"de los motores de búsqueda y los navegadores almacenan la redirección en "
"caché."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/structure/pages.rst:214
msgid ""
":guilabel:`302 Moved temporarily`: for short-term redirections, for example, "
"if you are redesigning or updating a page. The new URL is neither cached by "
"browsers nor shown in search engine results."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`302 Movido temporalmente`: Para redirecciones a corto plazo, por "
"ejemplo, si rediseñas o actualizas una página. Los navegadores ya no "
"almacenan la nueva URL en caché ni aparece en los resultados de los motores "
"de búsqueda."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/structure/pages.rst:217
msgid ""
":guilabel:`308 Redirect / Rewrite`: for permanent redirections where the "
"original URL is rewritten (typically used for :ref:`dynamic pages <website/"
"pages/page_type>`). The URL is renamed; the new name appears in search "
"engine results and is cached by browsers. Use this redirect type to rename a "
"dynamic page, for example, if you wish to rename `/shop` into `/market`."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`308 Redirigir / Reescribir`: Para redirecciones permanentes donde "
"la URL original se reescribe (suele usarse en :ref:`páginas dinámicas "
"<website/pages/page_type>`). La URL cambia de nombre, el nuevo nombre "
"aparece en los resultados de los motores de búsqueda y los navegadores lo "
"almacenan en caché. Usa este tipo de redirección para cambiar el nombre de "
"una página dinámica, por ejemplo, si quieres cambiar `/mi-tienda` a `/"
"tienda`."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/structure/pages.rst:223
msgid ""
":guilabel:`URL from`: Enter the URL to be redirected (e.g., `/about-the-"
"company`) or search for the desired :ref:`dynamic page <website/pages/"
"page_type>` and select it from the list."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`URL de`: Escribe la URL desde la que se redirigirá (por ejemplo, "
"`/sobre-la-empresa`) o busca la :ref:`página dinámica <website/pages/"
"page_type>` deseada y selecciónala en la lista."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/structure/pages.rst:225
msgid ""
":guilabel:`URL to`: For 301, 302, and 308 redirects, enter the URL to be "
"redirected to. If you want to redirect to an external URL, include the "
"protocol (e.g., `https://`)."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`URL a`: para los redireccionamientos 301, 302 y 308 escriba la "
"URL a la que desea redirigir. Si se trata de una URL externa, asegúrese de "
"incluir el protocolo (por ejemplo, `https://`)."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/structure/pages.rst:227
msgid ":guilabel:`Website`: Select a specific website."
msgstr ":guilabel:`Sitio web`: seleccione un sitio web específico. "

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/structure/pages.rst:228
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Active`: Toggle the switch off to deactivate the redirection."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Activo`: Cambia el botón a gris para desactivar la redirección."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/structure/pages.rst:231
msgid ""
"You can also define the order in which redirections are performed, e.g., in "
"the case of redirect chains (i.e., a series of redirects where one URL is "
"redirected to another one, which is itself further redirected to another "
"URL). To do so, :doc:`activate the developer mode </applications/general/"
"developer_mode>`, access the :guilabel:`Rewrite` form, and define "
"a :guilabel:`Sequence`."
msgstr ""
"También puedes definir el orden en el que se realizan las redirecciones, por "
"ejemplo, en el caso de cadenas de redirección (es decir, una serie de "
"redirecciones en las que una URL se redirige a otra, que a su vez se "
"redirige a otra URL). Para hacerlo, :doc:`activa el modo de desarrollador </"
"applications/general/developer_mode>`, accede al formulario "
":guilabel:`Redirección` y define una :guilabel:`Secuencia`."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/structure/pages.rst:238
msgid ""
"301 and 302 redirects are commonly used to redirect traffic "
"from :ref:`unpublished <website/pages/un-publish-page>` or :ref:`deleted "
"<website/pages/delete-page>` *static* pages to new pages. The 308 redirect "
"is typically used for permanent URL rewrites, especially for *dynamic* "
"pages. A 404 status is used when a page no longer exists, and no redirection "
"is configured."
msgstr ""
"Las redirecciones 301 y 302 se usan con frecuencia para redirigir el tráfico "
"desde páginas *estáticas* :ref:`que no están publicadas <website/pages/un-"
"publish-page>` o que fueron :ref:`eliminadas <website/pages/delete-page>` "
"hacia nuevas páginas. La redirección 308 se usa para reescrituras "
"permanentes de URL, sobre todo en páginas *dinámicas*. El estado 404 se usa "
"cuando una página ya no existe y no hay una redirección configurada."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/structure/pages.rst:245
msgid ""
"`Google documentation on redirects and search <https://developers.google.com/"
"search/docs/crawling-indexing/301-redirects>`_"
msgstr ""
"`Documentación de Google acerca de redirecciones y búsqueda <https://"
"developers.google.com/search/docs/crawling-indexing/301-redirects>`_"

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/structure/pages.rst:246
msgid ":doc:`seo`"
msgstr ":doc:`seo`"

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/structure/seo.rst:5
msgid ""
"Search Engine Optimization, often abbreviated as SEO, is a digital marketing "
"strategy to improve a website's visibility and ranking in search engine "
"results (e.g., in Google). It involves optimizing various elements on your "
"website, including its content, social sharing, URLs, images, and page speed."
msgstr ""
"La optimización para motores de búsqueda (con frecuencia abreviada como SEO) "
"es una estrategia de marketing digital para mejorar la visibilidad y el "
"posicionamiento de un sitio web en los resultados de un motor de búsqueda "
"(por ejemplo, Google). Consiste en optimizar varios elementos de su sitio "
"web como su contenido, la imagen que aparece cuando lo comparte en redes "
"sociales, URL, imágenes y velocidad de la página."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/structure/seo.rst:11
msgid ""
"Several modules are provided to help build the website's content, such "
"as :doc:`eCommerce <../../ecommerce>`, :doc:`Blog <../../"
"blog>`, :doc:`eLearning <../../elearning>`, and :doc:`Forum <../../forum>`."
msgstr ""
"Odoo cuenta con varios módulos para ayudarte a crear el contenido de tu "
"sitio web, como :doc:`Comercio electrónico <../../ecommerce>`, :doc:`Blog "
"<../../blog>`, :doc:`eLearning <../../elearning>` y :doc:`Foro <../../"
"forum>`."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/structure/seo.rst:14
msgid ""
"All provided :doc:`themes <../web_design/themes>` are built with the "
"`Bootstrap <https://getbootstrap.com/>`_ CSS framework to ensure responsive "
"layouts across desktop, tablet, or mobile, which can support SEO."
msgstr ""
"Todos los :doc:`temas <../web_design/themes>` se crearon usando `Bootstrap "
"<https://getbootstrap.com/>`_, un marco de trabajo para CSS, para asegurar "
"que los diseños fueran compatibles con computadoras, tabletas, o celulares, "
"que son compatibles con SEO."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/structure/seo.rst:19
msgid ""
"`Magic Sheet - Optimize your website [PDF] <https://drive.google.com/drive/"
"folders/1Ywip4tWF2DPkcBaEbeXJxIZg2CjkwKgb>`_"
msgstr ""
"`Guía - Optimiza tu sitio web [PDF] <https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/"
"1Ywip4tWF2DPkcBaEbeXJxIZg2CjkwKgb>`_"

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/structure/seo.rst:23
msgid "Content optimization"
msgstr "Optimización de contenido"

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/structure/seo.rst:25
msgid ""
"To optimize a webpage's SEO, access the page, then go "
"to :menuselection:`Website --> Site --> Optimize SEO`."
msgstr ""
"Para optimizar el SEO de una página web, primero acceda a ella y luego vaya "
"a :menuselection:`Sitio web --> Sitio --> Optimizar SEO`."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/structure/seo.rst:None
msgid "Search Engine Optimization"
msgstr "Optimización de motores de búsqueda"

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/structure/seo.rst:32
msgid ""
"Changing the title of a blog post or the name of a product automatically "
"updates the link to the related webpage. The old link still functions as "
"a :ref:`301 redirect <website/pages/URL-redirection>` is created, "
"maintaining the SEO."
msgstr ""
"Cambiar el título de una publicación de blog o el nombre de un producto "
"actualiza el enlace a la página web relacionada en automático. El enlace "
"anterior sigue funcionando como una :ref:`redirección 301 <website/pages/URL-"
"redirection>`, para mantener el SEO."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/structure/seo.rst:37
msgid ""
"Click :guilabel:`Fill with AI` to automatically generate a meta title, a "
"description, and get keyword suggestions."
msgstr ""
"Haz clic e :guilabel:`Llenar con IA` para generar un título meta, una "
"descripción y obtener sugerencias de palabras clave en automático."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/structure/seo.rst:39
msgid ""
"Remove incorrect URLs from the :guilabel:`Broken Link` field and select "
"valid ones to prevent errors."
msgstr ""
"Eliminar URL incorrectas del campo :guilabel:`Enlaces rotos` y seleccionar "
"URL válidas evitará errores."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/structure/seo.rst:43
msgid "Keywords and meta tags"
msgstr "Palabras clave y etiquetas meta"

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/structure/seo.rst:45
msgid "There are two types of keywords in SEO, which serve different purposes."
msgstr ""
"Solo hay dos tipos de palabras clave en SEO y ambos tienen diferentes "
"propósitos."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/structure/seo.rst:48
msgid "In-text keywords"
msgstr "Palabras clave en el texto"

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/structure/seo.rst:50
msgid ""
"In-text keywords appear naturally throughout a page’s visible content "
"(titles, headings, and body text) and help search engines determine the "
"topic and relevance of the page. These keywords have a real impact on "
"ranking. They cannot be edited in the :guilabel:`optimize SEO` pop-up."
msgstr ""
"Las palabras clave en el texto aparecen de forma natural en el contenido "
"visible de la página (títulos, encabezados y cuerpo del texto) y ayudan a "
"que los motores de búsqueda determinen el tema y relevancia de la página. "
"Estas palabras clave tienen un impacto real en la clasificación de la "
"página. No se pueden editar en la ventana emergente :guilabel:`optimizar "
"SEO`."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/structure/seo.rst:55
msgid "It is strongly recommended to only use one H1 title per page for SEO."
msgstr ""
"Por cuestiones de SEO, le recomendamos encarecidamente que solo use un "
"título H1 por página."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/structure/seo.rst:60
msgid "Meta tags and meta keywords"
msgstr "Etiquetas y palabras clave meta"

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/structure/seo.rst:62
msgid ""
"**Meta tags** are HTML elements that provide information about a webpage to "
"search engines and website visitors. They play a crucial role in SEO by "
"helping search engines understand the content and context of a webpage and "
"attract visitors with appealing content. They can be edited in "
"the :guilabel:`optimize SEO` pop-up. There are two types of meta tags:"
msgstr ""
"**Las etiquetas meta** son elementos de HTML que brindan información sobre "
"la página web a motores de búsqueda y visitantes del sitio web. Juegan un "
"papel crucial en el SEO ya que le ayudan a los motores de búsqueda a "
"entender el contenido y el contexto de una página web y atraer visitantes "
"con contenido valioso. Pueden editarse en la ventana "
"emergente :guilabel:`optimizar SEO`. Hay dos tipos de etiquetas meta:"

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/structure/seo.rst:67
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Title` tags specify a webpage's title and are displayed as a "
"clickable link in search engine results. They should be concise, "
"descriptive, and relevant to the page's content. You can update the title "
"tag of your webpage or keep it empty to use the default value based on the "
"page’s content."
msgstr ""
"Las etiquetas de :guilabel:`título` específico el título de una página web y "
"en los motores de búsqueda aparecen como un enlace en el que se puede hacer "
"clic. Deben ser concisas, descriptivas y relevantes para el contenido de la "
"página. Es posible actualizar la etiqueta de título de su página web o "
"dejarla vacía para usar el valor predeterminado según el contenido de la "
"página."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/structure/seo.rst:72
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Description` tags summarize the webpage's content, often "
"displayed in search engine results below the title. They are used to "
"encourage the user to visit the page. Update the description tag of the "
"webpage, or keep it empty to use the default description based on the page's "
"content."
msgstr ""
"Las etiquetas de :guilabel:`descripción` hacen un resumen del contenido de "
"la página web que usualmente se muestran en los resultados del motor de "
"búsqueda, abajo del título. Se usan para captar la atención del cliente para "
"que visite la página. Actualiza la etiqueta de descripción de la página web, "
"o déjala en blanco para usar la descripción predeterminada según el "
"contenido de la página."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/structure/seo.rst:78
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`Preview` card displays how the title and description tags "
"should appear in search results. It also includes the URL of your page."
msgstr ""
"La tarjeta :guilabel:`Vista previa` muestra cómo se visualizarían las "
"etiquetas de título y descripción en los resultados de búsqueda. Además, "
"incluye la URL de su página."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/structure/seo.rst:81
msgid ""
"**Meta keywords** are placed in a hidden HTML tag `<meta "
"name=\"keywords\">`. Once used to describe a page’s topic, this tag is now "
"ignored by major search engines and has little or no impact on SEO. To "
"edit :guilabel:`Keywords`, enter the keywords you consider essential in this "
"field and click :guilabel:`Add` to see how they are used at different levels "
"in your content (H1, H2, page title, page description, page content) and the "
"related searches in Google. The tool also suggests relevant keywords."
msgstr ""
"**Las palabras clave meta** se insertan en una etiqueta HTML oculta `<meta "
"name=\"palabras clave\">`. Antes se usaban para describir el tema de una "
"página, pero ahora los motores de búsqueda más grandes las ignoran y tienen "
"poco o nada de impacto en el SEO. Para editar las :guilabel:`palabras "
"clave`, ingresa aquellas que consideres esenciales en este campo y haz clic "
"en :guilabel:`Agregar` para ver cómo se usan en diferentes niveles en tu "
"contenido (H1, H2, título de la página, descripción de la página, contenido "
"de la página) y las búsquedas relacionadas en Google. La herramienta también "
"sugiere palabras clave relevantes."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/structure/seo.rst:91
#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/web_design/elements.rst:64
msgid "Images"
msgstr "Imágenes"

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/structure/seo.rst:93
msgid ""
"The size of images has a significant impact on page speed, which is an "
"essential criterion for search engines to optimize SEO ranking."
msgstr ""
"El tamaño de las imágenes afecta de forma importante la velocidad de la "
"página. Es un criterio indispensable para los motores de búsqueda para "
"optimizar el posicionamiento SEO."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/structure/seo.rst:97
msgid ""
"Compare how your website ranks using `Google Page Speed <https://"
"pagespeed.web.dev/?utm_source=psi&utm_medium=redirect>`_ or `Pingdom Website "
"Speed Test <https://tools.pingdom.com/>`_."
msgstr ""
"Compare el posicionamiento de su sitio web en `Google Page Speed <https://"
"pagespeed.web.dev/?utm_source=psi&utm_medium=redirect>`_ o en `Pingdom "
"Website Speed Test <https://tools.pingdom.com/>`_."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/structure/seo.rst:100
msgid ""
"Odoo automatically compresses uploaded images and converts them to `Webp`. "
"With this file format, photos are smaller, which increases the page loading "
"speed and, therefore, gives a better ranking in SEO. All images used in Odoo "
"official :doc:`themes <../web_design/themes>` are also compressed by default."
msgstr ""
"En automático, Odoo comprime las imágenes que subes y las convierte a "
"`Webp`. En este formato las imágenes son más pequeñas, lo cual aumenta la "
"velocidad de carga de la página y resulta en una mejor calificación SEO. "
"Todas las imágenes que se usan en los :doc:`temas <../web_design/themes>` "
"oficiales de Odoo también se comprimen de forma automática."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/structure/seo.rst:106
msgid "Third-party themes may not compress images efficiently."
msgstr ""
"Es posible que los temas de terceros no compriman las imágenes de forma "
"eficiente."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/structure/seo.rst:109
msgid ""
"**To modify an image** from a webpage, select the image, "
"click :guilabel:`Edit`, then go to the :guilabel:`Customize` tab, and adapt "
"the :guilabel:`Format` in the :guilabel:`Image` section."
msgstr ""
"**Para modificar una imagen** de tu página web, selecciónala, haz clic "
"en :guilabel:`Editar`, luego ve a la pestaña :guilabel:`Personalizar` y "
"ajusta el :guilabel:`formato` en la sección :guilabel:`Imagen`."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/structure/seo.rst:113
msgid ""
"Alt tags are used to provide context to what an image is displaying, "
"informing search engine crawlers and allowing them to index an image "
"correctly. Adding alt tags keywords in the :guilabel:`Description` field is "
"essential from an SEO perspective. This description is added to the HTML "
"code of your image, and it is shown when the image cannot be displayed."
msgstr ""
"Las etiquetas \"alt\" se utilizan para proporcionar contexto sobre lo que "
"aparece en una imagen, se lo informan a los rastreadores de motores de "
"búsqueda para que puedan indexar una imagen de manera adecuada. Desde la "
"perspectiva de SEO, agregar palabras clave a las etiquetas alt en el "
"campo :guilabel:`Descripción` es indispensable. Esta descripción se agrega "
"al código HTML de su imagen y aparece cuando no es posible visualizar la "
"imagen."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/structure/seo.rst:119
msgid "Image for social share"
msgstr "Imágenes para compartir en redes sociales"

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/structure/seo.rst:121
msgid ""
"When you share a page on social media, the website logo is selected by "
"default. Search the :doc:`Unsplash image library <../../../general/"
"integrations/unsplash>` or upload any other image by clicking the :icon:`fa-"
"upload` :guilabel:`(upload)` button."
msgstr ""
"Cuando compartes una página en redes sociales, el logo del sitio web se "
"selecciona en automático, pero puedes buscar en la :doc:`biblioteca de "
"imágenes Unsplash <../../../general/integrations/unsplash>` o subir "
"cualquier otra imagen haciendo clic en el botón :icon:`fa-"
"upload` :guilabel:`(subir)`."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/structure/seo.rst:126
msgid ""
"To set a default social share image, go to :menuselection:`Website --> "
"Configuration --> Settings`. Under the :guilabel:`Tracking & SEO` section, "
"enable :guilabel:`Default Social Share Image`."
msgstr ""
"Para definir una imagen predeterminada para compartir en redes sociales ve "
"a :menuselection:`Sitio web --> Configuración --> Ajustes` y selecciona la "
"casilla :guilabel:`Imagen predeterminada al compartir en redes sociales` en "
"la sección :guilabel:`Rastreo y SEO`."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/structure/seo.rst:131
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`Social Preview` card displays how the page's information "
"would appear when shared."
msgstr ""
"La tarjeta :guilabel:`Vista previa social` muestra cómo aparecería la "
"información al compartirla."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/structure/seo.rst:135
msgid "Indexation"
msgstr "Indexación"

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/structure/seo.rst:137
msgid ""
"Website indexation is the process by which search engines, such as Google, "
"discover, analyze, and store information about a website's content in their "
"database. Search engine bots, known as crawlers or spiders, visit web pages "
"and follow links to collect data, including text, images, and other media. "
"The purpose of indexation is to make a website's content searchable and "
"discoverable to users. Without being indexed, a website or a specific page "
"on that site will not appear in search engine results, regardless of how "
"relevant or well-designed it is. Indexation is a fundamental step "
"in :abbr:`SEO (Search Engine Optimization)`, serving as the foundation for a "
"website's visibility and organic traffic."
msgstr ""
"La indexación del sitio web es el proceso con el que los motores de búsqueda "
"como Google descubren, analizan y almacenan información sobre el contenido "
"de un sitio web en su base de datos. Los bots de los motores de búsqueda, "
"también conocidos como crawlers o spiders, visitan páginas de sitio web y "
"entran a los enlaces para recolectar datos, incluyendo texto, imágenes y "
"otros medios audiovisuales. El propósito de la indexación es que los "
"usuarios puedan buscar y descubrir el contenido del sitio web. Si no se "
"indexa, un sitio web o una página específica en ese sitio web no aparecerá "
"en los resultados del motor de búsqueda, sin importar qué tan relevante o "
"bien diseñado esté. La indexación es un paso fundamental en para :abbr:`SEO "
"(optimización para motores de búsqueda)`, ya que es el fundamento para la "
"visibilidad del sitio web y el tráfico orgánico."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/structure/seo.rst:147
msgid ""
"**When you first create your website on Odoo, it will not appear directly in "
"search engine results.** Search engines need time to crawl and index it, "
"which can take anywhere from a few days to several weeks. For Google, you "
"can use the :doc:`Search Console <../configuration/google_search_console>` "
"and request indexing for specific URLs, though this does not guarantee "
"faster results. If you have an existing website and are migrating, your "
"previous website may still appear instead of the new one during that "
"timeframe."
msgstr ""
"**La primera vez que creas tu sitio web en Odoo, no aparecerá directamente "
"en los resultados del motor de búsqueda.** Los motores de búsqueda necesitan "
"tiempo para rastrearlo e indexarlo, lo cual puede tardar desde unos días "
"hasta varias semanas. Para Google, puedes usar la :doc:`consola de búsqueda "
"<../configuration/google_search_console>` y solicitar indexar una URL "
"específica, aunque no garantizar obtener resultados más rápidos. Si ya "
"tienes un sitio web existente y estás migrando, tu sitio web anterior "
"todavía aparecerá en lugar del nuevo durante este periodo."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/structure/seo.rst:155
msgid "SEO impact when migrating your existing website to Odoo"
msgstr "El impacto del SEO al migrar tu sitio web existe a Odoo"

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/structure/seo.rst:157
msgid ""
"In most cases, migrating to Odoo will not negatively impact the website's "
"SEO. While no platform can guarantee that rankings will remain unchanged, "
"follow these best practices to significantly reduce the risk."
msgstr ""
"En la mayoría de los casos, migrar a Odoo no impactará el SEO del sitio web "
"de forma negativa. Aunque ninguna plataforma puede garantizar que las "
"clasificaciones no cambiarán, sigue estas mejores prácticas para reducir el "
"riesgo lo más posible."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/structure/seo.rst:161
msgid "Keep the existing content."
msgstr "Mantener el contenido existente."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/structure/seo.rst:162
msgid ""
"Implement :ref:`redirects <website/pages/URL-redirection>` from old URLs to "
"their new counterparts."
msgstr ""
"Implementa :ref:`redirecciones <website/pages/URL-redirection>` de URL "
"viejas a sus nuevas contrapartes."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/structure/seo.rst:164
msgid ""
"Monitor traffic and indexation to make sure that everything is going well, "
"using :doc:`../configuration/google_search_console`."
msgstr ""
"Monitorea el tráfico y la indexación para asegurar que todo funcione bien, "
"usa la :doc:`../configuration/google_search_console`."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/structure/seo.rst:167
msgid ""
"By doing this, search engines reindex the site and maintain its visibility "
"in search results."
msgstr ""
"Al hacer esto, los motores de búsqueda vuelve a indexar el sitio y mantienen "
"su visibilidad en los resultados de búsqueda."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/structure/seo.rst:170
msgid "It is normal to experience a traffic decrease in the first days."
msgstr ""
"Es normal experimentar una disminución en el tráfico los primeros días."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/structure/seo.rst:173
msgid "Prevent a page from being indexed"
msgstr "Evitar la indexación de páginas"

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/structure/seo.rst:175
msgid ""
"To effectively prevent a page from appearing in search engine results, use "
"one of the following methods:"
msgstr ""
"Usa uno de los siguientes métodos para evitar que una página aparezca en los "
"resultados de los motores de búsqueda:"

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/structure/seo.rst:178
msgid ""
"**noindex tag:** Access the page's :ref:`properties <website/pages/"
"page_properties>` and toggle the :guilabel:`Indexed` switch off."
msgstr ""
"**Etiqueta noindex:** Accede a las :ref:`propiedades <website/pages/"
"page_properties>` de la página y desactiva el botón :guilabel:`Indexado`."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/structure/seo.rst:182
msgid ""
"This option is not yet available for :ref:`dynamic pages <website/pages/"
"page_type>`."
msgstr ""
"Esta opción aún no está disponible para las :ref:`páginas dinámicas <website/"
"pages/page_type>`."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/structure/seo.rst:184
msgid ""
"**404 or 403:** Configure the page to return a 404 (Not Found) or 403 "
"(Forbidden) HTTP status code. These codes signal to search engines that the "
"page does not exist or is inaccessible, leading to its eventual removal from "
"the index."
msgstr ""
"**404 o 403:** Configura la página para que devuelva un código HTTP 404 (No "
"encontrado) o 403 (Prohibido). Estos códigos le indican a los motores de "
"búsqueda que la página no existe o que no es posible acceder a ella, lo que "
"ocasiona su eventual eliminación del índice."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/structure/seo.rst:188
msgid ""
"**404:** :ref:`Configure a 404 redirection. <website/pages/URL-redirection>`"
msgstr ""
"**404:** :ref:`Configura una redirección 404. <website/pages/URL-"
"redirection>`"

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/structure/seo.rst:189
msgid ""
"**403:** Access the page's :ref:`properties <website/pages/page_properties>` "
"and toggle the :guilabel:`Visibility` switch off or :ref:`unpublish the page "
"<website/pages/un-publish-page>`."
msgstr ""
"**403:** Accede a las :ref:`propiedades <website/pages/page_properties>` de "
"la página y desactiva el botón :guilabel:`Visibilidad` o :ref:`cancela la "
"publicación de la página <website/pages/un-publish-page>`."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/structure/seo.rst:193
msgid ""
"**Google Search Console:** Use Google Search Console to request the removal "
"of specific URLs from Google's index."
msgstr ""
"**Search Console de Google:** Usa Search Console de Google para solicitar la "
"eliminación de URLs específicas del índice de Google."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/structure/seo.rst:197
msgid ":doc:`../configuration/google_search_console`"
msgstr ":doc:`../configuration/google_search_console`"

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/structure/seo.rst:198
msgid ":doc:`pages`"
msgstr ":doc:`pages`"

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/structure/seo.rst:201
msgid "Prevent a website from being indexed"
msgstr "Evitar que el sitio web se indexe"

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/structure/seo.rst:203
msgid ""
"To prevent a website from appearing in search engine results, go "
"to :menuselection:`Configuration --> Settings`, then in "
"the :guilabel:`Website Info` section, add a random value in "
"the :guilabel:`Domain` field. Doing so automatically inserts the following "
"tag into the page source:"
msgstr ""
"Para evitar que el sitio web aparezca en los resultados de búsqueda, ve "
"a :menuselection:`Configuración --> Ajustes`, luego, en la "
"sección :guilabel:`Información del sitio web` agrega un valor al azar en el "
"campo :guilabel:`Dominio`. Al hacerlo, se insertará la etiqueta de forma "
"automática en el código de la página:"

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/structure/seo.rst:212
msgid ""
"This tag instructs search engines not to index the site. After applying the "
"change, it may take several days or weeks for search engines to update their "
"results and remove the website."
msgstr ""
"Esta etiqueta le indica a los motores de búsqueda que no deben indexar el "
"sitio. Es posible que, después de aplicar el cambio, los motores de búsqueda "
"tarden unos días en actualizar sus resultados y quitar el sitio web."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/structure/seo.rst:216
msgid ""
"This can be used to prevent websites from test databases from appearing in "
"search results."
msgstr ""
"De esta forma se puede evitar que los sitios web de bases de datos de prueba "
"aparezcan en los resultados de búsqueda."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/structure/seo.rst:219
msgid "Sitemap"
msgstr "Mapa de sitio"

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/structure/seo.rst:221
msgid ""
"The sitemap points out website pages and their relation to each other to "
"search engine crawlers. Odoo generates a `/sitemap.xml` file, including all "
"URLs. For performance reasons, this file is cached and updated every 12 "
"hours."
msgstr ""
"El sitemap (mapa del sitio) organiza las páginas de un sitio web e indica "
"cómo se relacionan entre ellas para los crawlers de motores de búsqueda. "
"Odoo genera un archivo `/sitemap.xml` que incluye todas las URL; por motivos "
"de rendimiento, este archivo se guarda en caché y se actualiza cada 12 horas."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/structure/seo.rst:226
msgid ""
"If your website has a lot of pages, Odoo automatically creates a Sitemap "
"Index file, respecting the `sitemaps.org protocol <http://www.sitemaps.org/"
"protocol.html>`_, grouping sitemap URLs in 45000 chunks per file."
msgstr ""
"Odoo creará un archivo de índice de mapa del sitio si su sitio web tiene "
"muchas páginas, respetará `el protocolo de sitemaps.org <http://"
"www.sitemaps.org/protocol.html>`_ y agrupará las URL del mapa del sitio en "
"fragmentos de 45,000 por archivo."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/structure/seo.rst:230
msgid ""
"Every sitemap entry has three attributes that are computed automatically:"
msgstr ""
"Cada entrada del mapa del sitio web tiene tres atributos que se calculan de "
"forma automática:"

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/structure/seo.rst:232
msgid "`<loc>`: the URL of a page."
msgstr "`<loc>`: la URL de una página."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/structure/seo.rst:233
msgid ""
"`<lastmod>`: last modification date of the resource, computed automatically "
"based on the related object. For a page related to a product, this could be "
"the last modification date of the product or the page."
msgstr ""
"`<lastmod>`: última fecha de modificación del recurso, se calcula de forma "
"automática según el objeto relacionado. En el caso de una página relacionada "
"con un producto, podría ser la última fecha de modificación del producto o "
"de la página."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/structure/seo.rst:236
msgid ""
"`<priority>`: modules may implement their priority algorithm based on their "
"content (for example, a forum might assign a priority based on the number of "
"votes on a specific post). The priority of a static page is defined by its "
"priority field, which is normalized (16 is the default)."
msgstr ""
"`<priority>`: es posible que los módulos implementen su algoritmo por "
"prioridad según su contenido. Por ejemplo, la prioridad en un foro se puede "
"asignar según el número de votos en una publicación en específico. Por otro "
"lado, si se trata de una página web estática, esta se definirá por su campo "
"de prioridad, este se encuentra normalizado (16 es el número predeterminado)."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/structure/seo.rst:241
msgid ""
"To prevent pages from appearing in a sitemap, go to :menuselection:`Site --> "
"Properties`, and toggle off the :guilabel:`Indexed` feature."
msgstr ""
"Para evitar que algunas páginas aparezcan en el mapa del sitio, ve "
"a :menuselection:`Sitio --> Propiedades` y desactiva la "
"opción :guilabel:`Indexado`."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/structure/seo.rst:0
msgid "toggle off the “Indexed” field"
msgstr "Captura de pantalla de cómo se desactiva la opción \"Indexado\"."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/structure/seo.rst:248
msgid "robots.txt"
msgstr "robots.txt"

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/structure/seo.rst:250
msgid ""
"A `robots.txt` file instructs search engine crawlers which parts of a "
"website they are permitted to access. Its primary purpose is to:"
msgstr ""
"El archivo `robots.txt` le indica a los rastreadores de los motores de "
"búsqueda a qué partes de un sitio web pueden acceder. Su propósito principal "
"es:"

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/structure/seo.rst:253
msgid ""
"**Prevent overloading the website:** By guiding crawlers away from certain "
"sections, robots.txt helps manage server load."
msgstr ""
"**Evitar sobrecargar el sitio web:** robots.txt ayuda a gestionar la carga "
"del servidor, ya que guía a los rastreadores fuera de ciertas secciones."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/structure/seo.rst:255
msgid ""
"**Control access to resources and detailed descriptions:** It can prevent "
"crawlers from accessing media files (images, videos), CSS stylesheets, and "
"JavaScript files, and from reading the content (text) of specific pages."
msgstr ""
"**Controlar el acceso a recursos y descripciones detalladas:** Puede impedir "
"que los rastreadores accedan a archivos multimedia (imágenes, videos), hojas "
"de estilo CSS y archivos JavaScript, o que lean el contenido (texto) de "
"ciertas páginas."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/structure/seo.rst:259
msgid ""
"When indexing your website, search engines first look at the robots.txt "
"file. Odoo automatically creates one robot.txt file available on "
"`mydatabase.odoo.com/robots.txt`."
msgstr ""
"Lo primero que hacen los motores de búsqueda al indexar tu sitio web es "
"revisar el archivo robots.txt. Odoo crea un archivo robots.txt de forma "
"automática y puedes consultarlo en `mibasededatos.odoo.com/robots.txt`."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/structure/seo.rst:263
msgid ""
"Reputable bots adhere to robots.txt; others may require blocking "
"via :ref:`Cloudflare <domain-name/existing/naked/cloudflare>` on your custom "
"domain."
msgstr ""
"Los bots confiables respetan el archivo robots.txt, pero es posible que para "
"bloquear otros debas configurar :ref:`Cloudflare <domain-name/existing/naked/"
"cloudflare>` en tu dominio personalizado."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/structure/seo.rst:267
msgid "Edit robots.txt"
msgstr "Editar robots.txt"

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/structure/seo.rst:269
msgid ""
"By editing a robots.txt file, you can control which site pages are "
"accessible to search engine crawlers. To add custom instructions to the "
"file, go to :menuselection:`Website --> Configuration --> Settings`, scroll "
"down to the :guilabel:`SEO` section, and click :guilabel:`Edit robots.txt`."
msgstr ""
"Editar el archivo robots.txt te ayudará a controlar a qué páginas del sitio "
"pueden acceder los rastreadores de motores de búsqueda. Para agregar "
"instrucciones personalizadas al archivo, ve a :menuselection:`Sitio web --> "
"Configuración --> Ajustes`, busca la sección :guilabel:`SEO` y haz clic "
"en :guilabel:`Editar robots.txt`."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/structure/seo.rst:274
msgid ""
"If you do not want robots to crawl the `/about-us` page of your site, you "
"can edit the robots.txt file to add `Disallow: /about-us`."
msgstr ""
"Si no quieres que los robots rastreen la página `/sobre-nosotros` de tu "
"sitio, puedes editar el archivo robots.txt para agregar `Disallow: /sobre-"
"nosotros`."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/structure/seo.rst:278
msgid ""
"While `robots.txt` prevents content from being crawled, **it does not "
"guarantee that a page will not be indexed**. A page can still appear in "
"search results if it is linked to from other crawled pages (indexed by "
"\"reference\"). Google generally does not recommend using robots.txt to "
"block webpages that you wish to keep out of search results entirely."
msgstr ""
"Aunque `robots.txt` evita que los motores de búsqueda rastreen el contenido, "
"**no garantiza que una página no se indexe**. Una página aún puede aparecer "
"en los resultados de búsqueda si está enlazada desde otras páginas "
"rastreadas (indexada por \"referencia\"). Por lo general, Google no "
"recomienda usar robots.txt para bloquear páginas que desees mantener "
"completamente fuera de los resultados de búsqueda."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/structure/seo.rst:284
msgid "Advanced features"
msgstr "Funciones avanzadas"

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/structure/seo.rst:287
msgid "Structured data markup"
msgstr "Marcado de datos estructurados"

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/structure/seo.rst:289
msgid ""
"Structured data markup is used to generate rich snippets in search engine "
"results. It is a way for websites to send structured data to search engine "
"crawlers, helping them understand your content and create well-presented "
"search results."
msgstr ""
"El marcado de datos estructurados se usa para generar buenos snippets para "
"los resultados del motor de búsqueda. Esta es una de las maneras en las que "
"los motores de búsqueda envían datos estructurados a los crawlers de los "
"motores de búsqueda, lo cual les ayuda a entender el contenido y crear "
"resultados de búsqueda con una buena presentación."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/structure/seo.rst:293
msgid ""
"By default, Google supports many `rich snippets <https://"
"developers.google.com/search/blog/2009/05/introducing-rich-snippets>`_ for "
"content types, including Reviews, People, Products, Businesses, Events, and "
"Organizations."
msgstr ""
"De forma predeterminada, Google es compatible con varios `fragmentos "
"enriquecidos <https://developers.google.com/search/blog/2009/05/introducing-"
"rich-snippets>`_ para tipos de contenido como comentarios, personas, "
"productos, negocios, eventos y organizaciones."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/structure/seo.rst:296
msgid ""
"Microdata is a set of tags, introduced with HTML5, that help search engines "
"better understand your content and display it in a relevant way. Odoo "
"implements microdata as defined in the schema.org `specification <https://"
"schema.org/docs/gs.html>`_ for events, eCommerce products, forum posts, and "
"contact addresses. This allows your product pages to be displayed in Google "
"using extra information like the price and rating of a product:"
msgstr ""
"Los microdatos son un conjunto de etiquetas, implementados desde HTML5, que "
"ayudan a que los motores de búsqueda comprendan mejor su contenido y lo "
"muestren de forma adecuada. Odoo implementa microdatos según lo definido en "
"la `especificación <https://schema.org/docs/gs.html>`_ de schema.org para "
"eventos, productos de comercio electrónico, publicaciones de foros y "
"direcciones de contacto. Esto permite que las páginas de sus productos "
"aparezcan en Google con información adicional como su precio y su "
"calificación:"

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/structure/seo.rst:None
msgid "snippets in search engine results"
msgstr ""
"Captura de pantalla de los snippets en los resultados del motor de búsqueda."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/structure/seo.rst:306
msgid "Hreflang HTML tags"
msgstr "Atributos hreflang de HTML"

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/structure/seo.rst:308
msgid ""
"Odoo automatically includes `hreflang` and `x-default` tags in the code of "
"your website's multilingual pages. These HTML attributes are crucial in "
"informing search engines about a specific page's language and geographical "
"targeting."
msgstr ""
"De forma automática, Odoo incluye los atributos `hreflang` y `x-default` en "
"el código de las páginas con varios idiomas de su sitio web. Estos atributos "
"HTML son indispensables para que los motores de búsqueda cuenten con la "
"información relacionada al idioma y la segmentación geográfica de una página "
"en específico."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/structure/seo.rst:313
msgid ":doc:`../configuration/translate`"
msgstr ":doc:`../configuration/translate`"

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/web_design.rst:9
msgid ""
"Design your website using :doc:`building blocks <../website/web_design/"
"building_blocks>`, customize its :doc:`theme <../website/web_design/themes>` "
"with various options, structure and present content with :doc:`elements <../"
"website/web_design/elements>`, and display or hide building blocks "
"using :doc:`visibility settings <../website/web_design/visibility>`."
msgstr ""
"Diseña tu sitio web con :doc:`bloques de creación <../website/web_design/"
"building_blocks>`, personaliza su :doc:`tema <../website/web_design/themes>` "
"con varias opciones, estructura y muestra contenido con :doc:`elementos <../"
"website/web_design/elements>`, y muestra u oculta bloques de creación con "
"los :doc:`ajustes de visibilidad <../website/web_design/visibility>`."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/web_design.rst:16
msgid ""
"Design your website by dragging and dropping building blocks, then editing "
"them to fit your content and layout needs."
msgstr ""
"Arrastra y suelta bloques de creación para diseñar tu sitio web, luego "
"edítalos para adaptarlos a tu contenido y diseño."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/web_design.rst:23
#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/web_design/themes.rst:3
msgid "General theme"
msgstr "Tema general"

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/web_design.rst:23
msgid ""
"Customize your website’s theme by adjusting its colors, fonts, and layout."
msgstr ""
"Ajusta los colores, las fuentes y el diseño para personalizar el tema de tu "
"sitio web."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/web_design.rst:29
#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/web_design/elements.rst:3
msgid "Elements"
msgstr "Elementos"

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/web_design.rst:29
msgid ""
"Structure and present content effectively with elements such as titles, "
"lists, etc."
msgstr ""
"Estructura y muestra el contenido de forma clara con elementos como títulos "
"y listas."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/web_design.rst:35
#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/web_design/visibility.rst:3
msgid "Visibility"
msgstr "Visibilidad"

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/web_design.rst:35
msgid "Display or hide building blocks based on several criteria."
msgstr "Muestra u oculta bloques de creación según varios criterios."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/web_design/building_blocks.rst:7
msgid ""
"Design website pages by :ref:`dragging and dropping building blocks <website/"
"building_blocks/add>`, then :ref:`arrange <website/building_blocks/"
"move_duplicate_delete>` and :ref:`edit <website/building_blocks/edit>` them "
"to fit your content and layout needs. It is also possible to "
"create :ref:`custom building blocks <website/building_blocks/custom>` "
"or :ref:`anchor links <website/building_blocks/anchor>`."
msgstr ""
"Diseña páginas del sitio web al :ref:`arrastrar y soltar bloques de creación "
"<website/building_blocks/add>`, luego :ref:`organízalos <website/"
"building_blocks/move_duplicate_delete>` y :ref:`edítalos <website/"
"building_blocks/edit>` para adaptarlos a tus necesidades de contenido y "
"diseño. También es posible crear :ref:`bloques de creación personalizados "
"<website/building_blocks/custom>` o :ref:`enlaces de anclaje <website/"
"building_blocks/anchor>`."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/web_design/building_blocks.rst:13
msgid ""
"Building blocks can be added and customized using the website editor. To "
"open it, go to the relevant page and click :guilabel:`Edit` in the upper-"
"right corner."
msgstr ""
"Los bloques de creación se pueden agregar y personalizar con el editor del "
"sitio web. Para abrirlo, ve a la página correspondiente y haz clic en "
":guilabel:`Editar` en la esquina superior derecha."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/web_design/building_blocks.rst:17
msgid ""
"`Odoo Tutorial: Design your website: text and colors <https://www.odoo.com/"
"slides/slide/design-your-website-text-and-colors-6930?fullscreen=1>`_"
msgstr ""
"`Tutoriales de Odoo: Diseña tu sitio web: texto y colores <https://"
"www.odoo.com/slides/slide/design-your-website-text-and-colors-6930?"
"fullscreen=1>`_"

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/web_design/building_blocks.rst:22
msgid "Add a building block"
msgstr "Agregar un bloque de creación"

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/web_design/building_blocks.rst:24
msgid ""
"To add a building block to a :doc:`website page <../structure/pages>`, "
"access the page, then drag and drop the desired building block from "
"the :icon:`fa-plus` :guilabel:`Blocks` tab to the appropriate location."
msgstr ""
"Para agregar un bloque de creación a una :doc:`página del sitio web <../"
"structure/pages>`, accede a la página, luego arrastra y suelta el bloque "
"deseado desde la pestaña :icon:`fa-plus` :guilabel:`Bloques` a la ubicación "
"adecuada."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/web_design/building_blocks.rst:28
msgid "Two types of building blocks are available:"
msgstr "Hay dos tipos de bloques de creación disponibles:"

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/web_design/building_blocks.rst:30
msgid ""
"Categorical building blocks provide templates for different content "
"categories."
msgstr ""
"Los bloques de creación categóricos ofrecen plantillas para diferentes "
"categorías de contenido."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/web_design/building_blocks.rst:31
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Inner Content` building blocks allow for adding elements, such "
"as :ref:`videos <website/elements/videos>`, :ref:`images <website/elements/"
"images>`, :ref:`buttons <website/elements/buttons>`, and more, to pre-"
"existing categorical blocks as well as :doc:`headers and footers <../"
"structure/header_footer>`."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Contenido interno` permite agregar elementos a bloques "
"categóricos preexistentes, así como a :ref:`videos <website/elements/videos>"
"`, :ref:`imágenes <website/elements/images>`, :ref:`botones <website/"
"elements/buttons>` y más, así como a :doc:`encabezados y pies de página <../"
"structure/header_footer>`."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/web_design/building_blocks.rst:36
msgid ""
"When adding a categorical block, a pop-up window appears, allowing you to "
"choose from multiple templates for different categories. Once the block is "
"placed, drag and drop :guilabel:`Inner Content` blocks into it."
msgstr ""
"Al agregar un bloque categórico, aparece una ventana emergente que te "
"permite elegir entre varias plantillas para diferentes categorías. Una vez "
"colocado el bloque, arrastra y suelta bloques de :guilabel:`Contenido "
"interno` dentro de él."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/web_design/building_blocks.rst:41
msgid ""
"Use the search bar in the :guilabel:`Insert a block` pop-up window to "
"quickly find a specific block."
msgstr ""
"Usa la barra de búsqueda en la ventana emergente :guilabel:`Insertar un "
"bloque` para encontrar rápidamente un bloque específico."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/web_design/building_blocks.rst:0
msgid "Pop-up block selection"
msgstr "Captura de pantalla de la ventana emergente de bloques"

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/web_design/building_blocks.rst:48
msgid ""
"Building blocks can also be added to the login page. To access it, navigate "
"to the website's homepage, add `/web/login` to the URL, and press `Enter`."
msgstr ""
"También se pueden agregar bloques de creación a la página de inicio de "
"sesión. Para acceder a ella, ve a la página de inicio del sitio web, agrega "
"`/web/login` a la URL y presiona `Enter`."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/web_design/building_blocks.rst:52
msgid ""
"Some building blocks require their corresponding application or module to be "
"installed (e.g., the **Appointments** app for the :guilabel:`Appointments` "
"block)."
msgstr ""
"Algunos bloques de creación requieren que se instale su aplicación o módulo "
"correspondiente (por ejemplo, la aplicación **Citas** para el bloque "
":guilabel:`Citas`)."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/web_design/building_blocks.rst:56
msgid ""
"Use the :guilabel:`Social Media` :guilabel:`Inner Content` building block to "
"display links to your social media accounts. Click :guilabel:`Add New Social "
"Network` to add a platform, and :icon:`fa-minus` (:guilabel:`Remove link`) "
"to remove it. You can also edit the account URLs."
msgstr ""
"Usa el bloque de creación de :guilabel:`Redes sociales` de "
":guilabel:`Contenido interno` para mostrar enlaces a tus cuentas de redes "
"sociales. Haz clic en :guilabel:`Agregar nueva red social` para agregar una "
"plataforma y en :icon:`fa-minus` (:guilabel:`Eliminar enlace`) para "
"eliminarla. También puedes editar las URL de las cuentas."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/web_design/building_blocks.rst:0
msgid "Social Media inner content block"
msgstr ""
"Captura de pantalla del bloque de contenido interno para redes sociales"

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/web_design/building_blocks.rst:67
msgid "Embed code"
msgstr "Incrustar código"

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/web_design/building_blocks.rst:69
msgid ""
"Embedding code allows you to integrate content from third-party services, "
"such as YouTube videos, Google Maps, and Instagram posts."
msgstr ""
"Incrustar código te permite integrar contenido de servicios de terceros, "
"como videos de YouTube, Google Maps y publicaciones de Instagram."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/web_design/building_blocks.rst:72
msgid ""
"After dragging and dropping the :guilabel:`Embed Code` block from "
"the :guilabel:`Inner Content` section onto a page, click the block, then go "
"to the :guilabel:`Style` tab. Scroll down to the :guilabel:`Embed Code` "
"section, and, next to :guilabel:`Code`, click :guilabel:`Edit`. Replace the "
"placeholder code with the custom embed code."
msgstr ""
"Después de arrastrar y soltar el bloque :guilabel:`Código insertado` de la "
"sección :guilabel:`Contenido interno` en una página, haz clic en el bloque y "
"luego ve a la pestaña :guilabel:`Estilo`. Desplázate hacia abajo hasta la "
"sección :guilabel:`Código insertado` y, junto a :guilabel:`Código`, haz clic "
"en :guilabel:`Editar`. Reemplaza el código del marcador de posición con el "
"código insertado personalizado."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/web_design/building_blocks.rst:None
msgid "Add the link to the embedded code you want to point to."
msgstr "Agregue el enlace al código insertado que quiere resaltar"

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/web_design/building_blocks.rst:82
msgid ""
"Only use embed code from sources you trust. Copying and pasting code you do "
"not understand could put your data at risk."
msgstr ""
"Solo usa código insertado de fuentes confiables. Copiar y pegar código que "
"no entiendes podría poner en riesgo tus datos."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/web_design/building_blocks.rst:88
msgid "Move, duplicate, or delete a building block"
msgstr "Mover, duplicar o eliminar un bloque de creación"

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/web_design/building_blocks.rst:90
msgid ""
"To adjust the position and size of a building block, use the following "
"options:"
msgstr ""
"Para ajustar la posición y el tamaño de un bloque de creación, usa las "
"siguientes opciones:"

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/web_design/building_blocks.rst:92
msgid ""
"Drag the turquoise borders on the block to increase or decrease the space at "
"the top or bottom."
msgstr ""
"Arrastra los bordes turquesa del bloque para aumentar o disminuir el espacio "
"en la parte superior o inferior."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/web_design/building_blocks.rst:93
msgid ""
"Click the :icon:`fa-chevron-up` (:guilabel:`Move up`) or :icon:`fa-chevron-"
"down` (:guilabel:`Move down`) icons to change the block's order."
msgstr ""
"Haz clic en los iconos :icon:`fa-chevron-up` (:guilabel:`Mover hacia "
"arriba`) o :icon:`fa-chevron-down` (:guilabel:`Mover hacia abajo`) para "
"cambiar el orden del bloque."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/web_design/building_blocks.rst:95
msgid ""
"Click the :icon:`fa-arrows` (:guilabel:`Drag and move`) icon to move the "
"block on the page."
msgstr ""
"Haz clic en el icono :icon:`fa-arrows` (:guilabel:`Arrastrar y mover`) para "
"mover el bloque en la página."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/web_design/building_blocks.rst:96
msgid ""
"When a block contains multiple :ref:`columns <website/building_blocks/"
"columns>`, move a column to the left or right by clicking :icon:`fa-chevron-"
"left` (:guilabel:`Move left`) or :icon:`fa-chevron-right` (:guilabel:`Move "
"right`)."
msgstr ""
"Cuando un bloque contiene varias :ref:`columnas <website/building_blocks/"
"columns>`, mueve una columna hacia la izquierda o hacia la derecha al hacer "
"clic en :icon:`fa-chevron-left` (:guilabel:`Mover a la izquierda`) o "
":icon:`fa-chevron-right` (:guilabel:`Mover a la derecha`)."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/web_design/building_blocks.rst:99
msgid ""
"Click :icon:`fa-clone` (:guilabel:`Duplicate`) to create a copy of the "
"block. The duplicate is added below the original."
msgstr ""
"Haz clic en :icon:`fa-clone` (:guilabel:`Duplicar`) para crear una copia del "
"bloque. El duplicado se agrega debajo del original."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/web_design/building_blocks.rst:101
msgid "Click :icon:`fa-trash` (:guilabel:`Remove`) to delete the block."
msgstr ""
"Haz clic en :icon:`fa-trash` (:guilabel:`Eliminar`) para eliminar el bloque."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/web_design/building_blocks.rst:0
msgid "Building block options to move, duplicate , or remove it."
msgstr "Opciones del bloque de creación para moverlo, duplicarlo o eliminarlo."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/web_design/building_blocks.rst:107
msgid ""
"Alternatively, click the block, go to the :guilabel:`Style` tab, and click "
"the :icon:`fa-clone` (:guilabel:`Duplicate this block`) or :icon:`fa-trash` "
"(:guilabel:`Remove this block`) icon at the top of the tab."
msgstr ""
"De forma alternativa, haz clic en el bloque, ve a la pestaña "
":guilabel:`Estilo` y haz clic en el icono :icon:`fa-clone` "
"(:guilabel:`Duplicar este bloque`) o :icon:`fa-trash` (:guilabel:`Eliminar "
"este bloque`) en la parte superior de la pestaña."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/web_design/building_blocks.rst:112
msgid ""
"To resize a block, click and drag the dots around its edges to adjust it as "
"needed."
msgstr ""
"Para cambiar el tamaño de un bloque, haz clic y arrastra los puntos "
"alrededor de sus bordes para ajustarlo según sea necesario."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/web_design/building_blocks.rst:0
msgid "Adapt block size"
msgstr "Captura de pantalla del cambio de tamaño de un bloque"

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/web_design/building_blocks.rst:121
msgid "Edit a building block"
msgstr "Editar un bloque de creación"

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/web_design/building_blocks.rst:123
msgid ""
"To customize a building block, click it and go to the :guilabel:`Style` tab. "
"Available customization options vary depending on the type of block "
"selected. Most blocks provide options to customize the :ref:`background "
"<website/building_blocks/background>`, :ref:`layout <website/building_blocks/"
"layout>`, :ref:`shape <website/building_blocks/shape>`, and :ref:`content "
"dimensions <website/building_blocks/content-layout>`."
msgstr ""
"Para personalizar un bloque de creación, haz clic en él y ve a la pestaña "
":guilabel:`Estilo`. Las opciones de personalización disponibles varían según "
"el tipo de bloque seleccionado. La mayoría de los bloques ofrecen opciones "
"para personalizar el :ref:`fondo <website/building_blocks/background>`, el "
":ref:`diseño <website/building_blocks/layout>`, la :ref:`forma <website/"
"building_blocks/shape>` y las :ref:`dimensiones del contenido <website/"
"building_blocks/content-layout>`."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/web_design/building_blocks.rst:130
msgid ":doc:`Web design elements <elements>`"
msgstr ":doc:`Elementos de diseño web <elements>`"

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/web_design/building_blocks.rst:131
msgid ":doc:`Visibility <visibility>`"
msgstr ":doc:`Visibilidad <visibility>`"

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/web_design/building_blocks.rst:132
msgid ":doc:`General theme <themes>`"
msgstr ":doc:`Tema general <themes>`"

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/web_design/building_blocks.rst:137
msgid "Background"
msgstr "Fondo"

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/web_design/building_blocks.rst:139
msgid ""
"To customize the background of a building block, click the color dot or "
"another :guilabel:`Background` option. Depending on the selected option, you "
"can change the background :ref:`color <website/themes/theme-colors>` and/or "
"add an :ref:`image <website/elements/images>`, :ref:`video <website/elements/"
"videos>`, and/or shape. After selecting an option, additional options are "
"available to customize it."
msgstr ""
"Para personalizar el fondo de un bloque de creación, haz clic en el punto de "
"color o en otra opción de :guilabel:`Fondo`. Según la opción seleccionada, "
"puedes cambiar el :ref:`color <website/themes/theme-colors>` de fondo y/o "
"agregar una :ref:`imagen <website/elements/images>`, un :ref:`video <website/"
"elements/videos>` y/o una forma. Después de seleccionar una opción, habrá "
"opciones adicionales disponibles para personalizarla."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/web_design/building_blocks.rst:146
msgid ""
"In the :ref:`Grid <website/building_blocks/grid>` layout, use "
"the :guilabel:`Send to back` or :guilabel:`Bring to front` icons to position "
"elements, such as images and text, behind or in front of other elements."
msgstr ""
"En el diseño de :ref:`cuadrícula <website/building_blocks/grid>`, usa los "
"iconos :guilabel:`Enviar al fondo` o :guilabel:`Traer al frente` para "
"posicionar elementos, como imágenes y texto, detrás o delante de otros "
"elementos."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/web_design/building_blocks.rst:0
msgid "Move a building block to the back or front."
msgstr "Mover un bloque de creación al fondo o al frente."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/web_design/building_blocks.rst:156
msgid "Layout"
msgstr "Diseño"

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/web_design/building_blocks.rst:158
msgid ""
"Most building blocks support two layout styles: :ref:`grid <website/"
"building_blocks/grid>` and :ref:`column <website/building_blocks/columns>`. "
"To change the default layout, click the block, go to the :guilabel:`Style` "
"tab, and set the :guilabel:`Layout` field to :guilabel:`Grid` "
"or :guilabel:`Column`."
msgstr ""
"La mayoría de los bloques de creación admiten dos estilos de diseño: "
":ref:`cuadrícula <website/building_blocks/grid>` y :ref:`columna <website/"
"building_blocks/columns>`. Para cambiar el diseño predeterminado, haz clic "
"en el bloque, ve a la pestaña :guilabel:`Estilo` y establece el campo "
":guilabel:`Diseño` en :guilabel:`Cuadrícula` o :guilabel:`Columna`."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/web_design/building_blocks.rst:166
msgid "Grid"
msgstr "Cuadrícula"

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/web_design/building_blocks.rst:168
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`Grid` layout allows you to reposition and resize elements by "
"dragging and dropping them. You can also adjust their position and size "
"using the :guilabel:`Spacing` options."
msgstr ""
"El diseño en :guilabel:`Cuadrícula` te permite cambiar la posición y el "
"tamaño de los elementos arrastrándolos y soltándolos. También puedes ajustar "
"su posición y tamaño mediante las opciones de :guilabel:`Espaciado`."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/web_design/building_blocks.rst:174
msgid "Column"
msgstr "Columna"

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/web_design/building_blocks.rst:176
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`Column` layout allows you to specify the number of elements "
"per line in the block. To do so, select the block to modify, click the "
"dropdown next to the :guilabel:`Column` field, and adjust the number. You "
"can then modify a specific column's settings using the options in "
"the :guilabel:`Column` section of the :guilabel:`Style` tab."
msgstr ""
"El diseño :guilabel:`Columna` te permite especificar el número de elementos "
"por línea en el bloque. Para hacerlo, selecciona el bloque que deseas "
"modificar, haz clic en el menú desplegable junto al campo "
":guilabel:`Columna` y ajusta el número. Luego puedes modificar la "
"configuración de una columna específica mediante las opciones en la sección "
":guilabel:`Columna` de la pestaña :guilabel:`Estilo`."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/web_design/building_blocks.rst:182
msgid ""
"By default, :doc:`on mobile devices <visibility>`, only one element (column) "
"is visible per line to ensure that content remains easy to read and "
"accessible on smaller screens. To adjust this value, click the :icon:`fa-"
"mobile` (:guilabel:`Mobile Preview`) at the top of the website editor and "
"adapt the number of columns. Shapes are hidden by default on mobile devices."
msgstr ""
"De forma predeterminada, :doc:`en dispositivos móviles <visibility>`, solo "
"un elemento (columna) es visible por línea para garantizar que el contenido "
"sea fácil de leer y accesible en pantallas más pequeñas. Para ajustar este "
"valor, haz clic en :icon:`fa-mobile` (:guilabel:`Vista previa móvil`) en la "
"parte superior del editor del sitio web y adapta el número de columnas. Las "
"formas están ocultas de forma predeterminada en dispositivos móviles."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/web_design/building_blocks.rst:190
msgid "Shape"
msgstr "Forma"

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/web_design/building_blocks.rst:192
msgid ""
"To add a shape to a building block, click :guilabel:`None` next to "
"the :guilabel:`Shape` setting, then select a shape. You can change "
"the :ref:`color <website/themes/theme-colors>` and :guilabel:`Transform` the "
"shape by using the :icon:`fa-arrows-h` (:guilabel:`Horizontal flip`) "
"and :icon:`fa-arrows-v` (:guilabel:`Vertical flip`) buttons."
msgstr ""
"Para agregar una forma a un bloque de creación, haz clic en "
":guilabel:`Ninguno` junto al ajuste :guilabel:`Forma` y luego selecciona una "
"forma. Puedes cambiar el :ref:`color <website/themes/theme-colors>` y "
":guilabel:`Transformar` la forma con los botones :icon:`fa-arrows-h` "
"(:guilabel:`Voltear horizontalmente`) y :icon:`fa-arrows-v` "
"(:guilabel:`Voltear verticalmente`)."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/web_design/building_blocks.rst:197
msgid ""
"Click :icon:`fa-times` :guilabel:`Remove the shape` to remove it "
"and :ref:`manage its visibility on mobile devices <website/visibility/mobile-"
"and-computer>`."
msgstr ""
"Haz clic en :icon:`fa-times` :guilabel:`Eliminar la forma` para eliminarla y "
":ref:`gestionar su visibilidad en dispositivos móviles <website/visibility/"
"mobile-and-computer>`."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/web_design/building_blocks.rst:203
msgid "Content dimensions"
msgstr "Dimensiones del contenido"

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/web_design/building_blocks.rst:205
msgid "To adjust the content dimensions of a building block:"
msgstr "Para ajustar las dimensiones del contenido de un bloque de creación:"

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/web_design/building_blocks.rst:207
msgid ""
"Use the :guilabel:`Content Width` options to make the content fill the "
"entire width of the page or add spacing around it."
msgstr ""
"Usa las opciones de :guilabel:`Ancho del contenido` para que el contenido "
"ocupe todo el ancho de la página o para agregar espaciado a su alrededor."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/web_design/building_blocks.rst:209
msgid ""
"Set the :guilabel:`Auto` :guilabel:`Height` to :guilabel:`50%` "
"or :guilabel:`100%`."
msgstr ""
"Establece el valor :guilabel:`Automático` de :guilabel:`Altura` en "
":guilabel:`50%` o :guilabel:`100%`."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/web_design/building_blocks.rst:214
msgid "Save a custom building block"
msgstr "Guardar un bloque de creación personalizado"

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/web_design/building_blocks.rst:216
msgid ""
"Save a customized building block to reuse on other pages. To do so, select "
"it, navigate to the :guilabel:`Style` tab, and click the :icon:`fa-floppy-o` "
"(:guilabel:`Save this block to use it elsewhere`) icon. Click "
"the :guilabel:`Save` button in the pop-up window to confirm."
msgstr ""
"Guarda un bloque de creación personalizado para reutilizarlo en otras "
"páginas. Para hacerlo, selecciónalo, ve a la pestaña :guilabel:`Estilo` y "
"haz clic en el icono :icon:`fa-floppy-o` (:guilabel:`Guardar este bloque "
"para usarlo en otro lugar`). Haz clic en el botón :guilabel:`Guardar` en la "
"ventana emergente para confirmar."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/web_design/building_blocks.rst:220
msgid ""
"To add a saved building block to the page, navigate to the :icon:`fa-"
"plus` :guilabel:`Blocks` tab and drag and drop the :guilabel:`Custom` "
"categorical block. In the pop-up window that opens, click the desired block "
"in the :guilabel:`Custom` category."
msgstr ""
"Para agregar un bloque de creación guardado a la página, ve a la pestaña "
":icon:`fa-plus` :guilabel:`Bloques` y arrastra y suelta el bloque por "
"categorías :guilabel:`Personalizado`. En la ventana emergente que se abre, "
"haz clic en el bloque deseado en la categoría :guilabel:`Personalizado`."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/web_design/building_blocks.rst:225
msgid ""
"In the :guilabel:`Insert a block` pop-up window, click :icon:`fa-pencil` "
"(:guilabel:`Rename`) to rename the custom block or :icon:`fa-trash` "
"(:guilabel:`Remove`) to delete it."
msgstr ""
"En la ventana emergente :guilabel:`Insertar un bloque`, haz clic en "
":icon:`fa-pencil` (:guilabel:`Renombrar`) para cambiar el nombre del bloque "
"personalizado o en :icon:`fa-trash` (:guilabel:`Eliminar`) para eliminarlo."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/web_design/building_blocks.rst:231
msgid "Create an anchor link"
msgstr "Crear un enlace ancla"

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/web_design/building_blocks.rst:233
msgid ""
"Anchor links are hyperlinks that direct users to a specific section of a "
"page. To create an anchor link for a block, follow these steps:"
msgstr ""
"Los enlaces ancla son hipervínculos que dirigen a los usuarios a una "
"**sección específica** de una página. Sigue estos pasos para crear uno:"

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/web_design/building_blocks.rst:236
msgid "Click :guilabel:`Edit` and select the block you want to link to."
msgstr ""
"Haz clic en :guilabel:`Editar` y selecciona el bloque que quieres vincular."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/web_design/building_blocks.rst:237
msgid ""
"At the top of the :guilabel:`Style` tab, click :icon:`fa-link` "
"(:guilabel:`Create and copy a link targeting this block or edit it`)."
msgstr ""
"En la parte superior de la pestaña :guilabel:`Estilo`, haz clic en :icon:`fa-"
"link` (:guilabel:`Crear y copiar un enlace dirigido a este bloque o "
"editarlo`)."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/web_design/building_blocks.rst:239
msgid ""
"To edit the default anchor name, click :guilabel:`Edit` in the green pop-up "
"message that opens in the upper-right corner."
msgstr ""
"Para editar el nombre de ancla predeterminado, haz clic en "
":guilabel:`Editar` en el mensaje emergente verde que se abre en la esquina "
"superior derecha."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/web_design/building_blocks.rst:241
msgid "Replace the anchor name and click :guilabel:`Save & Copy`."
msgstr ""
"Reemplaza el nombre de ancla y haz clic en :guilabel:`Guardar y copiar`."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/web_design/building_blocks.rst:243
msgid ""
"Once the anchor is saved, you can :ref:`link to it <website/elements/links>` "
"from anywhere on your website."
msgstr ""
"Una vez que hayas guardado el ancla podrás :ref:`enlazarlo <website/elements/"
"links>` desde cualquier parte de tu sitio web."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/web_design/building_blocks/forms.rst:3
msgid "Forms"
msgstr "Formularios"

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/web_design/building_blocks/forms.rst:5
msgid ""
"Form blocks are used to collect information from website visitors and, if "
"applicable, create records in the database. To add a form to a website page, "
"drag and drop the :guilabel:`Contact & Forms` categorical building block, "
"then select a block in the pop-up window."
msgstr ""
"Los bloques de formulario se utilizan para recopilar información de los "
"visitantes del sitio web y, si corresponde, crear registros en la base de "
"datos. Para agregar un formulario a una página del sitio web, arrastra y "
"suelta el bloque de creación por categorías :guilabel:`Contacto y "
"formularios` y luego selecciona un bloque en la ventana emergente."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/web_design/building_blocks/forms.rst:12
msgid "Action"
msgstr "Acción"

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/web_design/building_blocks/forms.rst:14
msgid ""
"By default, submitting a form sends an email containing the visitor's "
"submitted information. Depending on the apps installed on the database, "
"additional actions that can automatically create records may become "
"available. To choose a different action, click :guilabel:`Edit`, select a "
"form field, navigate to the :guilabel:`Style` tab, and, in "
"the :guilabel:`Form` section, select the desired :guilabel:`Action`:"
msgstr ""
"De forma predeterminada, al enviar un formulario se envía un correo "
"electrónico con la información enviada por el visitante. Según las "
"aplicaciones instaladas en la base de datos, es posible que haya disponibles "
"acciones adicionales que pueden crear registros automáticamente. Para elegir "
"una acción diferente, haz clic en :guilabel:`Editar`, selecciona un campo "
"del formulario, ve a la pestaña :guilabel:`Estilo` y, en la sección "
":guilabel:`Formulario`, selecciona la :guilabel:`Acción` deseada:"

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/web_design/building_blocks/forms.rst:20
msgid ":doc:`Apply for a Job </applications/hr/recruitment/recruitment_flow>`"
msgstr ""
":doc:`Postularse a un empleo </applications/hr/recruitment/recruitment_flow>`"

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/web_design/building_blocks/forms.rst:21
msgid ":ref:`Create a Customer <ecommerce/customer_accounts/account-creation>`"
msgstr ":ref:`Crear un cliente <ecommerce/customer_accounts/account-creation>`"

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/web_design/building_blocks/forms.rst:22
msgid ":ref:`Create a Ticket <helpdesk/receiving_tickets/website-form>`"
msgstr ":ref:`Crear un ticket <helpdesk/receiving_tickets/website-form>`"

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/web_design/building_blocks/forms.rst:23
msgid ""
":doc:`Create an Opportunity </applications/sales/crm/acquire_leads/"
"opportunities_form>`"
msgstr ""
":doc:`Crear una oportunidad </applications/sales/crm/acquire_leads/"
"opportunities_form>`"

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/web_design/building_blocks/forms.rst:24
msgid ""
":doc:`Subscribe to Newsletter </applications/marketing/email_marketing/"
"mailing_lists>`"
msgstr ""
":doc:`Suscribirse al boletín de noticias </applications/marketing/"
"email_marketing/mailing_lists>`"

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/web_design/building_blocks/forms.rst:25
msgid ":ref:`Create a Shift <planning/create-shift>`"
msgstr ":ref:`Crear un turno <planning/create-shift>`"

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/web_design/building_blocks/forms.rst:26
msgid ""
":doc:`Create a Task </applications/services/project/tasks/task_creation>`"
msgstr ""
":doc:`Crear una tarea </applications/services/project/tasks/task_creation>`"

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/web_design/building_blocks/forms.rst:27
msgid ""
":doc:`Request Withdrawal </applications/websites/ecommerce/order_handling>`"
msgstr ""
":doc:`Solicitar una devolución </applications/websites/ecommerce/"
"order_handling>`"

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/web_design/building_blocks/forms.rst:28
msgid ":guilabel:`More models`: to generate other types of records"
msgstr ":guilabel:`Más modelos`: para generar otros tipos de registros"

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/web_design/building_blocks/forms.rst:30
msgid ""
"By default, submitting the form redirects visitors to a *Thank you* page. "
"Use the :guilabel:`URL` field to send them to a different page. "
"Alternatively, select :guilabel:`Nothing` or :guilabel:`Show Message` in "
"the :guilabel:`On Success` field to keep visitors on the form's page."
msgstr ""
"De forma predeterminada, al enviar el formulario se redirige a los "
"visitantes a una página de *Gracias*. Usa el campo :guilabel:`URL` para "
"enviarlos a una página diferente. También puedes seleccionar "
":guilabel:`Nada` o :guilabel:`Mostrar mensaje` en el campo :guilabel:`Al "
"tener éxito` para mantener a los visitantes en la página del formulario."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/web_design/building_blocks/forms.rst:34
msgid ""
"You can also define the :guilabel:`Labels Position` and :guilabel:`Labels "
"Width`, and specify whether :guilabel:`Marked Fields` "
"are :guilabel:`Required` or :guilabel:`Optional`. Select :guilabel:`None` to "
"indicate that no fields are marked. Additionally, define "
"the :guilabel:`Marker` used to identify marked fields."
msgstr ""
"También puedes definir la :guilabel:`Posición de las etiquetas` y el "
":guilabel:`Ancho de las etiquetas`, y especificar si los :guilabel:`Campos "
"marcados` son :guilabel:`Obligatorio` u :guilabel:`Opcional`. Selecciona "
":guilabel:`Ninguno` para indicar que ningún campo está marcado. Además, "
"define el :guilabel:`Marcador` que se utiliza para identificar los campos "
"marcados."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/web_design/building_blocks/forms.rst:40
msgid "Configure the :doc:`visibility <../visibility>` settings for forms."
msgstr ""
"Configura los ajustes de :doc:`visibilidad <../visibility>` de los "
"formularios."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/web_design/building_blocks/forms.rst:45
msgid "Fields"
msgstr "Campos"

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/web_design/building_blocks/forms.rst:47
msgid ""
"To add a new field to the form, navigate to the :guilabel:`Style` tab and "
"click the :guilabel:`+ Field` button in the :guilabel:`Form` "
"or :guilabel:`Field` header section. To edit any field on the form, select "
"the field, then modify and format its label directly on the form and use the "
"options available in the :guilabel:`Field` section of the :guilabel:`Style` "
"tab. For example, you can:"
msgstr ""
"Para agregar un nuevo campo al formulario, ve a la pestaña "
":guilabel:`Estilo` y haz clic en el botón :guilabel:`+ Campo` en la sección "
"de encabezado :guilabel:`Formulario` o :guilabel:`Campo`. Para editar "
"cualquier campo del formulario, selecciónalo, luego modifica y da formato a "
"su etiqueta directamente en el formulario y usa las opciones disponibles en "
"la sección :guilabel:`Campo` de la pestaña :guilabel:`Estilo`. Por ejemplo, "
"puedes:"

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/web_design/building_blocks/forms.rst:52
msgid "Change the field :guilabel:`Type`."
msgstr "Cambiar el :guilabel:`tipo` de campo."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/web_design/building_blocks/forms.rst:55
msgid ""
"It is also possible to select an :guilabel:`Existing Field` from the "
"database and use the data it contains. The fields available depend on the "
"selected action. Property fields added to the database can also be used "
"depending on the selected action."
msgstr ""
"Puedes seleccionar un :guilabel:`campo existente` de una base de datos y "
"usar su respectiva información. Los campos disponibles dependen de la acción "
"que hayas seleccionado. También puedes utilizar los campos de propiedad que "
"hayas agregado a la base de datos."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/web_design/building_blocks/forms.rst:0
msgid "All types of form fields"
msgstr "Todos los tipos de campos de formulario"

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/web_design/building_blocks/forms.rst:64
msgid ""
"Some fields are visually similar, but the data entered must follow a "
"specific format."
msgstr ""
"Algunos campos son similares visualmente, pero la información ingresada debe "
"seguir un formato específico."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/web_design/building_blocks/forms.rst:66
msgid "Specify if the field is :guilabel:`Required`."
msgstr "Especificar si el campo es :guilabel:`obligatorio`."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/web_design/building_blocks/forms.rst:67
msgid ""
"Enable a field :guilabel:`Description`. Toggle the switch on and click the "
"default description on the form to modify it."
msgstr ""
"Habilita una :guilabel:`descripción` del campo. Presiona el botón y haz clic "
"en la descripción predeterminada del formulario para modificarla."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/web_design/building_blocks/forms.rst:69
msgid ""
"Use the :guilabel:`Requirement` field to add "
"validation :guilabel:`Conditions` to ensure visitors enter valid "
"information. For example, set the condition requiring the :guilabel:`Email` "
"field to contain an `@` symbol or matching a specific domain."
msgstr ""
"Usa el campo :guilabel:`Requisito` para agregar :guilabel:`Condiciones` de "
"validación y asegurarte de que los visitantes ingresen información válida. "
"Por ejemplo, establece la condición que requiera que el campo "
":guilabel:`Correo electrónico` contenga el símbolo `@` o coincida con un "
"dominio específico."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/web_design/building_blocks/forms.rst:72
msgid "Add an :ref:`animation <website/elements/animations>`."
msgstr "Agregar una :ref:`animación <website/elements/animations>`."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/web_design/building_blocks/forms.rst:73
msgid ""
"Edit the field's :doc:`visibility <../../web_design/visibility>` settings."
msgstr ""
"Edita los ajustes de :doc:`visibilidad <../../web_design/visibility>` del "
"campo."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/web_design/building_blocks/forms.rst:75
msgid "Depending on the selected field, the following options are available:"
msgstr "Según el campo seleccionado, están disponibles las siguientes opciones:"

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/web_design/building_blocks/forms.rst:79
msgid "String and numerical fields"
msgstr "Campos numéricos y de cadena"

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/web_design/building_blocks/forms.rst:81
msgid ""
"For text and string fields, such as :guilabel:`Text`, :guilabel:`Long "
"Text`, :guilabel:`Email`, and :guilabel:`Url`, as well as numerical fields, "
"such as :guilabel:`Telephone`, :guilabel:`Number`, and :guilabel:`Decimal "
"Number`, you can define a :guilabel:`Placeholder` and a :guilabel:`Default "
"Value`."
msgstr ""
"Para los campos de texto y de cadena, como :guilabel:`Texto`, "
":guilabel:`Texto largo`, :guilabel:`Correo electrónico` y :guilabel:`URL`, "
"así como los campos numéricos, como :guilabel:`Teléfono`, :guilabel:`Número` "
"y :guilabel:`Número decimal`, puedes definir un :guilabel:`Marcador de "
"posición` y un :guilabel:`Valor predeterminado`."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/web_design/building_blocks/forms.rst:86
msgid ""
"For the :guilabel:`Long Text` field, you can also specify the "
"field's :guilabel:`Height`."
msgstr ""
"Para el campo :guilabel:`Texto largo`, también puedes especificar la "
":guilabel:`Altura` del campo."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/web_design/building_blocks/forms.rst:88
msgid ""
"Additionally, you can set character limits for string fields and "
"the :guilabel:`Telephone` field. To do so, enable the :guilabel:`Character "
"Limit` option, then set the minimum and maximum character counts using "
"the :guilabel:`Min Characters` and :guilabel:`Max Characters` fields."
msgstr ""
"Además, puedes establecer límites de caracteres para los campos de cadena y "
"el campo :guilabel:`Teléfono`. Para hacerlo, activa la opción "
":guilabel:`Límite de caracteres` y luego establece el número mínimo y máximo "
"de caracteres con los campos :guilabel:`Caracteres mínimos` y "
":guilabel:`Caracteres máximos`."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/web_design/building_blocks/forms.rst:93
msgid "Selection fields"
msgstr "Campos de selección"

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/web_design/building_blocks/forms.rst:95
msgid "The following selection fields are available:"
msgstr "Los siguientes campos de selección están disponibles:"

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/web_design/building_blocks/forms.rst:97
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Checkbox`: Visitors can select or clear the checkbox. "
"Toggle :guilabel:`Hide Label` on to remove the label, and "
"enable :guilabel:`Default Value` to have it selected by default."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Casilla de verificación`: los visitantes pueden marcar o "
"desmarcar la casilla. Activa :guilabel:`Ocultar etiqueta` para quitar la "
"etiqueta y activa :guilabel:`Valor predeterminado` para que aparezca "
"seleccionada de forma predeterminada."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/web_design/building_blocks/forms.rst:100
msgid ":guilabel:`Multiple Checkboxes`: Visitors can select multiple options."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Varias casillas de verificación`: los visitantes pueden "
"seleccionar varias opciones."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/web_design/building_blocks/forms.rst:101
msgid ":guilabel:`Radio Buttons`: Visitors can select one option."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Botones de opción`: los visitantes pueden seleccionar una sola "
"opción."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/web_design/building_blocks/forms.rst:102
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Selection`: Visitors can select one option from the drop-down "
"menu."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Selección`: los visitantes pueden seleccionar una opción en el "
"menú desplegable."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/web_design/building_blocks/forms.rst:104
msgid ""
"For fields with multiple options, enable the options you want to set as "
"default by toggling the switch on. To remove an option, click the :icon:`fa-"
"minus` (:guilabel:`remove`) icon. To add a new option, click :guilabel:`Add "
"New Option` and enter the option."
msgstr ""
"En los campos con varias opciones, activa con el interruptor las opciones "
"que quieras establecer de forma predeterminada. Para eliminar una opción, "
"haz clic en el ícono :icon:`fa-minus` (:guilabel:`eliminar`). Para agregar "
"una nueva opción, haz clic en :guilabel:`Agregar nueva opción` e ingresa la "
"opción."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/web_design/building_blocks/forms.rst:109
msgid ""
"For :guilabel:`Multiple Checkboxes` and :guilabel:`Radio Buttons`, define "
"how the options are displayed: :guilabel:`Horizontal` "
"or :guilabel:`Vertical`."
msgstr ""
"Para :guilabel:`Varias casillas de verificación` y :guilabel:`Botones de "
"opción`, define cómo se muestran las opciones: :guilabel:`Horizontal` o "
":guilabel:`Vertical`."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/web_design/building_blocks/forms.rst:111
msgid ""
"For :guilabel:`Radio Buttons` and :guilabel:`Selection` dropdown lists, "
"toggle the :guilabel:`Add Other` switch on to allow visitors to add their "
"own option. You can also define a :guilabel:`Label` "
"and :guilabel:`Placeholder`."
msgstr ""
"En las listas desplegables de :guilabel:`Botones de opción` y "
":guilabel:`Selección`, activa el interruptor :guilabel:`Agregar otro` para "
"permitir que los visitantes agreguen su propia opción. También puedes "
"definir una :guilabel:`Etiqueta` y un :guilabel:`Marcador de posición`."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/web_design/building_blocks/forms.rst:114
msgid ""
"For :guilabel:`Selection` dropdown lists, toggle the :guilabel:`Allow Empty` "
"switch on to allow visitors to leave the field empty. You can also define "
"a :guilabel:`Placeholder`."
msgstr ""
"En las listas desplegables de :guilabel:`Selección`, activa el interruptor "
":guilabel:`Permitir vacío` para permitir que los visitantes dejen el campo "
"vacío. También puedes definir un :guilabel:`Marcador de posición`."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/web_design/building_blocks/forms.rst:117
msgid "You can also :ref:`translate <translate/translate>` selection options."
msgstr ""
"También puedes :ref:`traducir <translate/translate>` las opciones de "
"selección."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/web_design/building_blocks/forms.rst:119
msgid "Date and time"
msgstr "Fecha y hora"

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/web_design/building_blocks/forms.rst:121
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`Date` and :guilabel:`Date & Time` fields allow visitors to "
"select a date and, if applicable, a time using the date selector. You can "
"also define a :guilabel:`Placeholder` and a :guilabel:`Default Value`, e.g., "
"to use a specific date/time by default."
msgstr ""
"Los campos :guilabel:`Fecha` y :guilabel:`Fecha y hora` permiten a los "
"visitantes seleccionar una fecha y, si corresponde, una hora mediante el "
"selector de fechas. También puedes definir un :guilabel:`Marcador de "
"posición` y un :guilabel:`Valor predeterminado`, por ejemplo, para usar una "
"fecha u hora específica de forma predeterminada."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/web_design/building_blocks/forms.rst:126
msgid ""
"If needed, customize the :icon:`fa-calendar` "
"(:guilabel:`calendar`) :ref:`icon <website/elements/icons>`."
msgstr ""
"Si es necesario, personaliza el :icon:`fa-calendar` (:guilabel:`calendario`) "
":ref:`ícono <website/elements/icons>`."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/web_design/building_blocks/forms.rst:129
msgid "Files"
msgstr "Archivos"

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/web_design/building_blocks/forms.rst:131
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`File Upload` field type allows visitors to upload a file. You "
"can define the :guilabel:`Max # of Files` as well as the :guilabel:`Max File "
"Size`. Optionally, enable the :guilabel:`Restrict File Types` option, then "
"enable the supported file types."
msgstr ""
"El tipo de campo :guilabel:`Subir archivo` permite a los visitantes subir un "
"archivo. Puedes definir el :guilabel:`Número máximo de archivos`, así como "
"el :guilabel:`Tamaño máximo de archivo`. De manera opcional, activa la "
"opción :guilabel:`Restringir tipos de archivo` y luego habilita los tipos de "
"archivo compatibles."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/web_design/building_blocks/forms.rst:135
msgid "To apply the changes, click :guilabel:`Save`."
msgstr "Para aplicar los cambios, haz clic en :guilabel:`Guardar`."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/web_design/building_blocks/forms.rst:138
msgid ""
"Drag and drop :ref:`inner content snippets <website/building_blocks/add>` "
"inside forms to create sections, add images, set titles, and include other "
"content elements."
msgstr ""
"Arrastra y suelta :ref:`bloques de contenido interno <website/"
"building_blocks/add>` dentro de los formularios para crear secciones, "
"agregar imágenes, establecer títulos e incluir otros elementos de contenido."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/web_design/building_blocks/forms.rst:140
msgid ""
"Modify the text of the :guilabel:`Submit` button by clicking it and entering "
"the desired text. You can also change the "
"button's :guilabel:`Type`, :guilabel:`Size`, :guilabel:`Shape`, "
"and :guilabel:`Animation` in the :guilabel:`Button` section of "
"the :guilabel:`Style` tab."
msgstr ""
"Modifica el texto del botón :guilabel:`Enviar` al hacer clic en él e "
"ingresar el texto deseado. También puedes cambiar el :guilabel:`Tipo`, "
":guilabel:`Tamaño`, :guilabel:`Forma` y :guilabel:`Animación` del botón en "
"la sección :guilabel:`Botón` de la pestaña :guilabel:`Estilo`."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/web_design/building_blocks/forms.rst:147
msgid "Add an Odoo contact form on a non-Odoo website"
msgstr ""
"Agregar un formulario de contacto de Odoo a un sitio web que no sea de Odoo"

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/web_design/building_blocks/forms.rst:149
msgid ""
"You can display an Odoo contact form on another website using an iframe. To "
"do so, follow these steps:"
msgstr ""
"Puedes mostrar un formulario de contacto de Odoo en otro sitio web mediante "
"un iframe. Sigue estos pasos para hacerlo:"

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/web_design/building_blocks/forms.rst:152
msgid ""
"**Prepare the Odoo form:** Create a contact form on a page in Odoo Website "
"and remove the :ref:`header and footer design <website/header_footer/"
"design>`. Make sure only the contact form remains on the page."
msgstr ""
"**Prepara el formulario de Odoo:** crea un formulario de contacto en una "
"página de Sitio web de Odoo y elimina el :ref:`diseño de encabezado y pie de "
"página <website/header_footer/design>`. Asegúrate de que solo quede el "
"formulario de contacto en la página."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/web_design/building_blocks/forms.rst:155
msgid ""
"**Generate an embeddable code:** Copy the URL of the Odoo form page and "
"paste it into an iframe generator, such as `La Digitale.dev <https://"
"ladigitale.dev/digitools/generateur-iframe>`_ or `iFrame Generator <https://"
"www.iframe-generator.com/>`_ . Adjust the width and height for proper "
"display."
msgstr ""
"**Genera un código incrustable:** Copia la URL de la página del formulario "
"de Odoo y pégala en un generador de iframes, como `La Digitale.dev <https://"
"ladigitale.dev/digitools/generateur-iframe>`_ o `iFrame Generator <https://"
"www.iframe-generator.com/>`_. Ajusta el ancho y la altura para que se "
"muestre correctamente."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/web_design/building_blocks/forms.rst:159
msgid ""
"**Add the embedded code to the non-Odoo website:** Open the relevant page's "
"HTML (in the code editor or CMS) and insert the embedded code where the form "
"should be displayed."
msgstr ""
"**Agregar el código incrustable al sitio web que no es de Odoo:** Abre el "
"HTML de la página correspondiente (en el editor de código o CMS) e inserta "
"el código incrustable donde quieras que aparezca el formulario."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/web_design/building_blocks/forms.rst:163
msgid "Example of an embedded code:"
msgstr "Ejemplo de un código incrustable:"

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/web_design/elements.rst:5
msgid ""
"Elements help structure and present content effectively. They range from "
"text-based components like :ref:`titles <website/elements/"
"titles>`, :ref:`lists <website/elements/lists>` and :ref:`text highlights "
"<website/elements/text_highlights>` to interactive ones such "
"as :ref:`buttons <website/elements/buttons>` and :ref:`links <website/"
"elements/links>`. Visual elements like :ref:`images <website/elements/"
"images>`, :ref:`icons <website/elements/icons>`, :ref:`videos <website/"
"elements/videos>`, and :ref:`animations <website/elements/animations>` can "
"also be added to improve content presentation and organization."
msgstr ""
"Los elementos ayudan a estructurar y presentar el contenido de forma eficaz. "
"Estos pueden ser componentes basados en texto, como :ref:`títulos <website/"
"elements/titles>`, :ref:`listas <website/elements/lists>` y :ref:`resaltados "
"de texto <website/elements/text_highlights>` o elementos interactivos, "
"como :ref:`botones <website/elements/buttons>` y :ref:`enlaces <website/"
"elements/links>`. También puede agregar elementos visuales "
"como :ref:`imágenes <website/elements/images>`, :ref:`iconos <website/"
"elements/icons>`, :ref:`videos <website/elements/videos>` "
"y :ref:`animaciones <website/elements/animations>` para mejorar la "
"presentación y organización del contenido."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/web_design/elements.rst:13
msgid "To add or modify a website element:"
msgstr "Para agregar o modificar un elemento del sitio web:"

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/web_design/elements.rst:15
msgid "Navigate to the relevant website page and click on :guilabel:`Edit`."
msgstr ""
"Vaya ala página correspondiente del sitio web y haga clic "
"en :guilabel:`Editar`."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/web_design/elements.rst:16
msgid ""
"Click the section on the page where you want to add or modify an element."
msgstr ""
"Haga clic en la sección de la página donde desea agregar o modificar un "
"elemento."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/web_design/elements.rst:17
msgid "Make the necessary changes."
msgstr "Haga los cambios necesarios."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/web_design/elements.rst:18
msgid "Click on :guilabel:`Save`."
msgstr "Haga clic en :guilabel:`Guardar`."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/web_design/elements.rst:21
msgid ""
"The default styles for headings, buttons, links, and paragraph text, for "
"example, are defined in the :doc:`Theme tab <themes>` of the website editor."
msgstr ""
"Los estilos predeterminados de los encabezados, botones, enlaces y párrafos "
"se definen en la :doc:`pestaña Tema <themes>` del editor del sitio web."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/web_design/elements.rst:None
msgid "Type / to add website elements."
msgstr "Escribir / para agregar elementos al sitio web."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/web_design/elements.rst:30
msgid "Titles"
msgstr "Títulos"

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/web_design/elements.rst:32
msgid ""
"Titles define headings and organize website content into different levels "
"for clarity and structure. To insert a title, type `/title`, choose the "
"heading style (:guilabel:`Heading 1`, :guilabel:`Heading 2`, "
"or :guilabel:`Heading 3`), and type the text."
msgstr ""
"Los títulos definen los encabezados y organizan el contenido del sitio web "
"en diferentes niveles para que haya mayor claridad y estructura. Escriba "
"`título` para insertar uno, elija el estilo correspondiente "
"(:guilabel:`Título 1`, :guilabel:`Título 2` o :guilabel:`Título 3`) y "
"escriba el texto."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/web_design/elements.rst:37
msgid ""
"Alternatively, type the text, select it, and choose the appropriate style "
"from the :guilabel:`Inline Text` section in the :guilabel:`Customize` tab of "
"the website editor. Additional formatting options, such as fonts and colors, "
"are also available in this section."
msgstr ""
"También puede escribir el texto, seleccionarlo y elegir el estilo adecuado "
"en la sección :guilabel:`Texto` en línea en la "
"pestaña :guilabel:`Personalizar` del editor del sitio web. Esta sección "
"también cuenta con otras opciones de formato, como fuentes y colores."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/web_design/elements.rst:46
msgid ""
"Buttons are interactive elements that allow to link to another page or to a "
"page anchor. To insert a button:"
msgstr ""
"Los botones son elementos interactivos que permiten vincular otras páginas o "
"anclas de páginas. Para insertar un botón:"

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/web_design/elements.rst:49
msgid "Type `/button`."
msgstr "Escriba `/botón`."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/web_design/elements.rst:50
msgid "Enter the button's label in the :guilabel:`Link Label` field."
msgstr ""
"Escriba la etiqueta del botón en el campo :guilabel:`Etiqueta del enlace`."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/web_design/elements.rst:51
msgid ""
"Add the :guilabel:`URL or Email`. Type `/` to search for a page and `#` to "
"link to an anchor."
msgstr ""
"Agregue la :guilabel:`URL o correo electrónico`. Escriba `/` para buscar una "
"página o `#` para vincular un ancla."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/web_design/elements.rst:52
msgid ""
"Set the :guilabel:`Style`, :guilabel:`Size`, and :guilabel:`Layout` to "
"define the button's appearance."
msgstr ""
"Configure el :guilabel:`estilo`, :guilabel:`tamaño` y :guilabel:`diseño` "
"para definir la apariencia del botón."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/web_design/elements.rst:54
msgid ""
"If needed, toggle the switch to open the linked page or anchor in a new tab."
msgstr ""
"Si es necesario, presione el botón correspondiente para abrir la página "
"vinculada o ancla en una nueva pestaña."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/web_design/elements.rst:55
msgid "Click :guilabel:`Apply` to save changes."
msgstr "Haga clic en :guilabel:`Aplicar` para guardar los cambios."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/web_design/elements.rst:58
msgid ""
"To modify an existing button, click the button and edit the options in "
"the :guilabel:`Inline text` section of the website editor."
msgstr ""
"Para modificar un botón existente, haga clic en el botón y edite las "
"opciones en la sección :guilabel:`Texto en línea` del editor del sitio web."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/web_design/elements.rst:66
msgid "To insert an image:"
msgstr "Para insertar una imagen:"

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/web_design/elements.rst:68
msgid "Type `/image`."
msgstr "Escriba `/imagen`."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/web_design/elements.rst:69
msgid ""
":doc:`Search the Unsplash database </applications/general/integrations/"
"unsplash>` or click :guilabel:`Upload an image` to choose a file from your "
"local images."
msgstr ""
":doc:`Busque una imagen en la base de datos de Unsplash </applications/"
"general/integrations/unsplash>` o haga clic en :guilabel:`Subir una imagen` "
"para elegir una de sus archivos locales."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/web_design/elements.rst:71
msgid "Click :guilabel:`Add`."
msgstr "Haga clic en :guilabel:`Agregar`."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/web_design/elements.rst:72
msgid ""
"To customize the image, click on the image and edit the options in "
"the :guilabel:`Image` section of the website editor. For example:"
msgstr ""
"Para personalizar la imagen, haga clic en ella y edite las opciones en la "
"sección :guilabel:`Imagen` del editor del sitio web. Por ejemplo:"

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/web_design/elements.rst:75
msgid ":guilabel:`Replace` the image."
msgstr ":guilabel:`Reemplace` la imagen."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/web_design/elements.rst:76
msgid ""
"Define an `alt tag <https://help.siteimprove.com/support/solutions/articles/"
"80000448480-where-are-alt-tags- used-and-why-are-they-important>`_ in "
"the :guilabel:`Description` field."
msgstr ""
"Defina una `etiqueta alternativa <https://help.siteimprove.com/support/"
"solutions/articles/80000448480-where-are-alt-tags-used-and-why-are-they-"
"important>`_ en el campo :guilabel:`Descripción`."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/web_design/elements.rst:78
msgid ""
"Enter a title tag in the :guilabel:`Tooltip` field. This text will appear "
"when visitors hover their mouse over the image."
msgstr ""
"Escriba una etiqueta de título en el campo :guilabel:`Información sobre "
"herramientas`. Este texto aparecerá cuando los visitantes pasen el cursor "
"sobre la imagen."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/web_design/elements.rst:80
msgid ""
"Add a :guilabel:`Shape`; some shapes also allow for color customization."
msgstr ""
"Agregue una :guilabel:`forma`. Puede cambiar el color de algunas de ellas."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/web_design/elements.rst:81
msgid ""
"Adjust the image's :guilabel:`Width`, e.g., to improve performance. A "
"smaller size may be suggested if it is sufficient for display."
msgstr ""
"Ajuste el :guilabel:`ancho` de la imagen. Esto podría ayudarle a mejorar el "
"rendimiento y puede aparecer una sugerencia para que reduzca su tamaño si "
"este es suficiente para la visualización."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/web_design/elements.rst:83
msgid "Resize the image using the :guilabel:`Transform` tool."
msgstr ""
"Use la herramienta :guilabel:`Transformar` para cambiar el tamaño de la "
"imagen."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/web_design/elements.rst:84
msgid ""
"Adjust the :guilabel:`Padding` to add space (in pixels) around the image."
msgstr ""
"Ajuste el :guilabel:`padding` para agregar espacio (en píxeles) alrededor de "
"la imagen."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/web_design/elements.rst:85
msgid "Etc."
msgstr "Entre otras cosas."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/web_design/elements.rst:90
msgid "Videos"
msgstr "Videos"

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/web_design/elements.rst:92
msgid ""
"To add a video, type `/video`, insert the URL, and turn on the desired "
"options:"
msgstr ""
"Escriba `/Video` para agregar uno, inserte la URL y habilite las opciones "
"correspondientes:"

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/web_design/elements.rst:94
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Autoplay`: to automatically play the video when the page is "
"accessed. The video is automatically muted by default."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Reproducción automática`: Esta opción reproduce el video en "
"automático cuando alguien entra a la página. Está silenciado de forma "
"predeterminada."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/web_design/elements.rst:96
msgid ":guilabel:`Loop`: to play the video on a loop."
msgstr ":guilabel:`Bucle`: Para reproducir el vídeo en bucle."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/web_design/elements.rst:97
msgid ":guilabel:`Hide player controls`"
msgstr ":guilabel:`Ocultar controles de reproductor`"

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/web_design/elements.rst:98
msgid ":guilabel:`Hide fullscreen button`"
msgstr ":guilabel:`Ocultar botón de pantalla completa`"

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/web_design/elements.rst:99
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Vertical`: to display the video in vertical format (portrait "
"mode)."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Vertical`: para mostrar el video en formato vertical (modo "
"vertical)."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/web_design/elements.rst:100
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Start at`: to define the timestamp where the video should start, "
"in `MM:SS` format."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Empezar en`: Para definir la marca de tiempo en el que el video "
"debe empezar, en formato `MM:SS`."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/web_design/elements.rst:105
msgid "Icons"
msgstr "Iconos"

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/web_design/elements.rst:107
msgid ""
"To insert an icon, type `/image`, go to the :guilabel:`Icons` tab, select an "
"icon, and click :guilabel:`Add`. To modify an icon, click on it and use "
"the :guilabel:`Icon` section of the website editor to customize options, "
"such as :guilabel:`Color`, :guilabel:`Size`, :ref:`Animations <website/"
"elements/animations>`, :guilabel:`Shape`, etc."
msgstr ""
"Para insertar un icono, escriba `/imagen`, vaya a la "
"pestaña :guilabel:`Iconos` y haga clic en :guilabel:`Agregar`. Para "
"modificar un icono, haga clic en él y use la sección :guilabel:`Icono` del "
"editor del sitio web para personalizar opciones como el :guilabel:`color`, "
"el :guilabel:`tamaño`, las :ref:`animaciones <website/elements/animations>`, "
"la :guilabel:`forma`, entre otras cosas."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/web_design/elements.rst:115
#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/web_design/themes.rst:193
msgid "Links"
msgstr "Enlaces"

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/web_design/elements.rst:117
msgid ""
"Links are used to connect different pages and resources, guiding visitors "
"and improving navigation. To add a link, type `/link`, then, in the pop-up "
"that opens, enter the link's :guilabel:`Label` and add the :guilabel:`URL or "
"Email`. Type `/` to search for a page and `#` to link to an :ref:`anchor "
"<website/building_blocks/anchor>`."
msgstr ""
"Los enlaces se utilizan para conectar diferentes páginas y recursos, guiar a "
"los visitantes y mejorar la navegación. Escribe `/enlace` para agregar uno, "
"aparecerá una ventana emergente en la que deberás ingresar "
"la :guilabel:`etiqueta` del vínculo y agregar la :guilabel:`URL o el correo "
"electrónico`. Escriba `/` para buscar una página o `#` para vincular "
"un :ref:`ancla <website/building_blocks/anchor>`."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/web_design/elements.rst:123
msgid ""
"By default, the :guilabel:`Style` field is set to :guilabel:`Link`. Select a "
"different style to transform the link into a :ref:`button <website/elements/"
"buttons>`."
msgstr ""
"El campo :guilabel:`Estilo` está configurado con la "
"opción :guilabel:`Enlace` de forma predeterminada. Elija un estilo diferente "
"para transformar el enlace en un :ref:`botón <website/elements/buttons>`."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/web_design/elements.rst:129
msgid "Lists"
msgstr "Listas"

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/web_design/elements.rst:131
msgid ""
"Lists help organize content clearly, making information easier to read and "
"improving web pages' structures. Type `/list` and choose from three "
"different types of lists: :guilabel:`Bulleted lists`, :guilabel:`Numbered "
"lists`, or :guilabel:`Checklists`."
msgstr ""
"Las listas ayudan a organizar el contenido de forma clara, hace que la "
"información sea más fácil de leer y mejora las estructuras de las páginas "
"web. Escriba `/lista` y elija una de las tres opciones "
"disponibles: :guilabel:`lista con viñetas`, :guilabel:`lista numerada` "
"o :guilabel:`lista de verificación`."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/web_design/elements.rst:138
msgid "Text highlights"
msgstr "Resaltar texto"

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/web_design/elements.rst:140
msgid ""
"Highlights can be added to titles and text using in the :guilabel:`Inline "
"Text` section of the website editor. To add a highlight:"
msgstr ""
"Puede resaltar títulos y texto desde la sección :guilabel:`Texto en línea` "
"del editor del sitio web. Para resaltar estos elementos:"

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/web_design/elements.rst:143
msgid "Select the text or title you want to highlight."
msgstr "Seleccione el texto o título que desea resaltar."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/web_design/elements.rst:144
msgid "In the website editor, click on :guilabel:`Highlight`."
msgstr "Haga clic en :guilabel:`Resaltar` en el editor del sitio web."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/web_design/elements.rst:145
msgid "Select the highlight style."
msgstr "Seleccione el estilo que usará para resaltar."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/web_design/elements.rst:146
msgid "Modify its :guilabel:`Color`."
msgstr "Modifique el :guilabel:`color`."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/web_design/elements.rst:147
msgid "Choose its :guilabel:`Thickness`."
msgstr "Elija el :guilabel:`grosor`."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/web_design/elements.rst:None
msgid "Highlight texts and titles"
msgstr "Resaltar textos y títulos"

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/web_design/elements.rst:155
msgid "Animations"
msgstr "Animaciones"

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/web_design/elements.rst:157
msgid ""
"Animations are used to add movement to :doc:`building blocks "
"<building_blocks>` and website elements such as images and text. Three types "
"of animation are available: :guilabel:`On Scroll`, :guilabel:`On "
"Appearance`, and :guilabel:`On Hover` (for images only)."
msgstr ""
"Las animaciones sirven para agregar movimiento a los :doc:`bloques de "
"creación <building_blocks>` y a los elementos del sitio web como imágenes y "
"texto. Hay tres tipos de animaciones disponibles: :guilabel:`Al "
"desplazarse`, :guilabel:`Al aparecer` y :guilabel:`Al pasar el cursor por "
"encima` (solo para imágenes)."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/web_design/elements.rst:161
msgid "To add an animation to a website element:"
msgstr "Para agregar una animación a un elemento del sitio web:"

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/web_design/elements.rst:163
msgid "Click on the element."
msgstr "Haga clic en el elemento."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/web_design/elements.rst:164
msgid ""
"In the website editor, go to the relevant section for the element "
"(e.g., :guilabel:`Button`, :guilabel:`Column`, :guilabel:`Inline Text`, "
"etc.)."
msgstr ""
"En el editor del sitio web, vaya a la sección correspondiente para el "
"elemento (como :guilabel:`botón`, :guilabel:`columna`, :guilabel:`texto en "
"línea`, etc.)."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/web_design/elements.rst:166
msgid "In the :guilabel:`Animation` field, select the desired animation type."
msgstr ""
"Seleccione el tipo de animación deseado en el campo :guilabel:`Animación` ."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/web_design/elements.rst:167
msgid ""
"Customize the animation settings as needed. Available options vary based on "
"the selected animation type."
msgstr ""
"Personalice los ajustes de la animación si es necesario. Las opciones "
"disponibles varían de acuerdo al tipo de animación que haya seleccionado."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/web_design/elements.rst:171
msgid "Animations on scroll"
msgstr "Animaciones al desplazarse"

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/web_design/elements.rst:173
msgid "For animations on scroll, it is possible to:"
msgstr "Con las animaciones al desplazarse tiene las siguientes opciones:"

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/web_design/elements.rst:175
msgid ""
"Choose :guilabel:`In` to add the animation when the element enters the "
"screen and :guilabel:`Out` to add it when it leaves the screen."
msgstr ""
"Seleccione :guilabel:`Entrada` para agregar la animación cuando el elemento "
"entra en la pantalla y :guilabel:`Salida` para agregarla cuando sale de ella."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/web_design/elements.rst:177
msgid "Select an :guilabel:`Effect`."
msgstr "Seleccione un :guilabel:`efecto`."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/web_design/elements.rst:178
#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/web_design/elements.rst:189
msgid "Choose the :guilabel:`Direction` of the effect."
msgstr "Elija la :guilabel:`dirección` del efecto."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/web_design/elements.rst:179
#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/web_design/elements.rst:192
msgid "Adapt the :guilabel:`Intensity` of the effect."
msgstr "Adapte la :guilabel:`intensidad` del efecto."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/web_design/elements.rst:180
msgid ""
"Define the :guilabel:`Scroll Zone`, where the first value represents the "
"percentage of the screen shown when the effect starts, and the second value "
"represents its percentage at the end."
msgstr ""
"Defina la :guilabel:`zona de desplazamiento`. El primer valor representa el "
"porcentaje visible de la pantalla cuando comienza el efecto y el segundo "
"valor representa su porcentaje al finalizar."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/web_design/elements.rst:184
msgid "Animations on appearance"
msgstr "Animaciones al aparecer"

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/web_design/elements.rst:186
msgid "For animations on appearance, it is possible to:"
msgstr "Con las animaciones al aparecer tiene las siguientes opciones:"

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/web_design/elements.rst:188
msgid "Choose among different effects."
msgstr "Puede elegir entre diferentes efectos."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/web_design/elements.rst:190
msgid ""
"Pick a :guilabel:`Trigger` option to define when the animation occurs: "
"either the :guilabel:`First Time only` or :guilabel:`Every Time`."
msgstr ""
"Seleccione una opción en :guilabel:`Activar` para definir cuándo ocurre la "
"animación, elija entre :guilabel:`Solo la primera vez` o :guilabel:`Siempre`."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/web_design/elements.rst:193
msgid ""
"If you want the animation to be triggered after a number of seconds, define "
"this number in the :guilabel:`Start After` field."
msgstr ""
"Si desea activar la animación después de un número de segundos, defínalo en "
"el campo :guilabel:`Iniciar después de`."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/web_design/elements.rst:195
msgid "Choose a :guilabel:`Duration` for the animation."
msgstr "Elija la :guilabel:`duración` de la animación."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/web_design/elements.rst:198
msgid "Animations on hover (for images only)"
msgstr "Animaciones al pasar el cursor por encima (solo para imágenes)"

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/web_design/elements.rst:200
msgid ""
"Animations :guilabel:`On hover` can be added to :ref:`images <website/"
"elements/images>`. You can choose the :guilabel:`Effect` of the animation, "
"as well as the :guilabel:`Color` and the :guilabel:`Stroke Width`."
msgstr ""
"Puede agregar animaciones :guilabel:`al pasar el cursor` a "
"las :ref:`imágenes <website/elements/images>` y elegir el :guilabel:`efecto` "
"de la animación, así como el :guilabel:`color` y el :guilabel:`ancho del "
"trazo`."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/web_design/elements.rst:205
msgid ":doc:`Odoo HTML editor </applications/essentials/html_editor>`"
msgstr ":doc:`Editor HTML de Odoo </applications/essentials/html_editor>`"

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/web_design/themes.rst:5
msgid ""
"Odoo provides a range of theme :ref:`customization options <website/themes/"
"page-layouts>` to define the website's :ref:`colors <website/themes/"
"colors>`, :ref:`fonts <website/themes/fonts>`, and :ref:`shadow styles "
"<website/themes/shadows>`, and the appearance of :ref:`paragraphs and "
"headings <website/themes/paragraphs-headings>`, :ref:`buttons <website/"
"themes/button-styles>`, :ref:`links <website/themes/link-style>`, "
"and :ref:`input fields <website/themes/input-fields>`. "
"Additional :ref:`advanced settings <website/themes/advanced>` are also "
"available."
msgstr ""
"Odoo ofrece diversas :ref:`opciones de personalización <website/themes/page-"
"layouts>` de temas para definir los :ref:`colores <website/themes/colors>`, "
"las :ref:`fuentes <website/themes/fonts>` y los :ref:`estilos de sombra "
"<website/themes/shadows>` del sitio web, así como la apariencia de "
":ref:`párrafos y encabezados <website/themes/paragraphs-headings>`, "
":ref:`botones <website/themes/button-styles>`, :ref:`enlaces <website/themes/"
"link-style>` y :ref:`campos de entrada <website/themes/input-fields>`. "
"También están disponibles :ref:`ajustes avanzados <website/themes/advanced>` "
"adicionales."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/web_design/themes.rst:12
msgid ""
"When setting up a website for the first time, you are prompted to select a "
"theme. Hover the mouse over the themes to see an extended preview of each "
"one. Click a theme to select it, or click the :guilabel:`View more themes` "
"button to display the full list of available themes."
msgstr ""
"La primera vez que configures un sitio web, el sistema te pedirá seleccionar "
"un tema. Coloca el cursor sobre cada tema para ver una vista previa "
"ampliada. Haz clic en el tema que quieras usar o en el botón :guilabel:`Ver "
"más temas` para ver la lista completa de temas disponibles."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/web_design/themes.rst:17
msgid ""
"If you leave without selecting a theme, the website is created with the "
"default theme."
msgstr ""
"Si sales sin seleccionar un tema, el sistema creará el sitio web con el tema "
"predeterminado."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/web_design/themes.rst:21
msgid ""
"To customize the theme, open the website editor, navigate to "
"the :guilabel:`Theme` tab, and go to the :guilabel:`Website` section. You "
"can:"
msgstr ""
"Para personalizar el tema, abre el editor del sitio web, ve a la "
"pestaña :guilabel:`Tema` y abre la sección :guilabel:`Sitio web`. Desde ahí "
"puedes:"

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/web_design/themes.rst:24
msgid ""
"Click :guilabel:`Switch Theme` to open the theme selector. Hover the mouse "
"over the themes to see an extended preview of each one. Click :guilabel:`Use "
"this theme` to apply it to the website."
msgstr ""
"Hacer clic en :guilabel:`Cambiar tema` para abrir el selector de temas. "
"Coloca el cursor sobre los temas para ver una vista previa ampliada de cada "
"uno. Haz clic en :guilabel:`Usar este tema` para aplicarlo al sitio web."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/web_design/themes.rst:26
msgid "Add a :doc:`language <../configuration/multi_website>` for the website."
msgstr ""
"Agregar un :doc:`idioma <../configuration/multi_website>` al sitio web."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/web_design/themes.rst:27
msgid ""
"Select the :guilabel:`Page Layout` to change the overall display and spacing "
"of building blocks and website elements on pages."
msgstr ""
"Seleccionar el :guilabel:`diseño de la página` para cambiar la distribución "
"general y el espaciado de los bloques de creación y de los elementos del "
"sitio web en las páginas."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/web_design/themes.rst:29
msgid "Customize the layout's background:"
msgstr "Personaliza el fondo del diseño:"

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/web_design/themes.rst:31
msgid "Choose a :guilabel:`Background` :ref:`color <website/themes/colors>`."
msgstr "Elige un :guilabel:`Fondo` de :ref:`color <website/themes/colors>`."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/web_design/themes.rst:32
msgid ""
"Add a background :ref:`image <website/elements/images>` "
"or :guilabel:`Replace` it. Then configure its :guilabel:`Position`:"
msgstr ""
"Agrega una :ref:`imagen <website/elements/images>` de fondo o haz clic en "
":guilabel:`Reemplazar`. Luego, configura su :guilabel:`Posición`:"

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/web_design/themes.rst:35
msgid ""
"Use the selected image as a :guilabel:`Cover` or in a :guilabel:`Repeat "
"Pattern`."
msgstr ""
"Usa la imagen seleccionada como :guilabel:`Portada` o en un "
":guilabel:`Patrón repetido`."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/web_design/themes.rst:36
msgid ""
"Click the :icon:`fa-arrows` (:guilabel:`Background Position`) icon to adjust "
"the image position, then click :guilabel:`Apply`."
msgstr ""
"Haz clic en el icono :icon:`fa-arrows` (:guilabel:`Posición del fondo`) para "
"ajustar la posición de la imagen y luego haz clic en :guilabel:`Aplicar`."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/web_design/themes.rst:39
msgid "Click :guilabel:`Save` to apply the changes to the website."
msgstr "Haz clic en :guilabel:`Guardar` para aplicar los cambios al sitio web."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/web_design/themes.rst:44
msgid "Colors"
msgstr "Colores"

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/web_design/themes.rst:46
msgid ""
"Odoo's website editor features two main types of colors: :ref:`theme colors "
"<website/themes/theme-colors>` and :ref:`status colors <website/themes/"
"status-colors>`. Click the color palette bar to open "
"the :guilabel:`Website / Colors` menu in the :guilabel:`Theme` tab."
msgstr ""
"El editor de sitios web de Odoo cuenta con dos tipos principales de colores: "
":ref:`colores del tema <website/themes/theme-colors>` y :ref:`colores de "
"estado <website/themes/status-colors>`. Haz clic en la barra de paleta de "
"colores para abrir el menú :guilabel:`Sitio web / Colores` en la pestaña "
":guilabel:`Tema`."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/web_design/themes.rst:53
msgid "Theme colors"
msgstr "Colores del tema"

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/web_design/themes.rst:55
msgid ""
"Theme colors refer to the set of colors displayed across all pages of the "
"website. They consist of five colors: three :guilabel:`Main` colors, used "
"mainly for buttons and links, and two :guilabel:`Light & Dark` colors, used "
"mainly for text and headings."
msgstr ""
"Los colores del tema corresponden al conjunto de colores que aparecen en "
"todas las páginas del sitio web. Incluyen cinco colores: tres "
"colores :guilabel:`principales`, que se usan sobre todo en botones y "
"enlaces, y dos colores :guilabel:`claro y oscuro`, que se usan sobre todo en "
"textos y encabezados."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/web_design/themes.rst:59
msgid "To customize the theme colors:"
msgstr "Para personalizar los colores del tema:"

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/web_design/themes.rst:61
msgid ""
"Click the color you want to change, then select a "
"predefined :guilabel:`Solid` color or click :guilabel:`Custom` to pick a "
"specific color tone manually (or add its #HEX or RGBA code). Click :icon:`fa-"
"trash` (:guilabel:`Reset`) to remove the color selection."
msgstr ""
"Haz clic en el color que quieras cambiar y selecciona un "
"color :guilabel:`sólido` predefinido o haz clic en :guilabel:`Personalizado` "
"para elegir un tono específico de forma manual (o agregar su código #HEX o "
"RGBA). Haz clic en :icon:`fa-trash` (:guilabel:`Restablecer`) para eliminar "
"la selección del color."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/web_design/themes.rst:64
msgid ""
"Click the paint palette icon and choose a color palette. As a result, all "
"color customizations are reset."
msgstr ""
"Haz clic en el icono de la paleta de pintura y elige una paleta de colores. "
"Esta acción restablece todas las personalizaciones de color."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/web_design/themes.rst:67
msgid ""
"Odoo automatically creates :guilabel:`Color Presets` for the chosen colors "
"or palette. These predefined color combinations are applied to various "
"elements of the website to create a structured and visually appealing "
"design. When selecting a color palette, its presets define how those colors "
"are distributed across different elements. To modify them, "
"click :guilabel:`Color Presets`, then select a preset to open the "
"customization dropdown. Each color preset contains colors for the building "
"block’s :guilabel:`Background`, :guilabel:`Text`, :guilabel:`Headings`, :guilabel:`Links`, :guilabel:`Primary "
"Buttons`, and :guilabel:`Secondary Buttons`."
msgstr ""
"Odoo crea :guilabel:`valores predeterminados de color` para los colores o la "
"paleta que elijas. Estas combinaciones de colores predefinidas se aplican a "
"varios elementos del sitio web para crear un diseño uniforme y llamativo. Al "
"seleccionar una paleta de colores, sus preajustes definen cómo se "
"distribuyen esos colores entre los distintos elementos. Para modificarlos, "
"haz clic en :guilabel:`Valores predeterminados de color` y selecciona uno "
"para abrir el menú de personalización. Cada valor predeterminado de color "
"incluye colores para el :guilabel:`fondo`, el :guilabel:`texto`, "
"los :guilabel:`encabezados`, los :guilabel:`enlaces`, los :guilabel:`botones "
"principales` y los :guilabel:`botones secundarios` del bloque de creación."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/web_design/themes.rst:76
msgid ""
"To apply a color preset to a building block, select the building block, go "
"to the :guilabel:`Style` tab, click the color dot located next "
"to :guilabel:`Background`, and choose a :guilabel:`Theme`."
msgstr ""
"Para aplicar un valor predeterminado de color a un bloque de creación, "
"selecciona el bloque, ve a la pestaña :guilabel:`Estilo`, haz clic en el "
"punto de color que aparece junto a :guilabel:`Fondo` y elige "
"un :guilabel:`tema`."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/web_design/themes.rst:81
msgid ""
"Changing a color preset automatically updates the colors of both the default "
"preset and the building blocks that use it."
msgstr ""
"Cambiar una configuración de color actualiza automáticamente los colores "
"tanto de la configuración predeterminada como de los bloques de construcción "
"que la usan."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/web_design/themes.rst:87
msgid "Status colors"
msgstr "Colores de estado"

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/web_design/themes.rst:89
msgid ""
"Status colors indicate the status of certain actions "
"(e.g., :guilabel:`Success`, :guilabel:`Warning`, etc.). They are used in pop-"
"up messages that appear to provide feedback to users and website visitors. "
"To customize the website's :guilabel:`Status Colors`, go to "
"the :guilabel:`Advanced` section and click the dots to change their color. "
"You can also configure :guilabel:`Grays`."
msgstr ""
"Los colores de estado indican el estado de ciertas acciones (por ejemplo, "
":guilabel:`Éxito`, :guilabel:`Advertencia`, etc.). Se utilizan en mensajes "
"emergentes que aparecen para brindar retroalimentación a los usuarios y "
"visitantes del sitio web. Para personalizar los :guilabel:`Colores de "
"estado` del sitio web, ve a la sección :guilabel:`Avanzado` y haz clic en "
"los puntos para cambiar su color. También puedes configurar los "
":guilabel:`Grises`."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/web_design/themes.rst:97
msgid ""
"Information related to a successful action on the website appears "
"in :icon:`oi-green-dot` green."
msgstr ""
"La información relacionada con una acción exitosa en el sitio web aparece "
"en :icon:`oi-green-dot` verde."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/web_design/themes.rst:0
msgid "Status color selection"
msgstr "Selección de un color de estado."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/web_design/themes.rst:0
msgid "Success pop-up"
msgstr "Ventana emergente \"Éxito\""

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/web_design/themes.rst:108
msgid "Fonts"
msgstr "Fuentes"

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/web_design/themes.rst:110
msgid ""
"Odoo allows you to customize the font family and font size of website "
"elements, including :ref:`paragraphs and headings <website/themes/paragraphs-"
"headings>`, :ref:`buttons <website/themes/button-styles>`, and :ref:`input "
"fields <website/themes/input-fields>`."
msgstr ""
"Odoo te permite personalizar la familia de fuentes y el tamaño de fuente de "
"los elementos del sitio web, incluidos :ref:`párrafos y encabezados <website/"
"themes/paragraphs-headings>`, :ref:`botones <website/themes/button-styles>` "
"y :ref:`campos de entrada <website/themes/input-fields>`."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/web_design/themes.rst:114
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Font Size`: In "
"the :guilabel:`Paragraph`, :guilabel:`Headings`, :guilabel:`Button`, "
"and :guilabel:`Input Fields` sections, use the :guilabel:`Font Size` field "
"to set a default size. Click the :icon:`fa-caret-right` (:guilabel:`Toggle "
"more options`) icon to expand the section and define custom sizes (e.g., "
"based on the heading level, button size, etc.)."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Tamaño de fuente`: en las "
"secciones :guilabel:`Párrafo`, :guilabel:`Encabezados`, :guilabel:`Botón` "
"y :guilabel:`Campos de entrada`, usa el campo :guilabel:`Tamaño de fuente` "
"para establecer un tamaño predeterminado. Haz clic en el icono :icon:`fa-"
"caret-right` (:guilabel:`Activar más opciones`) para expandir la sección y "
"definir tamaños personalizados (por ejemplo, según el nivel de encabezado, "
"tamaño del botón, etc.)."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/web_design/themes.rst:118
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Font Family`: In the :guilabel:`Paragraph`, :guilabel:`Headings`, "
"and :guilabel:`Button` sections, select a font from the dropdown menu."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Familia de la fuente`: Seleccione una fuente en el menú "
"desplegable de las secciones :guilabel:`Párrafo`, :guilabel:`Títulos` "
"y :guilabel:`Botón`."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/web_design/themes.rst:122
msgid ""
"When :guilabel:`System Fonts` is selected, Odoo uses the native fonts "
"already installed on the visitor's operating system. For example, Android "
"uses **Roboto** as its default system font."
msgstr ""
"Cuando se selecciona :guilabel:`Fuentes del sistema`, Odoo usa las fuentes "
"nativas ya instaladas en el sistema operativo del visitante. Por ejemplo, "
"Android usa **Roboto** como su fuente del sistema predeterminada."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/web_design/themes.rst:126
msgid "Custom fonts"
msgstr "Fuentes personalizadas"

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/web_design/themes.rst:128
msgid ""
"To add a custom font not available by default in Odoo, click "
"the :guilabel:`Font Family` dropdown and select :guilabel:`Add a Custom "
"Font` at the bottom. In the :guilabel:`Add a Google font or upload a custom "
"font` pop-up:"
msgstr ""
"Para agregar una fuente personalizada que no esté disponible de forma "
"predeterminada en Odoo, haz clic en el menú desplegable :guilabel:`Familia "
"de fuentes` y selecciona :guilabel:`Agregar una fuente personalizada` en la "
"parte inferior. En la ventana emergente :guilabel:`Agregar una fuente de "
"Google o cargar una fuente personalizada`:"

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/web_design/themes.rst:132
msgid ""
"To add a Google font, open the :guilabel:`Select a Google Font` dropdown and "
"select the desired font. Toggle off the :guilabel:`Serve font from Google "
"servers` if your website is operated from a location where regulations "
"require compliance with laws such as, but not limited to, the European "
"Union's GDPR. This will ensure the Google Font is stored on the website's "
"server rather than on Google's servers."
msgstr ""
"Para agregar una fuente de Google, abre el menú "
"desplegable :guilabel:`Seleccionar una fuente de Google` y selecciona la "
"fuente deseada. Desactiva :guilabel:`Servir fuente desde servidores de "
"Google` si tu sitio web opera desde una ubicación donde las regulaciones "
"requieren el cumplimiento de leyes como, entre otras, el RGPD de la Unión "
"Europea. Esto garantizará que la fuente de Google se almacene en el servidor "
"del sitio web en lugar del servidor de Google."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/web_design/themes.rst:137
msgid ""
"To upload a :guilabel:`Custom Font` from your computer, "
"click :guilabel:`Choose File`."
msgstr ""
"Para cargar una :guilabel:`Fuente personalizada` desde tu computadora, haz "
"clic en :guilabel:`Elegir archivo`."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/web_design/themes.rst:139
msgid "Once done, click :guilabel:`Save and Reload`."
msgstr "Una vez hecho, haz clic en :guilabel:`Guardar y recargar`."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/web_design/themes.rst:142
msgid ""
"A :guilabel:`Preview` of the selected font is displayed on the right side of "
"the window."
msgstr ""
"Se muestra una :guilabel:`Vista previa` de la fuente seleccionada en el lado "
"derecho de la ventana."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/web_design/themes.rst:145
msgid "Styles"
msgstr "Estilos"

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/web_design/themes.rst:147
msgid ""
"The appearance of website elements can be further customized. For example, "
"you can customize :ref:`paragraphs and headings <website/themes/paragraphs-"
"headings>`, :ref:`buttons <website/themes/button-styles>`, :ref:`links "
"<website/themes/link-style>`, and :ref:`input fields <website/themes/input-"
"fields>`."
msgstr ""
"La apariencia de los elementos del sitio web se puede personalizar aún más. "
"Por ejemplo, puedes personalizar :ref:`párrafos y encabezados <website/"
"themes/paragraphs-headings>`, :ref:`botones <website/themes/button-"
"styles>`, :ref:`enlaces <website/themes/link-style>` y :ref:`campos de "
"entrada <website/themes/input-fields>`."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/web_design/themes.rst:155
msgid "Paragraphs & headings"
msgstr "Párrafos y encabezados"

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/web_design/themes.rst:157
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`Paragraph` and :guilabel:`Headings` sections offer additional "
"styling options for these text elements. You can:"
msgstr ""
"Las secciones :guilabel:`Párrafo` y :guilabel:`Encabezados` ofrecen opciones "
"de estilo adicionales para estos elementos de texto. Puedes:"

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/web_design/themes.rst:160
#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/web_design/themes.rst:177
#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/web_design/themes.rst:211
msgid "Modify the :ref:`font settings <website/themes/fonts>`."
msgstr "Modificar la :ref:`configuración de fuentes <website/themes/fonts>`."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/web_design/themes.rst:161
msgid ""
"Adjust the :guilabel:`Line Height` to define the spacing between lines of "
"text."
msgstr ""
"Ajustar la :guilabel:`Altura de línea` para definir el espaciado entre "
"líneas de texto."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/web_design/themes.rst:162
msgid ""
"Adjust :guilabel:`Margins` to define the spacing around paragraphs and "
"headings."
msgstr ""
"Ajustar los :guilabel:`Márgenes` para definir el espaciado alrededor de "
"párrafos y encabezados."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/web_design/themes.rst:169
msgid ""
"To customize the style of the website's primary and secondary buttons, "
"navigate to the :guilabel:`Button` section and edit the relevant options:"
msgstr ""
"Para personalizar el estilo de los botones primarios y secundarios del sitio "
"web, navega a la sección :guilabel:`Botón` y edita las opciones relevantes:"

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/web_design/themes.rst:172
msgid ""
"Open the :icon:`fa-caret-down` dropdown menu next to the :guilabel:`Primary "
"Style` or :guilabel:`Secondary Style` fields to change the style for each "
"button type, such as :guilabel:`Fill`, :guilabel:`Outline`, "
"or :guilabel:`Flat`. When selecting :guilabel:`Outline`, "
"the :guilabel:`Border Width` option appears below, allowing you to adjust "
"the width of the button's outline."
msgstr ""
"Abre el menú desplegable :icon:`fa-caret-down` junto a los "
"campos :guilabel:`Estilo primario` o :guilabel:`Estilo secundario` para "
"cambiar el estilo de cada tipo de botón, "
"como :guilabel:`Relleno`, :guilabel:`Contorno` o :guilabel:`Plano`. Al "
"seleccionar :guilabel:`Contorno`, aparece la opción :guilabel:`Ancho del "
"borde` debajo, lo que te permite ajustar el ancho del contorno del botón."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/web_design/themes.rst:178
msgid ""
"Adjust the :guilabel:`Padding` to change the spacing around the buttons' "
"labels."
msgstr ""
"Ajusta el :guilabel:`Padding` para cambiar el espaciado alrededor de las "
"etiquetas de los botones."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/web_design/themes.rst:179
msgid ""
"Use the :guilabel:`Round Corners` option to adjust the buttons' border "
"radius."
msgstr ""
"Usa la opción :guilabel:`Round Corners` para ajustar el radio del borde de "
"los botones."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/web_design/themes.rst:180
msgid ""
"Add an animation when a button is clicked in the :guilabel:`On Click Effect` "
"dropdown menu."
msgstr ""
"Seleccione la animación que se activará al hacer clic en el botón desde el "
"menú desplegable :guilabel:`Efecto al hacer clic`."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/web_design/themes.rst:None
msgid "Primary and secondary buttons"
msgstr "Botones primarios y secundarios"

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/web_design/themes.rst:186
msgid ""
"To define custom :guilabel:`Small` and :guilabel:`Large` sizes for the "
"buttons' :guilabel:`Padding`, :guilabel:`Font Size`, and :guilabel:`Round "
"Corners`, click the :icon:`fa-caret-right` (:guilabel:`Toggle more options`) "
"icon, then use the related fields."
msgstr ""
"Para definir tamaños personalizados :guilabel:`Small` y :guilabel:`Large` "
"para el :guilabel:`Padding`, :guilabel:`Font Size` y :guilabel:`Round "
"Corners` de los botones, haz clic en el ícono :icon:`fa-caret-right` "
"(:guilabel:`Toggle more options`) y luego usa los campos relacionados."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/web_design/themes.rst:195
msgid ""
"In the :guilabel:`Link` section, open the :icon:`fa-caret-down` dropdown "
"menu next to :guilabel:`Link Style` to choose the appearance of links on the "
"website. You can choose between:"
msgstr ""
"En la sección :guilabel:`Link`, abre el menú desplegable :icon:`fa-caret-"
"down` junto a :guilabel:`Link Style` para elegir la apariencia de los "
"enlaces en el sitio web. Puedes elegir entre:"

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/web_design/themes.rst:198
msgid ":guilabel:`No Underline`;"
msgstr ":guilabel:`No Underline`;"

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/web_design/themes.rst:199
msgid ":guilabel:`Underline On Hover`; or"
msgstr ":guilabel:`Underline On Hover`; o"

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/web_design/themes.rst:200
msgid ":guilabel:`Always Underline`."
msgstr ":guilabel:`Always Underline`."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/web_design/themes.rst:205
msgid "Input fields"
msgstr "Campos de entrada"

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/web_design/themes.rst:207
msgid ""
"To customize the style of the website's input fields, navigate to "
"the :guilabel:`Input Fields` section and edit the relevant options:"
msgstr ""
"Para personalizar el estilo de los campos de entrada del sitio web, navega a "
"la sección :guilabel:`Input Fields` y edita las opciones relevantes:"

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/web_design/themes.rst:210
msgid "Adjust the :guilabel:`Padding` to change the spacing around the fields."
msgstr ""
"Ajusta el :guilabel:`Padding` para cambiar el espaciado alrededor de los "
"campos."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/web_design/themes.rst:212
msgid "Customize the :guilabel:`Border Width` around fields."
msgstr "Personaliza el :guilabel:`Border Width` alrededor de los campos."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/web_design/themes.rst:213
msgid "Define a :guilabel:`Border Radius` to round the fields' corners."
msgstr ""
"Define un :guilabel:`Border Radius` para redondear las esquinas de los "
"campos."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/web_design/themes.rst:214
msgid ""
"Choose a :guilabel:`Background` :ref:`color <website/themes/colors>` to fill "
"the fields."
msgstr ""
"Elige un :guilabel:`Background` :ref:`color <website/themes/colors>` para "
"rellenar los campos."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/web_design/themes.rst:219
