#~ ":guilabel:`301 Moved Permanently`: for permanent redirections of "
#~ "unpublished or deleted :ref:`static pages <website/pages/page_type>`. The "
#~ "new URL is shown in search engine results, and the redirect is cached by "
#~ "browsers."
#~ msgstr ""
